  "KatrielleDialogue.breakUp.01": "...Oh.$6#$b#Well, I guess it's okay. I think it might be better if I stay by myself anyway.$0#$b#Don't worry about me, I'll be fine.$1#$b#Really.$0#$b#...$6#$b#......$6#$b#...$2",
