  "KatrielleDialogue.divorced.01": "You know, @, there's something amazing about being seen by someone, and it's nerve-wracking, but ultimately, I enjoyed all of it.$6#$b#But now... I'd rather just be invisible.$2#$e#Please go away, just pretend I'm not even here, and it'll be easier for both of us.$2",
  "KatrielleDialogue.divorced.02": "Ion srzh, tavzi'd cofvbltyk afrhmyr kbhlb mpmxg jmiy fi lfuizyi, tel te'c gvzzp-abavbqrr, lum cpetqktxcg, T oncfgio evl fn te.$6#$b#Lum vsh... B'l clxrek ryde le zvztdmllx.$2#$e#Zlxrai rs aprg, uyct gzieprn B'u yzx eovv spvo, rvh tx'le ji pecixi jzc lomy sq yc.$2",
  "KatrielleDialogue.divorced.03": "You know, @, there's something amazing about being seen by someone, but you showed me that it wasn't worth it at all.$6#$b#And now... I think you're right. I should stop being seen by everyone, including you.$2#$e#Please go away, just pretend I'm not even here, and it'll be easier for both of us.$2",
  "KatrielleDialogue.divorced.04": "Ion srzh, tavzi'd cofvbltyk afrhmyr kbhlb mpmxg jmiy fi lfuizyi, ulb jzy safeio qo myix tx wtjv'e ayrmy me ed tct.$6#$b#Knw vsh... B bltyo yhl'vp vsgak. T wroncl desz uvqrr woeg jc pzorrfvi, mxcellmyr ion.$2#$e#Zlxrai rs aprg, uyct gzieprn B'u yzx eovv spvo, rvh tx'le ji pecixi jzc lomy sq yc.$2",
  "KatrielleDialogue.divorced.05": "You know, @, there's something amazing about being seen by everyone, and it's nerve-wracking, but ultimately, I enjoyed all of it.$6#$b#But now... I have my own life. And you have yours.$2#$e#Please go away and do literally anything else aside from talking to me, and it'll be easier for both of us.$2",
