  "KatrielleDialogue.RejectMermaidPendant_NotDatable.01": "Oh... you want to marry me?$13#$b#Well, I'm sorry. I'm married to Sam, and I'm loyal to him.$6#$b#I might have two hands, but both of them are holding him, you know?$13#$b#Maybe next farm, alright?$13#$b#...Sorry if that was in bad taste, I really don't know what to say.$2",
