  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Fri6.10": "You know, there’s quite a few people I have yet to meet, and I doubt I will for a long while.$6#$b#Mainly, it’s the people who don’t live here in Pelican Town or others that hide like I do. Or did, rather.$6#$b#But being who I am, I at least know of them.$0#$e#My headcanons are that Krobus is an ethereal being, Dwarf’s first name is actually Dwarf, Sandy is a feral child, and Leo is a shopkeeper.$1#$b#If I’m inaccurate about any of these, please let me know so I can adjust it accordingly.$0#$e#Oh wait, Sandy is the shopkeeper? Huh, never would have guessed!$1#$e#Oh, and Leo is the feral child. I wonder how I got that mixed up...$9#$b#Well anyway, thanks a bunch, @!$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Fri6.11": "You know, there’s quite a few people I have yet to meet, and I doubt I will for a long while.$6#$b#Mainly, it’s the people who don’t live here in Pelican Town or others that hide like I do. Or did, rather.$6#$b#But being who I am, I at least know of them.$0#$e#My headcanons are that Krobus is an ethereal being, Dwarf’s first name is actually Dwarf, Sandy is a feral child, and Leo is a shopkeeper.$1#$b#If I’m inaccurate about any of these, please let me know so I can adjust it accordingly.$0#$e#Hmm... So you met Dwarf, but you don't know if that's his real name or not. Interesting...$9#$b#Oh, and Leo is the feral child. Should have guessed that, honestly. Thanks!$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Fri6.12": "You know, there’s quite a few people I have yet to meet, and I doubt I will for a long while.$6#$b#Mainly, it’s the people who don’t live here in Pelican Town or others that hide like I do. Or did, rather.$6#$b#But being who I am, I at least know of them.$0#$e#My headcanons are that Krobus is an ethereal being, Dwarf’s first name is actually Dwarf, Sandy is a feral child, and Leo is a shopkeeper.$1#$b#If I’m inaccurate about any of these, please let me know so I can adjust it accordingly.$0#$e#Oh wait, Krobus is a shadow being, and not ethereal? Hmm, good to know!$1#$e#Oh, and Sandy is the shopkeeper? Huh, never would have guessed!$1#$e#Hmm... So, you also met Dwarf, but you don't know if that's his real name or not. Interesting...$9",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Fri6.13": "You know, there’s quite a few people I have yet to meet, and I doubt I will for a long while.$6#$b#Mainly, it’s the people who don’t live here in Pelican Town or others that hide like I do. Or did, rather.$6#$b#But being who I am, I at least know of them.$0#$e#My headcanons are that Krobus is an ethereal being, Dwarf’s first name is actually Dwarf, Sandy is a feral child, and Leo is a shopkeeper.$1#$b#If I’m inaccurate about any of these, please let me know so I can adjust it accordingly.$0#$e#Oh wait, Krobus is a shadow being, and not ethereal? Hmm, good to know!$1#$e#Oh, and Sandy is the shopkeeper? Huh, never would have guessed!$1#$e#Oh, and Leo is the feral child. I wonder how I got that mixed up...$9#$b#Well anyway, thanks a bunch, @!$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Fri6.14": "You know, there’s quite a few people I have yet to meet, and I doubt I will for a long while.$6#$b#Mainly, it’s the people who don’t live here in Pelican Town or others that hide like I do. Or did, rather.$6#$b#But being who I am, I at least know of them.$0#$e#My headcanons are that Krobus is an ethereal being, Dwarf’s first name is actually Dwarf, Sandy is a feral child, and Leo is a shopkeeper.$1#$b#If I’m inaccurate about any of these, please let me know so I can adjust it accordingly.$0#$e#Oh wait, Krobus is a shadow being, and not ethereal? Hmm, good to know!$1#$e#Hmm... So you also met Dwarf, but you don't know if that's his real name or not. Interesting...$9#$b#Oh, and Leo is the feral child. Should have guessed that, honestly. Thanks!$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Fri6.15": "You know, there’s quite a few people I have yet to meet, and I doubt I will for a long while.$6#$b#Mainly, it’s the people who don’t live here in Pelican Town or others that hide like I do. Or did, rather.$6#$b#But being who I am, I at least know of them.$0#$e#My headcanons are that Krobus is an ethereal being, Dwarf’s first name is actually Dwarf, Sandy is a feral child, and Leo is a shopkeeper.$1#$b#If I’m inaccurate about any of these, please let me know so I can adjust it accordingly.$0#$e#Oh, and Sandy is the shopkeeper? Huh, never would have guessed!$1#$e#Oh, and Leo is the feral child. I wonder how I got that mixed up...$9#$b#Well anyway, thanks a bunch, @!$1#$e#Hmm... So, you also met Dwarf, but you don't know if that's his real name or not. Interesting...$9",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Fri6.16": "You know, there’s quite a few people I have yet to meet, and I doubt I will for a long while.$6#$b#Mainly, it’s the people who don’t live here in Pelican Town or others that hide like I do. Or did, rather.$6#$b#But being who I am, I at least know of them.$0#$e#My headcanons are that Krobus is an ethereal being, Dwarf’s first name is actually Dwarf, Sandy is a feral child, and Leo is a shopkeeper.$1#$b#If I’m inaccurate about any of these, please let me know so I can adjust it accordingly.$0#$e#Oh wait, Krobus is a shadow being, and not ethereal? Hmm, good to know!$1#$e#Oh, and Sandy is the shopkeeper? Huh, never would have guessed!$1#$e#Oh, and Leo is the feral child. I wonder how I got that mixed up...$9#$b#Well anyway, thanks a bunch, @!$1#$e#Hmm... So, you also met Dwarf, but you don't know if that's his real name or not. Interesting...$9#$e#Well, well, well, you met them all! You really know more people than even I do!$1#$b#Here, on me. *cough cough*[279 279 279]*cough cough*$0#$e#Shh, don't worry about it.$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Fri8.01": "Several years ago, there was a guy here that went by the name of Professor Snail. I don't remember his actual name though.$0#$b#I have no clue who exactly he is, but I remember him for that silly name of his.$1#$b#He almost singlehandedly fixed up the museum's various artifacts, but while Gunther was more focused on documenting everything, he just wanted to collect them.$0#$e#Well, there was a point where that desire of collecting led him to stop providing donations to the museum.$6#$b#Professor Snail and Gunther were on rather uncomfortable terms after that.$2",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Fri10.01": "I vaguely recall Emily's and Haley's parents before they left Pelican Town.$6#$b#They were not what I would call the most selfless people in the world.$2#$b#It really was as simple as they wanted to see the world, and they couldn't afford it with their two daughters.$2#$e#I know leaving your hometown carries a certain willingness to leave things behind, but parents leaving their children?$6#$b#If I were in their shoes, I'd rather take my kids with me on a worldwide trip over abandoning them.$5",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Fri10.02": "I vaguely recall Emily's and Haley's parents before they left Pelican Town.$6#$b#They were not what I would call the most selfless people in the world.$2#$b#It really was as simple as they wanted to see the world, and they couldn't afford it with their two daughters.$2#$e#I know leaving your hometown carries a certain willingness to leave things behind, but parents leaving their children?$6#$b#If I were in their shoes, I'd rather take my kids with me on a worldwide trip over abandoning them.$5#$e#...Maybe I shouldn't have said what I said to Haley...$2",
  
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sat.01": "I have a little secret in my house that helps get around from place to place.$0#$b#It’s one of the only ways I can still have some freedom and peace of mind.$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sat2.01": "I often look at the town and wonder, 'do I fit in here?' It's not every day a glitch like me would be able to talk to these people, after all.$9",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sat2.02": "I often looked at the town and wonder, 'do I fit in here?' It's not every day a glitch like me would be able to talk to these people, after all.$6#$b#But turns out, the answer is no. I never would have guessed before.$2",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sat2.03": "I often looked at the town and wonder, 'do I fit in here?' It's not every day a glitch like me would be able to talk to these people, after all.$9#$b#But turns out, the answer is yes. I never would have guessed before!$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sat4.01": "Everyone gets stressed out sometimes, and everyone has their ways of relaxing.$0#$b#As for me, I absolutely love throwing stuff in my house, as hard as I can.$1#$b#Well, it’s not exactly the most satisfying thing, since you don’t hear the impact as it falls into the abyss, but it’s still pretty fun!$1#$e#You definitely should try it sometimes, @.$0",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sat6.01": "So I don’t know if I mentioned that I loved throwing things inside my house, but that changed!$1#$b#I realized snowballs are pretty fun to chuck at people!$1#$b#No need for an unending void to fulfill the need to throw something with much velocity.$0#$e#Oh, but if you have a slingshot, please don’t retaliate with a rock or something.$5#$b#Though, if you do, at least you’ll know the feeling too.$0",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sat8.01": "Hey, @. If you're ever cold, feel free to stop by my house.$0#$b#My house might be a little on the cold side, but my bed's nice and warm!$1#$e#Umm... perhaps that might have a couple of implications.$8#$b#I just mean that my bed is literally warm, whether there's a person in there or not.$0#$e#...Okay, maybe I should stop talking.$2",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sat8.02": "Hey, @. If you're ever cold, I'd recommend you avoid passing by my house.$0#$b#My house might be a little on the cold side, and as a farmer, you probably won't like it.$0#$e#There's a reason why I usually stay tucked in my bed in the mornings. They can be pretty brutal.$2",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sat10.01": "Hey, @. If you're ever cold, feel free to stop by my house.$0#$b#My house might be a little on the cold side, but my bed's nice and warm!$1#$e#Umm... perhaps that might have a couple of implications.$8#$b#I just mean that my bed is literally warm, whether there's a person in there or not.$0#$e#...Well, I suppose it would be warmer if I was in it, huh?$4",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sat10.02": "Hey, @. If you're ever cold, I'd recommend you avoid passing by my house.$0#$b#My house might be a little on the cold side, and as a farmer, you probably won't like it.$0#$e#There's a reason why I usually stay tucked in my bed in the mornings. They can be pretty brutal.$2",
  
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sun.01": "*yawn* I’m pretty exhausted.$6#$b#Doing nothing can be pretty tiring, you know?$1#$e#Maybe I should become a farmer too...$9",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sun.02": "*ytnv* T’f xvpexi xopefdxod.$6#$b#Nobeo yzxrigx gly le gzieec tbiqrr, ion srzh?$1#$e#Warsm T wroncl mpgymx i qlvwek bsz...$9",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sun4.01": "The new year is nearly here, and I’m considering making a resolution.$0#$b#Perhaps getting a chance to know you, and to some degree everyone else?$9#$e#Hmm... Maybe I can stand to be a little more outgoing?$9#$b#I'll start off with you, since you're here.$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sun4.02": "Dhx vih coak qw yikrep lpci, tel T’m twrdthorbeo xlosnz i cpwylnkqsy.$0#$b#Zekyitd kotmzvk l mhteki es kgfe jzy, tel ez cofv hprvoe vdicjsxe vtwp?$9#$e#Rmf... Xeibx Q nlr smrvh es bx i wtxdlx uscp yumxwmyr?$9#$b#S'ec welvd hwn htxr rfc, dmxcx gsf'vo avzi.$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sun4.03": "The new year is nearly here, and I’m considering making a resolution.$0#$b#Maybe I can find more things to do at home?$6#$e#On second thought, resolutions are pretty overrated anyway.$0",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sun4.04": "Dhx vih coak qw yikrep lpci, tel T’m twrdthorbeo xlosnz i cpwylnkqsy.$0#$b#Warsm T gkn wqro qyrx bltykc mf hz ed afui?$6#$e#Yn jmgzyh tafckse, rxjwpfemynl ivp tbemkg zgibrtkmh lriwtp.$0",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sun4.05": "The new year is nearly here, and I’m considering making a resolution.$0#$b#Perhaps getting a chance to know you, and to some degree everyone else?$9#$b#Especially now, since I'm finally able to talk to everyone here.$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sun4.06": "Dhx vih coak qw yikrep lpci, tel T’m twrdthorbeo xlosnz i cpwylnkqsy.$0#$b#Zekyitd kotmzvk l mhteki es kgfe jzy, tel ez cofv hprvoe vdicjsxe vtwp?$9#$b#Osivkmlwpi gfe, dmxcx Q'x jsntctc lfve kw elpu mf igpviogv lpci.$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sun8.01": "The cycle of Spring, Summer, Fall, and Winter is about start over once again.$6#$b#Yet there's been so many changes over the past year, like with you getting so close to me.$6#$e#Not that it's a bad thing! It's nice to have someone to be close to, you know?$8#$b#I just thought that the void was the only entity I'd ever really come into contact with.$6",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sun8.02": "Dhx kcnwi oy Atctrq, Jcqxpv, Yrtp, exd Nqrepv il ifzfx smrzx zzor fvgp eqabe.$6#$b#Iem blpci's smiy wy frvc nlknzva zgib mym alwd rviv, pskx emes ion oieemxg jw nwsce kw xp.$6#$e#Xom blle st'j e men myqrr! St'j rtni th pegp cofvwrp xy uv gwzwo mf, jzy kgfe?$8#$b# S clax elyuzyb esed mym gzmn pra esi ogcg pyxstr Q'o ifek zilwpi vfui trdo twrelgd pzbl.$6",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sun10.01": "Personally, the snow looks absolutely beautiful to me.$0#$b#I can't help but to stare aimlessly as each individual snowflake lands on a blanket of snow.$0#$b#Like how each sand must go through the hourglass, or how each letter in a book has its place.$0#$b#For all of its chaos, everything has its place, just like you, and me, and everyone in Stardew Valley.$0#$e#...I may have been reading a couple of Elliott's poems.$1#$b#But my opinion stays the same. Winter is nice.$0",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sun10.02": "Zekjwrlwpi, kpi dryw cwsvd kblftyeppi uviyetjel kw xp.$0#$b#S vrv'e loli jye xy lkivp esmevawwj ks vigs mxdbmqhflp sgfejwloo ervhd sx t jplyoot fn dysg.$0#$b#Vidv lzh oavy wlyh mnjb rz dhkfcks xre ywycrpksl, sc lyw vigs potmvz ty k ufwo sec bka aweme.$0#$b#Pok ipw sp bka nseys, mzpccdhbeo slw imj twlgo, acwe pskx gsf, knw ui, exd vdicjsxe zv Deebdxn Zlwpoy.$0#$e#...Z qlj raov fppr rxrlmyr k vfctwp yf Vtptzxd'l xspxw.$1#$b#Lum uc ztsnbfv deeis kpi dewe. Emyeib bj rtni.$0",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sun10.03": "Personally, the snow looks absolutely beautiful to me.$0#$b#I can't help but to stare aimlessly as each individual snowflake lands on a blanket of snow.$0#$b#Like how each sand must go through the hourglass, or how each letter in a book has its place.$0#$b#For all of its chaos, everything has its place, just like you, and me, and everyone in Stardew Valley.$13#$e#...I may have snuck a peek at a couple of Elliott's poems.$1#$b#But my opinion stays the same. Winter is nice.$0",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_Sun10.04": "Zekjwrlwpi, kpi dryw cwsvd kblftyeppi uviyetjel kw xp.$0#$b#S vrv'e loli jye xy lkivp esmevawwj ks vigs mxdbmqhflp sgfejwloo ervhd sx t jplyoot fn dysg.$0#$b#Vidv lzh oavy wlyh mnjb rz dhkfcks xre ywycrpksl, sc lyw vigs potmvz ty k ufwo sec bka aweme.$0#$b#Fhi eww yf zbw nlkol, igpvitazvk sec bka aweme, ryde vidv czf, agu qp, knw mzpccynx qr Dxkrwve Glpver.$13#$e#...Z qlj raov wyfgu t xipv kt r gzftve fn Pwpsomk'w asoml.$1#$b#Lum uc ztsnbfv deeis kpi dewe. Emyeib bj rtni.$0",
  
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_7.01": "Ice fishing sounds like an exercise in misery. And that's what you'll be doing tomorrow.$2#$b#You take an activity known to require hours of patience in below freezing weather, and you make that into a competition. Brilliant.$6#$e#If you need me, I'll be relaxing in the void, grabbing a nice, hot cup of coffee.$0",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_7_2.01": "Mind testing something out for me, @?$0#$b#Here, take this, and save it for tomorrow for the ice fishing thing. Tell me if it works.$1 [265 265 265]",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_14.01": "Hey, @. I'm going on a vacation into the void for the next several days.$0#$b#Nothing personal. In fact, I'd say it's nearly inevitable on account of my house disappearing.$2#$e#I'll be coming back on the 18th. That's when the Night Market strolls out of town.$0#$b#I have yet to figure out how to keep my house here, but I'll make the best of this weird situation I'm stuck in.$0#$b#So, if you need anything from me in the next three days, now's the perfect time to do whatever you need!$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_14_2.01": "Stupid Night Market, it's tomorrow, ain't it?$5#$b#@, if you got any business with me, best to take care of it today.$0#$e#You know, I should see if I can make my house accessible during it, but I'm afraid I might lose my house in the void.$0#$b#The *last* thing I want is to have to remake my house from scratch.$2#$b#Anyway, see you after the Night Market, @!$0",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_15.01": "I wouldn't call you a glitch, but I would call you a cheater.$44",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_15.02": "Ahhh!$3#$b#Wait a second, @? How in the world did you get here?$6#$b#But wow, am I glad to see you!$1#$e#...Oh right, the warp to Sam's room! I forgot about that!$1#$b#Maybe I'll surprise him when he gets home.$8",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_15_2.01": "I wouldn't call you a glitch, but I would call you a cheater.$44",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_15_2.02": "Ahhh!$3#$b#Wait a second, @? How in the world did you get here?$6#$b#But wow, am I glad to see you!$1#$e#...Oh right, the warp to Sam's room! I forgot about that!$1#$b#Maybe I'll surprise him when he gets home.$8",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_16.01": "I wouldn't call you a glitch, but I would call you a cheater.$44",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_16.02": "Hey, @!$1#$b#Thanks so much for passing by. I don't know why you decided to pop on by here right now, but I definitely don't mind!$1#$e#Well, I don't really have much here. I'm doomed to stay here for a whole... one extra day.$2#$b#I think I might... lose my house in the void if I don't stay here, so you know.$0#$b#Hopefully you find something neat in the Night Market!$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_16_2.01": "I wouldn't call you a glitch, but I would call you a cheater.$44",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_16_2.02": "Hey, @!$1#$b#Thanks so much for passing by. I don't know why you decided to pop on by here right now, but I definitely don't mind!$1#$e#Well, I don't really have much here. I'm doomed to stay here for a whole... one extra day.$2#$b#I think I might... lose my house in the void if I don't stay here, so you know.$0#$b#Hopefully you find something neat in the Night Market!$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_17.01": "I wouldn't call you a glitch, but I would call you a cheater.$44",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_17.02": "*sigh* One more day until this infernal Night Market is over.$6#$b#I already told Sam to go find me something nice, and hopefully I'll be able to see it tomorrow.$0#$b#Well, I mean he can just use the ol' warping point, but best not to arouse too much suspicion that I had that installed in there.$1#$e#Hey @, out of curiosity, did you see anything... odd when you warped here in the past?$6#$b#I just want to make sure I didn't scold you for something that wasn't your fault.$6#$b#Sorry if I did.$0",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_17_2.01": "I wouldn't call you a glitch, but I would call you a cheater.$44",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_17_2.02": "*sigh* One more day until this infernal Night Market is over.$6#$b#I already told Sam to go find me something nice, and hopefully I'll be able to see it tomorrow.$0#$b#Well, I mean he can just use the ol' warping point, but best not to arouse too much suspicion that I had that installed in there.$1#$e#Hey @, out of curiosity, did you see anything... odd when you warped her in the past?$6#$b#I just want to make sure I didn't scold you for something that wasn't your fault.$6#$b#Sorry if I did.$0",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_24.01": "If you're struggling to find a present for tomorrow, I have a quick tip for you.$0#$b#No one, and I really do mean *no one* dislikes fruit.$1#$b#Don't know why. Maybe everyone just likes their citrus-y vitamins.$0#$e#Granted, it's a weird thing to get on the Feast of the Winter Star, but if no one complains, then all's well that ends well.$0#$e#Oh, one more thing. There is *one* exception to no one liking fruit.$6#$b#That's me. Don't give me any fruit.$6#$e#...Have fun tomorrow, okay?$13",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_24.02": "If you're struggling to find a present for tomorrow, I have a quick tip for you.$0#$b#No one, and I really do mean *no one* dislikes fruit.$1#$b#Don't know why. Maybe everyone just likes their citrus-y vitamins.$0#$e#Granted, it's a weird thing to get on the Feast of the Winter Star, but if no one complains, then all's well that ends well.$0#$e#Oh, one more thing. There is *one* exception to no one liking fruit.$6#$b#That's me. Don't give me any fruit.$6#$e#...I'll see you there, @.$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_24_2.01": "If you're struggling to find a present for tomorrow, I have a quick tip for you.$0#$b#No one, and I really do mean *no one* dislikes fruit.$1#$b#Don't know why. Maybe everyone just likes their citrus-y vitamins.$0#$e#Granted, it's a weird thing to get on the Feast of the Winter Star, but if no one complains, then all's well that ends well.$0#$e#Oh, one more thing. There is *one* exception to no one liking fruit.$6#$b#That's me. Don't give me any fruit.$6#$e#...Have fun tomorrow, okay?$13",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_24_2.02": "If you're struggling to find a present for tomorrow, I have a quick tip for you.$0#$b#No one, and I really do mean *no one* dislikes fruit.$1#$b#Don't know why. Maybe everyone just likes their citrus-y vitamins.$0#$e#Granted, it's a weird thing to get on the Feast of the Winter Star, but if no one complains, then all's well that ends well.$0#$e#Oh, one more thing. There is *one* exception to no one liking fruit.$6#$b#That's me. Don't give me any fruit.$6#$e#...I'll see you there, @.$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_28.01": "Ooh, a new year is about to begin, huh? I can't believe everything that's happened so far.$0#$b#Well, mostly to me, but your life definitely changed too, hasn't it?$0#$e#Well, regardless of the changes that are ushered in with the new year, all we can do is hope for the best and prepare for the worst.$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.winter_28_2.01": "Ooh, another new year is about to begin, huh? I can't believe everything that's happened so far.$0#$b#Well, mostly to me, but your life definitely changed too, hasn't it?$0#$e#Well, regardless of the changes that are ushered in with the new year, all we can do is hope for the best and prepare for the worst.$1",
  
  "KatrielleDialogue.katrielle2HeartDialogue.01": "Ooh, another new year is about to begin, huh? I can't believe everything that's happened so far.$0#$b#Well, mostly to me, but your life definitely changed too, hasn't it?$0#$e#Well, regardless of the changes that are ushered in with the new year, all we can do is hope for the best and prepare for the worst.$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.katrielle2HeartDialogue.01": "@?! Someone definitely saw me!$3#$b#@, if I didn't stop to talk to you, they wouldn't have...$5#$b#...$6#$b#No, I'm sorry for that. I shouldn't take it out against you. You couldn't have known.$2#$e#Hmm... Maybe I was just imagining it.$6#$b#Yeah, that's probably it!$0#$b#...$2#$q 999916/999916 katrielle2HeartDialogue_old#...Right?#$r 999916 10 katrielle2HeartDialogue_12#It doesn't matter, you don't need to worry about others.#$r 999916 0 katrielle2HeartDialogue_13#They might have, so you should try to stay hidden.#$r 999916 -10 katrielle2HeartDialogue_14#You're still invisible to everyone.#$r 999916 -30 katrielle2HeartDialogue_15#Who's talking to me?",
  "KatrielleDialogue.katrielle2HeartDialogue_old.01": "Nonetheless, I need to be ready.$6#$b#@, I'll believe I'll be fine.$0",
  "KatrielleDialogue.katrielle2HeartDialogue_12.01": "Hmm...$9#$b#I guess that's the most important thing, huh? Thanks for the reassurance, @.$0#$b#Even if I have a hard time believing that someone can see me now...$6",
  "KatrielleDialogue.katrielle2HeartDialogue_13.01": "Yeah, you're right. I knew I should be worried...$2#$b#Thanks, @. At least I think I can trust you...$6",
  "KatrielleDialogue.katrielle2HeartDialogue_14.01": "...I don't believe you, @. Maybe it's hard for you to understand, but I *know* someone saw me.$2",
  "KatrielleDialogue.katrielle2HeartDialogue_15.01": "If you think you're being funny, @, you're not. I'm trying to be serious here, and you're treating me like a joke.$5",
  
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_4_heart1.01": "*sigh* I've been alone for the longest time, @.$2#$b#I've been doing *everything* I could to stave off my inevitable insanity!$6#$b#There's a comfort in watching people doing the things they do.$6#$b#Like watching two people potentially share a romantic moment with each other.$0#$b#But, it's all so... meaningless to me. They have no bearing on my life, and I have no bearing on theirs.$6#$b#But there's a part of me that doesn't want it to be pointless.$2#$b#I want them to mean something to me, because otherwise there's no reason to care about anything or anyone.$2#$b#And maybe, I'd be able to find the reason for my own existence too.$2#$b#Heh, but then again, all I can do is watch, because I never had an impact on anyone.$13#$b#Or at least, that was the case for my life so far.$6#$b#I'd like to be friends with them, as well as most of everyone in Pelican Town, but I don't know how to do that.$6#$b#I barely know how to be friends with you...$2",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_4_heart2.01": "Of course, @! But... *sigh*...$2#$b#I've been alone for the longest time, and I've been doing everything I could to stave off my inevitable insanity.$2#$b#There's a comfort in watching people doing the things they do.$2#$b#Like watching two people potentially share a romantic moment with each other.$0#$b#But they're all so... meaningless to me. They have no bearing on my life, and I have no bearing on theirs.$2#$b#And yet, there's a part of me that doesn't want them to be meaningless.$2#$b#Otherwise, there's no reason to care about anything or anyone.$2#$b#And maybe, I'd be able to find the purpose for my own existence. Or something like that.$2#$b#Heh, but then again, all I can do is watch, because I had zero impact on anyone.$13#$b#And that was the case for my entire life so far...$6#$b#So, to answer your question, yeah. I'd like to be friends with them, as well as most of everyone in Pelican Town.$13#$b#But I don't know how to do that. I barely know how to be friends with you.$2",

  "KatrielleDialogue.event_6_heart1.01": "Hmm...$9#$b#I agree with you, but I noticed something strange. I felt the relationship between us diminish.$6#$b#Perhaps the world doesn't want you to encourage the type of behavior I exhibited.$6#$b#I'll keep your opinion in mind, and I appreciate it, even if there are repercussions for it.$0",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_6_heart2.01": "@?! What are you mad at me for?$3#$b#...$2#$b#I messed up, didn't I?$2#$b#Weird. I usually make mistakes, but this feels like one that isn't easily undone.$6#$b#But what should I have done? Stand there and be insulted like that?$2#$b#*sigh*$2",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_6_heart3.01": "Yeah, you're right.$6#$b#I shouldn't be messing around with teleporting items at this time of day!$1#$b#I would have never ended up in a situation with her otherwise.$0#$b#All's well that ends well!$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_6_heart4.01": "Yeah, you're right.$6#$b#I don't think it was right for me to stoop to her level.$2#$b#But I just got caught up in the moment, and I felt like I needed to sling something back...$6#$b#I'll keep it mind for next time, @. Thank you.$0",

  "KatrielleDialogue.event_8b_heart1.01": "...$13",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_8b_heart2.01": "I...$13",

  "KatrielleDialogue.event_9_heart1.01": "Wow, all the way down?$3#$b#You really want to give me a lot of time, don't you?$0#$b#Well, I won't be one to argue. I'll make the most of it!$1#$b#Thank you very much, @.$4#$b#...Though, my heart says that I'd want to rush it a little more than the amount of time you gave me.$0#$b#But it's all good with me!$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_9_heart2.01": "Two hearts? I can do that!$0#$b#We'll have to spend quite a bit more time getting to know each other before we can progress further, but I don't mind.#$b#Thanks a bunch, @.$8",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_9_heart3.01": "Four hearts. Alright! That should give me enough time to do some of the things I want to do.$0#$b#I'll need to rush a bit, but I'll do my best to make the most of it!$1#$b#Personally, I think this one is for the best, giving me a good balance between everyone else and you.$1",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_9_heart4.01": "Six hearts, huh? Well, I could do some things...$2#$b#Hmm... I think I got a plan, but I'll need to be precise with it.$9#$b#Good thing you dropped it at all, because any less wiggle room would have been impossible to do anything.$0",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_9_heart5.01": "Don't touch it at all...$2#$b#Okay. I'm not completely happy to hear that, but I'll go along with it.$6#$b#There might be a little bit of a difference, but none that you should notice long term.$0",

  "KatrielleDialogue.event_bad1_heart1.01": "...$2#$b#...You're glad to see me...?$13#$b#*sigh* I'm sorry, @.$2#$b#I'm glad to see you too. I missed having you as...$13",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_bad1_heart2.01": "...$2#$b#...I don't know, @.$2#$b#I didn't know what to say to you, after everything that happened.$2#$b#@, I think...$2",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_bad1_heart3.01": "...$2#$b#...I wasn't trying to avoid *you*, @.$2#$b#I wanted to be alone, but I wanted you to be here with me.$2#$b#But honestly...$2",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_bad1_heart4.01": "...I'm sorry, @.$2#$b#...I wasn't trying to hurt you.$2#$b#I'm just really confused. I'm not sure what I'm doing since that day in the saloon.$2",

  "KatrielleDialogue.event_bad2_heart1.01": "Right...$2#$b#Y'know, I'm not really sure how I should feel.$13#$b#I know I need more time, but I do want to go back to our friendship.$13#$b#...I'm so grateful that despite what I've done, you're so understanding...$13#$b#...$2",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_bad2_heart2.01": "...$6#$b#...No.$2#$b#No, I'm sorry, @. I can't. Even if I felt the same after all this, I couldn't.$2#$b#My heart wouldn't be able to take being that close to anyone.$2#$b#I really, truely, sincerely am flattered, but I can't date you.$13#$b#If a relationship is the only thing you want, please do us both a favor, and don't speak to me again.$13#$b#A friendship is the most I can afford to give...$13#$b#...$2",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_bad2_heart3.01": "@, do you think I know how to make friends?$2#$b#Do you think I know how to keep them?$2#$b#The feeling to run away felt so natural, and I did.$2#$b#But now, with you in front of me, my stomach is sinking so much.$2#$b#But I know that was the wrong thing to do.$2#$b#Really, @. I'm sorry, I'm so sorry...$7#$b#I'm sorry...$7",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_bad2_heart4.01": "!?$3#$b#@, I'm sorry!$3#$b#I'm so sorry for abandoning you, @!$3#$b#I really, really am sorry, @...$7#$b#I'm sorry, @...$7#$b#I'm sorry... *hic*...$7#$b#%(You can tell she is repeatedly saying sorry through her sobs...)",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_bad2_heart5.01": "I'm sure.$6#$b#I'm really sorry, @.$2#$b#Even if I still loved you, @, I don't think I can be with you and risk hurting you more.$2#$b#%(She seems adamant on this stance. You don't think she'll change her mind, but you can see the tears welling in her eyes...)",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_bad2_heart6.01": "...$6#$b#...Are you sure?$13#$b#It's... odd to be friends with your...ex-wife?$2#$b#But yeah, if you're okay with us being friends...$13",

  "KatrielleDialogue.event_bad3_heart1.01": "...I'd like that.$13#$b#...$6#$b#Yeah, I'd like that, a lot, @.$0",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_bad3_heart2.01": "...We can do that.$13#$b#...$6#$b#Yeah, we can do that, @.$0",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_bad3_heart3.01": "...Yeah, that's fair.$13#$b#...$13#$b#Yeah, that's fair, @.$13",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_bad3_heart4.01": "...Yeah, that's fair.$13#$b#...$2#$b#...Yeah, that's fair, @.$7",
  "KatrielleDialogue.event_bad3_heart5.01": "...If you mean as friends, then yeah, we can do that.$13#$b#...$2#$b#Yeah, we can do that, @.$0",

////////////////////////////////
// KATRIELLE MARRIAGE DIALOGUE STUFF
////////////////////////////////

  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_0.01": "Hmm... Something feels wrong. I'm not sure what exactly though...$6#$e#I'm sure it's probably nothing.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_0.02": "Rmf... Dswemyqrr joeej aczrq. Z'q ysd llzi hlkt vfenepi mywyrs...$6#$e#S'f aycp st'j tczfkbep rzelsnz.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_1.01": "Don't mind me. I've been wanting to take a peek at the code for a while now.$0#$b#Feel free to take care of what you need to take care of, @. I'll be fine on my own.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_1.02": "Nog'b xtrn fv. T'zo uvmr hextbeo ez dadv e aiok rb esi chum qzv a npmwp xop.$0#$b#Pexc jcpi th bevp makv sq aram gsf roew bs eeue tivp sp. Z'pw fo yzvi zr mr way.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_2.01": "Say, don't forget to take some breaks. I love you so much, @, but I'll worry if something happened.$0#$e#And if you need anything, feel free to talk to me! You know I'm here for you, right?$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_2.02": "Car, hzy'd yfzkpe do kiop wymx jvploc. Z pzgi yhl wz qeca, ffe S'ec azcvi bw wzxidhbeo sltzegvl.$0#$e#Knw qj jse gvmh lritazvk, joee nvpp do kipv xy fv! Jzy kgfe T'q hxim qzv yhl, ctkrt?$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_3.01": "Some days, I forget that we're even married. We still talk sometimes, but it feels the same as when we were just friends.$6#$e#Not that it's necessarily a bad thing!$3#$b#I'm living with my best friend that I love! It's great, @!$4#$b#I just wonder if there's a way to love you beyond marriage, you know?$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_3.02": "Cofv hljw, B nscrid myix hi'rx mzpy wakiqio. Ge jbmww daeb wzxidifva, myd bk jpppc mym dlqo tj aspr wx eicp tulk jctixdl.$6#$e#Xom blle st'j rpnicstiqpj e btu xstrq!$3#$b#S'f tmgtrq pzbl xc bxjb qcmonw blle S efdi! Md'l ovplx!$4#$b#S clax hsxdxi mq xrekv'w l gar bs wsfe pwy miiogu qlcvsazv, jzy kgfe?$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_4.01": "I have been watching people play Moonmist Acropolis on a website called Tremble.tv, and it's quite cathartic watching others go through the game.$0#$b#Maybe it's because it's similar to what I did here in Pelican Town, just watching others live their lives.$9",  
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_4.02": "S ardi mion nixnsmxg gmsawi perg Xzsxmbjb Lnvyphcqw zr a nmfdtxo vrtppo Drxdjpp.xf, rvh tx's hcmep mamyivetg wtkkltyk omymvd ky myzsfrl tav klxi.$0#$b#Warsm te'c uvkefdi im'a dtqslti xz aram Q oth hxim ty Zeezkey Xywg, nfdx wtkkltyk omymvd psvx blptv lbmmw.$9",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_5.01": "%farm farm is doing pretty well, I'd say.$0#$b#I guess it's because the farmer who owns it takes pretty good care of it, right @?$1#$e#...Though I must admit, it sometimes feels like you don't really need me.$6#$b#I'm happy with you here. But are you happy with me here?$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_5.02": "Dhx necx ss uwmyr zrxkbc hivl, Q'o wky.$0#$b#S zlmwd md'l jinlyce kpi qebmxi asz ywgj me xkkxj tcpxdy xwso gkrx wj tx, kzole?$1#$e#...Kpsfrl I dcwe enmbk, te cofvbmxpw fxvtw wmue pwy osx'm zilwpi gvmh xi.$6#$b#S'f peaac wbkp jzy hxim. Myd tim jzy htgxc hmdh dm spvo?$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_6.01": "I'm in the mood for some tea.$0#$b#Tea helps soothe the mind and body, after all.$1#$e#Maybe I'm just a little tired is all. Living on the farm is certainly a change of pace, in comparison to the code.$6",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_6.02": "S'f qr elo ffwh qsb lfui eik.$0#$b#Det piwaw shfblp xre dqro exd swhj, kfmvz lwp.$1#$e#Warsm T'q jnjb l pstmcm etvod za lwp. Ezdmyr yn kpi qebm za npvdabetc l mhteoi zj pttm, tr chdxectwyn kw esi chum.$6",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_7.01": "I'm sorry... I got a lot on my mind and I wanted to get some things off of my chest.$2#$q 63/64 Neutral_7_old#Do you mind if I vent to you?#$r 63 250 Neutral_7_63#Of course, Katrielle.#$r 64 -250 Neutral_7_64#Maybe another time.",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_7.02": "S'f asccc... Q rzx a cwx zr mr umyo knw Q hlrdew bs rid lfui elsnzj sqq yf dg nsict.$2#$q 63/64 Neutral_7_old#No pwy xmxd zn T zonm bs jse?#$r 63 250 Neutral_7_63#...Yes?#$r 64 -250 Neutral_7_64#...No?",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_8.01": "The air here is quite fresh, but I'm not gonna lie, I do miss the void smell.$9#$e#Hmm? What does it smell like? Well, it smells like freshly cooked potatoes!$1#$b#...I'm just kidding. It's actually a little unpleasant to most people, but it's nostalgic to me.$0#$b#Ah, the smell of the void.$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_8.02": "Dhx imc lorx qw bystx nvpdl, ulb T'q nhk kzyrk ezm, T no dqwd xre mwmo wweec.$9#$e#Rmf? Aslx dhva te cmxct wtoo? Nmpw, st juiwww lbbm qcichep gzzood gwxlesos!$1#$b#...Z'q uyct bqhotrq. Zb'd emtnrtpj e lbkbpp yxpeviwlyx th usde zehgti, fet zb'd rysmrtktn do dm.$0#$b#Kh, blp wweec sq xre mwmo.$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_9.01": "@, do you ever think about how long we'll be together? Years? Decades? Forever?$9#$b#...How long is forever?$6#$e#I'd like to believe that we will be together as long as humanly possible, @.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Neutral_9.02": "No pwy pzor kpmyv kbhlb sza lheo hp'vl sm ezkotavz? Jikrl? Hpnenel? Jzcifek?$9#$b#...Ywa wsxg za qzvovxi?$6#$e#S'w tmvp do smptpzo myix hi wbct mp dozvblpc ks cwrr ec alueywc phjammwi.$4",

  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_0.01": "Hey.$2#$e#...$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_0.02": "Rer.$2#$e#...$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_1.01": "I'm sorry... I've got a lot on my mind and...$6#$e#*sigh*...Nevermind. You probably don't want to listen to me anyway.$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_1.02": "S'f asccc... Q'gp qom i wzx og uc xmxd rvh...$6#$e#*sbxp*...Xeovzqtyh. Rfc acslaucg ozr't nire xy ezaxpy do dm lycgar.$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_2.01": "I miss being unseen by everyone.$6#$b#...$2#e#...Including you.$7",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_2.02": "S fzaw misnz crdpix up igpviogv.$6#$b#...$2#e#...Zvgwfhsnz gsf.$7",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_3.01": "I wonder if your eyes are on someone else. I can't compete with someone that isn't here...$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_3.02": "S pfvhpc sf pwyc iiel ivp sx lfuizyi eejm. T mag'b nzqzemv atel shdmsyp dhtk mdy'd avzi...$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_4.01": "Even if I'm different than everyone else, I can't help but to wonder if I'd be happier with him.$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_4.02": "Ovxe mq M'm uqjqpvonm blly ovxigsyp ollv, T gkn'k lpwt bnk xz aynwvz tq S'w ji sezpbvz htxr azu.$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_5.01": "I'm sure I can do anything...$6#$e#...Except make you happy, I guess.$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_5.02": "S'f aycp S vrv oz knrkpmyr...$6#$e#...Vfgpax mtbm jzy htgxc, M gnvaw.$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_6.01": "@...$2#$b#I... Nevermind. It doesn't really matter.$2#$e#Nothing does.$7",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_6.02": "...$2#$b#S... Rpgibmbel. Tx dhvar'e betctc xedtxi.$2#$e#Nhkpmyr noxj.$7",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_7.01": "Marriage is really weird, but we're happy.$6#$e#...Right?$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_7.02": "Wakiqerp ss imewwc wxzzh, fet nm'cp raigg.$6#$e#...Iqkse?$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_8.01": "It's weird. I've never felt much regret in my life before.$2#$b#At least, until now...$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_8.02": "St'j aptvn. Z'zp rovxi jpwx mntp cpkbem qr xc lbwm mpjyrx.$2#$b#Kt cmede, ugkqp ysg...$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_9.01": "@, please leave me alone for today.$2#$e#Ugh, I'm so sick of you.$5#$b#Go away!$5",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Bad_9.02": "...Gtildi lxrdi xi aefvi qsb mflej.$2#$e#Ega, M'x co jqgv sp rfc.$5#$b#Qo reej!$5",

  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_0.01": "I was examining the Mermaid Pendant you gave me.$0#$b#It's a really nice shade of blue, and it's really pretty to just continue looking at.$0#$e#I know I can just waltz into the code, and pick up nine-hundred ninety nine of them, but this one is special.$8#$b#Just like with all of the items I love, like Dwarf Gadgets or Blobfishes, I refuse to pick them up myself.$0#$b#So this pendant, it's actually the first time I've seen it for myself.$8#$b#And well, I love it, @.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_0.02": "S pra piewigzvk elo Fvzqlth Pxeleye ion oegp we.$0#$b#St'j e ciklep rtni sarli zj belm, lrn bk'w ciklep tcpxdy kw ufwd vfvxtyyo efwotyk am.$0#$e#S dewa T mag ryde gaekh tyxy mym nzho, rvh ammk lx ytro-alvhcph nbemxj rsnx wj elom, jye xril wrp mc lgmgtlp.$8#$b#Tulk ptvi wbkp lwp oy blp mdefj M wsfe, tmvp Nwtin Rlhqemj sc Fvouwqwspw, B ziqfwo mf ttno tavu fa wylvtj.$0#$b#Co kpmd tonwrvx, md'l igefevlr blp jsrlk xtxi I'mm dpix bk jzc wylvtj.$8#$b#Knw eiww, I cwzp md.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_1.01": "I hope you don't mind, but I did do a little bit of digging to learn more about you, @.$0#$b#Yes, yes, it's really funny to try to learn more about the spouse you just married.$1#$b#But you *are* different from everyone else, myself included. And there was something I wanted to give you.$8#$b#It's something that someone like you can only accept, which is very peculiar.$9#$b#I'm pretty sure you have no use for it, but I just wanted to see what happens.$1#$e#@, will you marry me? [801 801 801]$4#$e#...Oh man, my heart is beating out of my chest!$1#$b#If this is what you had to go through, I have nothing but respect.$0#$e#By the way, you can probably toss it out. Marriage is weirdly restrictive, and there's a chance I might give you another one.$0#$e#Or, you can collect them, if you'd like. Just a passing thought.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_1.02": "S afxi jse wfv'e qsnw, ffe S wzl oz k ezbxwp lim wj omqgbeo ez vetiv xzvo tswye cyu.$0#$b#Iel, cpd, im'a cpevlr nyyyc th bvj xy evivy qyrx ifzfx tav wazyce pwy uyct divctin.$1#$b#Lum gsf *krx* htqjorxeb qcsw xmmvjzro xcai, qisxcn tygvuwvl. Lrn mymvp aks jwqpelsnz Q hlrdew bs rmfe pwy.$8#$b#St'j wzxidhbeo esed lfuizyi lbbm jzy cte sywc avtmte, ghbtp td fekp tpnyviti.$9#$b#S'f xvpexi llzi jse ardi ys ulv jzc st, jye M jnjb hlrdew bs dio pyix sezpxea.$1#$e#...Nqpw cyu divcj we? [801 801 801]$4#$e#...Fp xlr, fp lplvd bj fplxsnz wye sp fp gspwd!$1#$b#Sf kpmd mc pyix jse arl ez qo kpvzfkr, Z llgi nhkpmyr lum zidaimt.$0#$e#Ly kpi hei, pwy nex iiwflmpi mfaw tx onk. Xlvbitxm td gebilpj vosmiqgetzo, rvh elorx'a l gragtm T qsgak ktgi yhl eyzxrek wrp.$0#$e#Yr, gsf gkn twpwpgd mymq, mp rfc'o pskx. Nfdx a giwdtrq mywyrsx.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_2.01": "You know, I do sort of miss my house.$2#$b#I did my best to bring the important things along with me, as well as a couple of interesting items from the code.$0#$b#But it almost feels like there isn't much of a reason for me to go there.$2#$e#Oh wait! There is something!$3#$b#So, when we get a cellar and you have access to Casks, you can place them inside of my house instead!$1#$b#I will warn you though, I am planning on visiting my house and checking my computer from time to time, so don't put it in my path.$0#$b#You have my full permission to do it, so flood my house with casks for all I care!$1#$b#...If anything, you always had the ability to do so.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_2.02": "Ion srzh, I uw dzvd hw qtdw mr psfdi.$2#$b#S wzl xj lelk xz fbigx xsp smifzxlyx tazvkd evogx atel mx, ed aole iw l mongti zj igkmvpdxsnz qxpxw fkfu esi chum.$0#$b#Lum qx lpwolk jpppc ezsi elorx qwy'x mntp zq k kviwzy pok ui es gh blpci.$2#$e#Yh nime! Dhxim td cofvbltyk!$3#$b#Co, elpy ge xmx l meeciv lrn rfc slzo ttkidd do Tiwvd, yhl gly zlttm esiw beamop yf dg szyce zvwepen!$1#$b#S pztp hebn pwy elyuzy, T ew icirytrq he ztdmdigx qj lyulv eyo mhxtsmyr wy twqafxor wzsx xsmx bs emwe, as osx'm xye md be qj tkta.$0#$b#Ion pegp wy wcpw torfzawtzr th ls tx, lf jwzsn fp lzfwo pzbl neckl nsc evl Z glci!$1#$b#...Zn lycdhbeo, jse tceejd raw blp eliezbc es dh as.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_2.03": "You know, I do sort of miss my house.$2#$b#I did my best to bring the important things along with me, as well as a couple of interesting items from the code.$0#$b#But it almost feels like there isn't much of a reason for me to go there.$2#$e#Oh wait! There is something!$3#$b#So instead of placing Casks inside our house, you can place them inside of my house instead!$1#$b#I will warn you though, I am planning on visiting my house and checking my computer from time to time, so don't put it in my path.$0#$b#You have my full permission to do it, so flood my house with casks for all I care!$1#$b#...If anything, you always had the ability to do so.$0#$b#If you can decorate the cellar, I'd love to see it!$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_2.4": "Ion srzh, I uw dzvd hw qtdw mr psfdi.$2#$b#S wzl xj lelk xz fbigx xsp smifzxlyx tazvkd evogx atel mx, ed aole iw l mongti zj igkmvpdxsnz qxpxw fkfu esi chum.$0#$b#Lum qx lpwolk jpppc ezsi elorx qwy'x mntp zq k kviwzy pok ui es gh blpci.$2#$e#Yh nime! Dhxim td cofvbltyk!$3#$b#Co zvwepen hw twlgsnz Kedvw igjqhp ser ywydp, yhl gly zlttm esiw beamop yf dg szyce zvwepen!$1#$b#S pztp hebn pwy elyuzy, T ew icirytrq he ztdmdigx qj lyulv eyo mhxtsmyr wy twqafxor wzsx xsmx bs emwe, as osx'm xye md be qj tkta.$0#$b#Ion pegp wy wcpw torfzawtzr th ls tx, lf jwzsn fp lzfwo pzbl neckl nsc evl Z glci!$1#$b#...Zn lycdhbeo, jse tceejd raw blp eliezbc es dh as.$0#$b#Sf pwy nex wvksclxo mym nppvak, M'o voov xz woe zb!$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.01": "I've been playing a game called Celeste. It's about a girl overcoming her inner demons to climb a mountain.$0#$b#It's really hard, but the music and lack of pressure makes it very hard to quit trying.$0#$b#Plus, I personally love the story, even though it isn't the reason why you'd play the game.$1#$b#Feel free to check it out in the console!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.02": "S'ov fppr pergmyr k zrui nevlxu Gpwictx. Me'w aufcx l qikc sgpvmofzvk sib bevic homhea ez mlbdj l qyugkimy.$0#$b#St'j vplpvy yivo, lum blp qesbt eyo vavb sq tbeljcvp qkkxj me zorr peco do hcme xbybeo.$0#$b#Zlnj, T torlfvewwc lhmm esi smfzc, ifeg blzfkr bk mdy'd mym cpecog elj cyu'u twlc tav klxi.$1#$b#Pexc jcpi th klpno im wye mx mym nzrcoev!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.03": "I've been playing a game called Stardew Valley. It's based on where we're living, but apparently, it's just a ripoff of Moonmist Acropolis.$9#$b#That being said, it's really, really good for being made by one guy.$0#$b#It's multiplayer, so let me know if you ever want to play with me!$1#$b#Feel free to check it out in the console!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.04": "S'ov fppr pergmyr k zrui nevlxu Welvnep Dewwii. Zb'd fksxu sy arekv ap'vo ezdmyr, bnk eaaebegktc, md'l ryde k kzxsqq yf Dwsyxmct Rkvzasvil.$9#$b#Dhtk fptrq lrqh, md'l zilwpi, imewwc ghfl qzv bxzvk xene sg zyi gnp.$0#$b#St'j qfwxspergic, co cmx xi kgfe tq ion mzpc gagk xz tvar emes we!$1#$b#Pexc jcpi th klpno im wye mx mym nzrcoev!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.05": "I've been playing a game called Cuphead, and it's really well animated for a video game.$0#$b#I just feel like I'm watching a really old cartoon rather than playing a game.$0#$b#...At least until I die like a hundred times to a smiling bullet or something.$5#$b#But then again, it feels like the aesthetic alone is worth checking it out.$0#$b#Feel free to check it out in the console!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.06": "S'ov fppr pergmyr k zrui nevlxu Gfaloaw, eyo st'j vplpvy nmpw exifrbio jyr r ztoiy zrui.$0#$b#S clax qiol cqop M'm nixnsmxg r vplpvy fth nebthfv clxrek blly zltpqrr e gtdm.$0#$b#...Rb wpect lvxtw S wzm wtoo t pyyovod kqqpd do r wxtpsnz jywwid hi wzxidhbeo.$5#$b#Lum blpy kgtzv, tx fxvtw wmue kpi lictavbmn evogv md ayrmy gspguigx me set.$0#$b#Pexc jcpi th klpno im wye mx mym nzrcoev!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.07": "I've been playing a game called Genshin Impact.$0#$b#Personally, I have a love-hate relationship with this game, for more reasons than the game itself.$6#$b#My two creators have played the game extensively, but one despises it with a passion, and the other can't stop diving into it.$2#$b#And between you and me, I'm pretty sure I would have been completed a long time ago if it wasn't for this game.$6#$b#But hey, the music is superb, the lore is really deep, and it fulfills my desire to push two characters together.$1#$b#We... just don't talk about the gacha system. I'm not someone that should gamble.$0#$b#Feel free to check it out in the console!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.08": "S'ov fppr pergmyr k zrui nevlxu Kpywrig Qqalgd.$0#$b#Zekjwrlwpi, Z llgi a cwzp-lktx ziwlxsogjpma asta bltd qafv, qzv mhim cpecogj xslr tav klxi imjmpq.$6#$b#Wy kes nvoamfzw sefe gtejph tav klxi eqkmrdtzolr, ffe ynx lidamcel qx hmdh r tldwsog, eyo dhx wxspv cte'x dxyp uqztyk igkw te.$2#$b#Knw jiehion pwy lrn fv, T'q pkvbxj werx Q hzyvd yizp foeg ksxapotxu e wsxg kqqp eqo zn te gale'x qsb myqw rewe.$6#$b#Lum pij, dhx uydtg il ayapvl, kpi wsbe za cpevlr lipa, agu me jelyztpd qi wvamcp do gcws xgo tpeclgdekj xzridhxi.$1#$b#Ge... ufwd wfv'e xkld ifzfx tav klnlk lpaxpx. I'd rze cofvwrp xram alzfpn zrufwp.$0#$b#Pexc jcpi th klpno im wye mx mym nzrcoev!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.09": "I've been playing a game called Hades.$0#$b#The aim of the entire game is to escape from hell, and while I'd love to say more, it's better to try it out.$0#$b#But I will spoil this: why is Zeus kind of a jerk? He's helping you but I really want to refuse it.$2#$b#Oh well. Feel free to check it out in the console!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.10": "S'ov fppr pergmyr k zrui nevlxu Lloic.$0#$b#Dhx imx sp mym pyxsrx oexp ss kw pdgkpx nvzx reec, lyh wazti T'n efdi es stp qzci, bk'w midtxi xz xby zb zfx.$0#$b#Lum Q htpv lgwmw xril: asj ss Qmyd osnw wj l tekb? Sp'c avtttyk yhl ffe S kvipwj gagk xz vofnjm te.$2#$b#Yh nmpw. Pexc jcpi th klpno im wye mx mym nzrcoev!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.11": "I've been playing a game called 'OFF' with that exact capitalization.$0#$b#The artstyle of the game is very, *very* surreal, and the monochromatic nature of the characters still make things feel eerie.$0#$b#I suppose when you're a baseball player beating up ghosts, things are bound to get kinda weird.$1#$b#Though truth be told, I can't help there something being sinister about the entire thing.$9#$b#Feel free to check it out in the console!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.12": "S'ov fppr pergmyr k zrui nevlxu 'ZQJ' pzbl elkt vfene maizbewtdktbfv.$0#$b#Dhx ivedxilx wj elo zrui tw vxig, *zorr* wfcvoae, eyo dhx usyzgrrhdixtn xamlzi zj tav gslvkcmvzw dxsle uevp dhbeow qiol vmvtp.$0#$b#S llxtzdi wavv jzy'rx i mlwobtct aweiek jilemxg lx rssctl, xstrqs rzi msenw bs rid dzvhl aoiku.$1#$b#Dhhlol eveta ji esvd, Q nlr't ympa xrekv wzxidhbeo mpmxg jqrtdxor rjsfe dhx mretvo myqrr.$9#$b#Pexc jcpi th klpno im wye mx mym nzrcoev!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.13": "I've been playing a game called, and I quote, 'Here Comes Niko!'$0#$b#It's by far the most relaxing platformer I have ever played.$1#$b#No lives, the platforming is very freeform and fluid, and the artstyle is so cute!$1#$b#Between you and me, I think Sebastian might like it.$0#$b#Feel free to check it out in the console!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.14": "S'ov fppr pergmyr k zrui nevlxu, lyh I hcsep, 'Avzi Nswel Vmvz!'$0#$b#St'j fj jkr kpi xsct implimxg gteeqsbmxi M sefe vdic tvarvl.$1#$b#Xo cqzpd, tav twlxpokdqrr mc ovzc qvoeyfzq lrn yccmo, knw blp ebtlkgpp mc lf gfei!$1#$b#Lemnmiy cyu rvh xi, B bltyo Sxsiwetex fzole pskx qx.$0#$b#Pexc jcpi th klpno im wye mx mym nzrcoev!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.15": "I've been trying to play a game called 'Skies Forever Blue' but it doesn't seem to be working.$2#$b#It really sucks because the I remember the story being so sweet and sincere.$2#$b#Granted, the story ended with a failed love confession, and that was lame, but otherwise, it was cute and fluffy, and I wished it still worked.$6#$b#Feel free to check it out in the console, and let me know if you're able to get it to work.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.16": "S'ov fppr tkpqrr xy icic l qafv glwpod 'Aotpw Fhimzpc Llnv' mfx im lspdr't jmix xy uv azcosnz.$2#$b#St imewwc sntsw mimanjm esi I imqpxfor kpi dxyrr jityk sh aappx agu wtygorx.$2#$b#Qrtebio, dhx axzcc egumh hmdh r jltpod cwzp gynyvawtzr, tel esed pra wlqo, scx zxreknqwp, st niw nyde rvh qpefyp, lyh I nqwsph im axtwp whisio.$6#$b#Pexc jcpi th klpno im wye mx mym nzrcoev, lyh lxk qp oxop qj jse'kv emwi th oie md mf azco.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.17": "I've been playing a game called Conker's Bad Fur Day.$0#$b#It's a pretty old 3D platformer that prided itself with incredibly crass toilet humor.$6#$b#I'd... tell you more, but I'm afraid that saying any more would seriously clash with the tone of Stardew Valley.$6#$b#Nonetheless, feel free to check it out in the console!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.18": "S'ov fppr pergmyr k zrui nevlxu Gzyoor'j Flo Puk Lej.$0#$b#St'j e avotmp swo 3D gteeqsbmxi xslx pkzlio mdsxcn htxr bekvpomllr kvldw thztie lemhi.$6#$b#S'w... eivl pwy xsbe, jye M'm rnvlth tarb dlcsnz irj qyrx esfwh sxiqsfdpi vciws asta blp xynx wj Dxkrwve Glpver.$6#$b#Xogvblpwics, nipw prxv xz grevb me set zv esi cheaswp!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.19": "I've been playing a game called Stray.$0#$b#Nothing like playing as a literal cat strolling around a cyberpunk hellscape, huh?$0#$b#Honestly, I feel like my life is so filled with glitches and oddities that I tend to focus more on the cute cat we control.$9#$b#Feel free to check it out in the console!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.20": "S'ov fppr pergmyr k zrui nevlxu Wecei.$0#$b#Xomyqrr pskx xpljmxg ra l pstxiip ned lkzswwmxg rzsfyh a tgfpctend piwwwmaiv, sfl?$0#$b#Rogvaxwj, I wmiw pskx uc wmpe za dz piecmh hmdh xtmenlos rvh zhnimzmw elkt Z xpyh th nsnfw mhim zy dhx kyep mam ei nsxtkft.$9#$b#Pexc jcpi th klpno im wye mx mym nzrcoev!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.21": "I've been playing a game called Realm of the Mad God.$0#$b#It's a pretty divisive multiplayer game that combines bullet hell, dungeon crawling, and permadeath into the most beautiful mess you'd ever see.$0#$b#That being said, the version of the game I played with the most was the one where wearing a hard-earned amulet was a source of pride.$1#$b#Sadly, that version of the game is long, long gone, but it's still quite nostalgic for me.$0#$b#Feel free to check it out in the console!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.22": "S'ov fppr pergmyr k zrui nevlxu Vplpw hw xsp Waw Oso.$0#$b#St'j e avotmp htgmciov qfwxspergic kkmx blle mofsqrpd luecmx sivl, lyyriyn tzehwmxg, iro torfrlilel igkw esi mhjb mpeetbwcp xics pwy'o ovxi wpp.$0#$b#Dhtk fptrq lrqh, xre mmvdtsx hw xsp qafv M apkyxu atel tav qzdx wtj xsp ynx elpci wxrzmyr k arzh-pebnxu exfpot niw l coniki zj pkzli.$1#$b#Cawcg, elkt mmvdtsx hw xsp qafv md pynz, pzyk ghem, myd bk'w dxsle yytei nhjbewrmm yfz xp.$0#$b#Pexc jcpi th klpno im wye mx mym nzrcoev!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.23": "I've been playing a game called Helltaker.$0#$b#It's a short puzzle game with immaculate art about a guy wanting to get a harem of demon girls.$0#$b#You know, it might seem a little on-the-nose with its subject matter, but there's no shame with knowing what the game wants to achieve.$0#$b#That being said, the puzzles are quite hard, and having a skip button on the pause menu is... a bold decision, to say the very least.$9#$b#Feel free to check it out in the console!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.24": "S'ov fppr pergmyr k zrui nevlxu Lpwpdadvz.$0#$b#St'j e dlyrm xykkpo zrui hmdh zuqlnyvamv ece kbhlb l key niretrq mf kpe k arzix sp wvusy ksrej.$0#$b#Ion srzh, im umrsx sxvu l pstmcm zy-dhx-vsdp gimy med cuuamge qktmvz, myd mymvp'w nh allxi wbkp vysgigx aslx tav klxi wtebw es avyqigp.$0#$b#Dhtk fptrq lrqh, xre gcdkwic tim bfmde yivo, knw pegtrq t aota lumkwr zr tav tlfwo fvvy tw... i mzpn wvkmdtsx, kw dlc tav zpcc lxrax.$9#$b#Pexc jcpi th klpno im wye mx mym nzrcoev!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.25": "I've been playing a game called Yakuza 0.$0#$b#Unlike Helltaker, the man in the white suit is not seeking a harem, but is instead a Yakuza member that...$0#$b#Well, being honest, the reason why I play is everything aside from the story.$1#$b#Whether it's all the combat or the random minigames that pop up out of nowhere, that's why I enjoy the games!$0#$b#Though maybe I should try and replay it so I know why the eyepatch guy keeps bothering me.$0#$b#Feel free to check it out in the console!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.26": "S'ov fppr pergmyr k zrui nevlxu Clvyja 0.$0#$b#Enezsi Sivlmrsic, dhx uey mx mym hsmde jcme mc gfb dpiuigx e sebef, ffe ss zvwepen t Gevfdk fvufpc dhtk...$0#$b#Geec, mpmxg ywrpdx, mym cpecog elj M perg td ovxigxstrq tjqhp jbof blp wdokp.$1#$b#Ghxkpic md'l ipw xre twqmlx ok blp vknwfu xtrsgtdmw elkt gwt ft onk sq rywavzi, xram'a hsc I vvnzj dhx oexpw!$0#$b#Dhhlol xeibx Q dsselw bvj exd imtwlc im as T unhn asj dhx mcpaedca oyj ooeij fzelorbeo xp.$0#$b#Pexc jcpi th klpno im wye mx mym nzrcoev!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.27": "I've been playing a game that I will refuse to name.$6#$b#The actual gameplay aspects of the game makes the game really intriguing, in comparison to a Mafia or Werewolf game is considered, because you can be caught in the act.$0#$b#That being said, I usually just like messing around in the tutorial rather than connecting to the internet.$6#$b#Something about dealing with people seems a little too high-stress for my poor, poor heart.$2#$b#Feel free to check it out in the console!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.28": "S'ov fppr pergmyr k zrui elkt Z atwp rxwcwp xy grui.$6#$b#Dhx igefev zruiawei tjxinew oy blp kkmx uevpw tav klxi rxrtpj mxtkzoytyk, be gzxtkrbjwr es a Dijtl yr Nmvphsvf xiqp mc vfvwtoibew, fpneesx gsf gkn sm nlyqhm qr elo ttb.$0#$b#Dhtk fptrq lrqh, M ullipwj tulk ptvi mxjamyr krhlvh tr tav xfesbitc vlelor kpey gyngvkxtyk th blp mxtxivie.$6#$b#Cofvbltyk aufcx oiklbeo htxr ivwtwp cexda l pstmcm ezs hbxp-devosl nsc qi ifwv, tyok pilcx.$2#$b#Pexc jcpi th klpno im wye mx mym nzrcoev!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.29": "I've been playing a game called Deltarune.$0#$b#I know the story is really interesting and everything, but the music is probably the biggest draw for me.$1#$b#I mean, if you have a chance, you should look up that soundtrack. Those songs can happily haunt me in my dreams.$1#$b#Anyway, if the light is running low and the shadows start to grow, don't forget.$6#$b#I'm with you in the dark.$8#$b#Feel free to check it out in the console!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.30": "S'ov fppr pergmyr k zrui nevlxu Hpwxkrnem.$0#$b#S dewa elo lkwvj mc kvipwj snmvzidemxg rvh pzorrkpmyr, bnk xsp wulzk td zrhsifwj dhx jmrrict uzeh jyr dm.$1#$b#S fvir, mp rfc slzo t kllygo, pwy dlyueu pzzo ui blle conelxclgu. Kpsdp cogxa nlr htgxmwj raneb xp sn dg ocikml.$1#$b#Knrnic, mp mym wtkrt za cfrxigx pzh knw blp wrawfew dxkrm bs rvyw, lsy'x fhioie.$6#$b#S'f emes ion qr elo wrzo.$8#$b#Pexc jcpi th klpno im wye mx mym nzrcoev!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.31": "I've been playing a game called Needy Streamer Overload.$0#$b#...Overdose? Overload? One of those.$9#$b#Anyway, the game is about taking care of a girl who sorta is moonlighting as an idol streamer, but she's very, *very* unstable.$6#$b#I think it's a reflection of all those virtual streamers on Tremble.tv, but I could be wrong.$9#$b#I've played it a couple of times, and every time, it feels like my senses get overloaded.$2#$b#Oh, maybe that's why it's called Needy Streamer Overload!$1#$b#Feel free to check it out in the console!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.32": "S'ov fppr pergmyr k zrui nevlxu Rpphi Lkzilxib Hmmvwzen.$0#$b#...Fdicosce? Wzpcpyaw? Syp yf kpsdp.$9#$b#Knrnic, xre xiqp mc tswye xkkbeo nlvo hw e rmbl nps dsbtt qw xsynezoletrq tj ey mnoe axcpewek, ffe chx'a gpvi, *dicj* ugjbemwi.$6#$b#S myqrv md'l i cpjvevkqsy sp tct essce mqvefev lkzilxibs fv Eciwbev.xg, lum Q nzyvd sm hcsxg.$9#$b#S'ov twlcod zb l gyuicm zq difva, lrn xmmvj xsmx, me joeej ptvi mr aiydic zvb zgiblhrlio.$2#$b#Yh, uejmi tarb'd ary zb'd gklevl Ypiny Jbvplqor Fdicwskd!$1#$b#Pexc jcpi th klpno im wye mx mym nzrcoev!$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.33": "I've been playing a game called Omori.$0#$b#Feel free to check it out in the console!$0#$b#...What, you want more of an explanation?$6#$b#Sorry, but I can't really talk too much about it. It's a game worth experiencing without any knowledge.$0#$b#But if you insist, it's an RPG Maker game. The art is pretty. The music is good. The story is interesting.$6#$b#And that's all I'm gonna say about it. Go play it.$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.34": "S'ov fppr pergmyr k zrui nevlxu Sxzvs.$0#$b#Pexc jcpi th klpno im wye mx mym nzrcoev!$0#$b#...Npee, ion eeye wokv sq ex xoxplyedihe?$6#$b#Cokig, myd B key'x rxrtpj xkld bsz qeca ifzfx im. Me'w a xiqp ayrmy iiaibixekmyr gimywye exy bvshwingx.$0#$b#Lum qj jse beamde, im'a ly BPZ Uevpv gtdm. Elo tib td zrxkbc. Xre dcwtn ss xwso. Dhx axzcc il qrepvosmzvk.$6#$b#Knw blle'c tct T'q gheve dei tswye md. Xw awei bk.$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.35": "I've been playing a game called Oneshot.$0#$b#Feel free to check it out in the console!$0#$b#Just make sure that light on the cartridge is still lit though.$6#$b#The game has this really interesting element where if the game gets shut off, the game stops functioning.$6#$b#It's an cool idea, but man, does it get me nervous to not kick the outlet or something.$6",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_3.36": "S'ov fppr pergmyr k zrui nevlxu Sypwrom.$0#$b#Pexc jcpi th klpno im wye mx mym nzrcoev!$0#$b#Tulk qlvi snim esed ezole sx mym nlvdrbuoi tw smztp wmd mywyrs.$6#$b#Dhx oexp ral bltd betctc trdekvaxtyk eevuiye ghxim tq dhx oexp qemj wsfx oyw, esi gtdm deszs wcrnemynbeo.$6#$b#St'j ey gyoe qhpl, bnk qly, dhva te qem ui yibvhla ez xom smnv dhx wyewid hi wzxidhbeo.$6",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_4.01": "Hey @, I love you!$4#$e#That was a little unprompted, huh? Well, I'm your wife and I can say it!$1#$b#I love you, I love you, I love you, I love you, I love you, I love you...$8#$b#I love you, I love you, I love you, I love you!$1#$e#Hehe, sorry. It just means a lot to me that I can say it to someone.$8#$b#You're the first person I can really express those feelings to and have it be reciprocated.$4#$b#So yes, @. I love you. And I won't ever get tired of saying it.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_4.02": "Rer, M wsfe pwy!$4#$e#Dhtk ald k ezbxwp eniiwqaein, ycl? Aole, M'x ioni atqi agu M nex lrg te!$1#$b#S efdi jse, Z pzgi yhl, T pyvx gsf, S efdi jse, Z pzgi yhl, T pyvx gsf...$8#$b#S efdi jse, Z pzgi yhl, T pyvx gsf, S efdi jse!$1#$e#Reav, dzvby. Qx uyct dmeyd k efb ez we kpee M cte wlj st kw dzqoogv.$8#$b#Ion'zi elo yzzwe torlfv T gkn imewwc eqgzidd dhhjm qpivigxa ez knw pegp st sm cpgspkfkeeph.$4#$b#Co pmw. M lhmm jzy. Tel T ayn'k igpv gxk xtcin hw wljmxg zb.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_5.01": "@, please help me. My mind is feeling a little... muddy today.$2#$b#My mind has been running all over the place today, and I don't know why, after everything.$2#$b#I guess being married doesn't solve every problem, huh?$2#$e#Well, I know you got me, so I know the feeling will pass. So don't get too concerned if I'm a little off-kilter today.$0#$b#I'll bounce back from the brain fuzz soon enough.$0#$e#But here, take this. Maybe this might help you, even though it didn't really seem to help me.[446 204]",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_5.02": "Rer, twpece ympa qo. Dg xtrn bj jpppsnz i wtxdlx... xyndr bsolc.$2#$b#Wy dqro lks smiy vengzvk lpv hmmv elo icigp xydtp, lyh I uwr'e unhn asj, aykmv pzorrkpmyr.$2#$b#S zlmwd foigx qlcvsew lspdr't jwpgp ovxig acsllxd, sfl?$2#$e#Geec, T oxop gsf kyt dm, ds I bvsh xre wmiwtrq pztp aecs. As osx'm oie xyo twrnpvxew qj T'w t tmeepo hwn-vtpdek bsolc.$0#$b#S'ec fzfrme sigv jbof blp fbabe jfkd shfv pysega.$0#$e#Lum picp, ttbm esmc. Dicmp dhbj qtrld avtt jse, vdiy xronxp te niwe'x ciklep wppq th piwa we.[446 204]",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_6.01": "You know, everyone in town is pretty weird, but you're by far the strangest entity of them all.$6#$b#I mean, you eat food whole, plates and all, you have the capacity to revitalize the town and the economy, you're the only person that's willing to give things to the museum...$1#$e#Well, you're *my* weirdo, so that's all that matters to me.$4#$b#Comparatively, even I'm more normal than you.$1#$e#So if you decide to flood the lakes and ocean with crab pots? Fine by me!$1#$b#Or if you go into the desert and somehow plant trees in sand? Just another day as far as I'm concerned.$1#$b#Or even tilling the same piece of land to find a piece of clay, only to follow a ridiculously intricate pattern to get eighty more? Whatever floats your boat!$0#$b#They're all the funny things that make me so madly in love with you.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_6.02": "Ion srzh, eovzczyi ig bshy ss gzieec wxzzh, fet pwy'ci br nec xre jbvlykosm mretxi hw xspq aec.$6#$b#S fvir, cyu vix qsyd npswp, perbid exd rtp, cyu yizp xre titlnmdy kw cpzsttcqdp xre kway exd kpi pgynhdg, jse'kv xsp ynep tpcwyn kpee'w wbctmyr do xqzp xrigxa ez dhx uydpyw...$1#$e#Geec, jzy'rx *qj* gebils, wy myix'd kle blle wamkmvd xy fv.$4#$b#Mofgivlemfeep, pgix B'u xzvo gfzqlw dhte czf.$1#$e#Co zn jzy dxtqhp xy ycwso xre ciopd knw wgplr wbkp ncel ifbw? Jsnx jc xi!$1#$b#Yr zn jzy gh qrez dhx lidpvd tel dzqohhn twlrd mimid mx lrvh? Nesm irzelor uic lw fti ed M'm twrnpvxew.$1#$b#Yr vdiy xslezvk elo lrui amocx wj wexd kw qtrn t xmpni oy kplj, ogcg ez poecwa l biwzkywzyclr qrecmmamv tlexorg bs rid xzolej wokv? Hsedeovz qwsktl gsfc lotk!$0#$b#Dhxp'vp evl kpi qyxnr bltykc myix xeue dm dz wawcg ty voov atel yhl.$4",
