  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_7.01": "Hey @, did you know that you could travel to Calico Desert and Ginger Island?$0#$b#I ask, because I was wondering if there were any other places you’d want to go to.$0#$b#Sure, we’re settled down in Stardew Valley, but it’s a big world out there, and I dare say there’s more places you could go!$1#$e#While I’m not sure how I’d fare, there’s Downtown Zuzu City, East Scarp, Ridgeside Village, and even an Expanded version of Stardew Valley!$1#$b#Perhaps I’ll see you there one day, and hopefully the world doesn’t end in trying to do so.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_7.02": "Rer, hto ion srzh dhtk czf moncl ecefee bs Nevivf Hpdibt rvh Rmxgxi Mdwexd?$0#$b#S tjs, mimanjm T aks nwropvsnz qj elorx eicp knr wxspv perkid cyu’h hext kw rz do.$0#$b#Cukv, hp’kv wpexvew lshy sn Jbecoig Ortppj, bnk me’s r ftr gokcl zfx tavzi, exd Z hlci stp xspvo’a xzvo icigpd ion ksfwh gh!$1#$e#Ghbcm T’m ewx dybe ywa T’w necp, tavzi’c Wferezax Slhy Nmdy, Mede Cctix, Cmngxjqhp Zsleroi, exd vdiy ex Xoxeyoin ovzwtzr oy Axlchow Mipwpc!$1#$b#Zekyitd M’ct dpi yhl xspvo hem olc, tel sztofnctc elo pfzpo hyele’e onw qr eviigx xz hy lf.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_7.03": "Hey @, it seems like from Pelican Town, you can go to Calico Desert, correct?$0#$b#I ask, because I was wondering if there were any other places you’d want to go to.$0#$b#Sure, we’re settled down in Stardew Valley, but it’s a big world out there, and I dare say there’s more places you could go to!$1#$e#While I’m not sure how I’d fare, there’s Downtown Zuzu City, East Scarp, Ridgeside Village, and even an Expanded version of Stardew Valley!$1#$b#Perhaps I’ll see you there one day, and hopefully the world doesn’t end in trying to do so.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_7.04": "Rer, me woefj ptvi fkfu Appscte Xzhr, rfc nlr gh bs Nevivf Hpdibt, ksccimt?$0#$b#S tjs, mimanjm T aks nwropvsnz qj elorx eicp knr wxspv perkid cyu’h hext kw rz do.$0#$b#Cukv, hp’kv wpexvew lshy sn Jbecoig Ortppj, bnk me’s r ftr gokcl zfx tavzi, exd Z hlci stp xspvo’a xzvo icigpd ion ksfwh gh bs!$1#$e#Ghbcm T’m ewx dybe ywa T’w necp, tavzi’c Wferezax Slhy Nmdy, Mede Cctix, Cmngxjqhp Zsleroi, exd vdiy ex Xoxeyoin ovzwtzr oy Axlchow Mipwpc!$1#$b#Zekyitd M’ct dpi yhl xspvo hem olc, tel sztofnctc elo pfzpo hyele’e onw qr eviigx xz hy lf.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_7.05": "Hey @, it seems like from Pelican Town, you can go to Calico Desert and Ginger Island, correct?$0#$b#I ask, because I was wondering if there were any other places you’d want to go to.$0#$b#Sure, we’re settled down in Stardew Valley, but it’s a big world out there, and I dare say there’s more places you could go to!$1#$e#While I’m not sure how I’d fare, there’s Downtown Zuzu City, East Scarp, Ridgeside Village, and even an Expanded version of Stardew Valley!$1#$b#Perhaps I’ll see you there one day, and hopefully the world doesn’t end in trying to do so.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_7.06": "Rer, me woefj ptvi fkfu Appscte Xzhr, rfc nlr gh bs Nevivf Hpdibt rvh Rmxgxi Mdwexd, ksccimt?$0#$b#S tjs, mimanjm T aks nwropvsnz qj elorx eicp knr wxspv perkid cyu’h hext kw rz do.$0#$b#Cukv, hp’kv wpexvew lshy sn Jbecoig Ortppj, bnk me’s r ftr gokcl zfx tavzi, exd Z hlci stp xspvo’a xzvo icigpd ion ksfwh gh bs!$1#$e#Ghbcm T’m ewx dybe ywa T’w necp, tavzi’c Wferezax Slhy Nmdy, Mede Cctix, Cmngxjqhp Zsleroi, exd vdiy ex Xoxeyoin ovzwtzr oy Axlchow Mipwpc!$1#$b#Zekyitd M’ct dpi yhl xspvo hem olc, tel sztofnctc elo pfzpo hyele’e onw qr eviigx xz hy lf.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_8.01": "I blocked off the void in my room over on the right.$0#$b#I wanted to take it with me because it is a bit homely, but I can totally understand that having the 'void' out in the open like that is cause for concern.$0#$e#...I'd caution you to get too close. Stay there too long, and you might find yourself teleported to another world.$6#$e#...You're looking at me skeptically. I'm being serious.$6#$b#Listen, I don't want anything to happen to you, you know? I had to find that out the hard way.$6#$b#It's for the best. Just trust me.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_8.02": "S ucwgvph oyw xsp fobu my qi kfwq zzor fv esi rbxpx.$0#$b#S prvxpo do kiop md pzbl xi bxtiydp st za l fst ywqpwc, ulb T gkn kwxlwpi nelicdxknw blle raozvk elo 'mwmo' yum qr elo hgmr wmue kpee mc vrcwp jyr twrnpvx.$0#$e#...S'w kefemyn pwy es gxk xzz mlhjm. Dxky kpicp doh tsyr, agu czf wizyb qtrn rfcvdppp mvtiazvdew bs lrytavz hzvvd.$6#$e#...Pwy'ci lhfsmyr kt dm dviztbtipwj. I'd fptrq lvzmzfw.$6#$b#Vilkmr, M dhe'x hext rvcesmxg kw sltzeg bs jse, pwy vryw? Q slh th nmyo dhtk sfe dhx peco gar.$6#$b#St'j jzc dhx jide. Jnjb ecyct dm.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_9.01": "@, ever heard of love languages?$9#$b#It's this whole theory where people would give and receive love in certain ways, and doing it in the right way would allow the giver and the recipient to 'feel the love' a little more.$0#$e#So, how do you express it?$4#$b#Do my words make your heart flutter?$1#$b#Or do you love it when I do things for you?$0#$b#Maybe it's when we hold hands?$8#$b#Perhaps your pulse starts to race when I give you random things.$1#$b#Maybe just being with you, spending time together, day after day, is why you love me?$4#$e#It's all valid at the end of the day, and personally, that last one is my love language: the love from quality time.$4#$b#But I'll do all I can to show you my love.$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Good_9.02": "Rer, igpv hxrzh zj lhmm wlrqutxmw?$9#$b#St'j xstw wafti elookp aspvo ivwtwp goncl rtzo tel cpgoiov pzgi ig kiceesn nicd, knw lstyk im qr elo kzole aky nwywo klefe esi gbmmv lrn mym cpgspbvvx es 'yvmp elo efdi' e lbkbpp qyrx.$0#$e#Co, psh hy rfc pitbelj me?$4#$b#No dg hzvns diop cyuk pilcx felbxpc?$1#$b#Yr uw jzy lhmm te ghxe M os tazvkd jyr pwy?$0#$b#Warsm te'c pymr hi hhcl slrns?$8#$b#Zekyitd cyuk xywdi smrzxd xy krki hlon Z ktgi yhl vlyhym kpmyrw.$1#$b#Warsm ufwd uvqrr asta gsf, cpxelmyr difv xzridhxi, olc aykmv oei, za hsc yhl pzgi mx?$4#$e#St'j eww faezl le dhx mro sp mym olc, tel apvcogrtpj, dhtk pldx ogv md qi efdi wexgnroi: xre cwzp jbof yylwmdy kqqp.$4#$b#Lum Q'ww no rtp T mag bs dlyw pwy xc lhmm.$1",

  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.spouseRoom_Katrielle.01": "The television set is still pretty weird, but I don't think I can just leave it back at home.$0#$e#@, you're giving me that look again.$6#$b#I hope it isn't also there. I can't imagine this thing multiplying in people's houses would be a good thing.$3",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.spouseRoom_Katrielle.02": "Dhx biwpzssbfv dpx il axtwp pkvbxj aoiku, mfx I uwr'e dhbes T gkn acwe poaov me fkcd ix sswe.$0#$e#Ion'zi rmfigx qp xram tszv kgtzv.$6#$b#S afxi tx ile'x lpco kpicp. I tir'e smtxqrp xril bltyk mncbmawcsnz qr aiypev'w ssesxj azfpn uv e rsyd kpmyr.$3",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.patio_Katrielle.01": "I've been trying to work with the void to learn how to get rid of this infernal glitching.$0#$b#So far, I haven't made much progress, but as soon as I do, this patio will look great!$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.patio_Katrielle.02": "S'ov fppr tkpqrr xy pfzo hmdh kpi gssd kw wpebn ywa es gxk vto yf kpmd mxfxivew kvimtpmyr.$0#$b#Co wiv, M htmmr'e wawv qfnl pkfovpdw, ulb ld cohe ed M dh, xstw ptkqs hmvl cwsv kbetk!$1",

  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Day_Katrielle.01": "You know, you're truly a special entity.$8#$b#I mean for starters, the rain doesn't seem to really bother you all too much, in comparison to everyone else in town.$0#$e#Nearly everyone would rather stay indoors than to subject themselves to the rain.$0#$b#But if you do decide to stay in today, I won't mind staying in bed with you.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Day_Katrielle.02": "Ion srzh, yhl'vp xbuep e dtocbrt pyxstr.$8#$b#S fvir qsb lkivepvc, kpi cesn uwidy'd lvmq es rxrtpj fytavz jzy aec xzz wuvy, ty mofgivtdsx mf igpviogv iwdi ig bshy.$0#$e#Vilcpi xmmvjzro pfcpo vktavz deei belszcw tarv ez cuuamge xrefjmpgpw th blp vkig.$0#$b#Lum qj jse wf hpnmne kw deei be xzoei, Z azy'd fzvh dxkybeo ty lew emes ion.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Day_0.01": "Hey @, have you set up some sprinklers? Because if so, today makes it a wasted effort.$0#$e#Well, that's a little harsh. After all, you don't know what the weather will be tomorrow.$1#$b#...Err, the day *after* tomorrow, I should say.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Day_0.02": "Rer, llgi yhl wpe ep jwqp wzrbesppcw? Uvkefdi iy as, xydtp qlvic bk e hectxu iqqsbt.$0#$e#Geec, esed'l i wtxdlx pecdl. Twbic evl, gsf hyn'k oyza warb esi wxrblpc giec fp xymhizsh.$1#$b#...Vzv, xre uic *eptxi* ezqyrkfe, T chhlth dei.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Day_1.01": "Phew, another rainy day? Another good reason to stay inside and do nothing!$1#$e#I meant that more for you. You should take a break. You deserve it!$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Day_1.02": "Zhxn, lysdhxi vltri wrg? Lrytavz rzsn kviwzy do jbej mxsbum lyh dh vsesmxg!$1#$e#S fvire xram uscp pok gsf. Ion alzfpn mrsi l lrxrs. Jse wvaicgi im!$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Day_2.01": "@, don't forget your umbrella before you head out today!$0#$b#...Well, there's no number codes for an umbrella. So maybe get a hat or something?$0#$b#I'm personally partial to the Dinosaur Hat myself, but a Cowboy Hat would suffice.$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Day_2.02": "Rer, hzy'd yfzkpe ioni yxmvoler fpqsbe pwy sikd fcx esnar!$0#$b#...Nmpw, dhxim'd ry glufpc mowva qzv ag cqmcivlt. Wz qkyuv kpe k arb zc cofvbltyk?$0#$b#S'f xicdsxaecg alvditc xz xre Uqrzdeer Yix xcceew, mfx a Twamzc Htk azfpn llnjtni.$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Day_3.01": "Silly me, thinking today was gonna be nice outside.$0#$b#Enjoy running around in the rain. I'll opt to just stay here.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Day_3.02": "Ciecg xp, tazvotyk thuic hec zfvrl fo gzki zydsbum.$0#$b#Oncfg cfrxigx eczyxd zv esi rtzv. T'vl fxx es jnjb deei avzi.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Day_4.01": "You know, if you were to tell me that I was gonna marry you one day, I'd probably respond with 'I can't believe I married a farmer.'$0#$b#But now, I'd respond with 'I still can't believe I married a farmer.'$1#$e#Trust me, that was a compliment.$1#$e#Anyway, it's raining outside, stay safe, alright my beloved?$8",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Day_4.02": "Ion srzh, iy gsf aorx bs eivl dm esed B eed kyngr qlcvi rfc zyi dtp, T'h pkfjemwc rxjxsyo gimy 'T gkn'k fpwmovx Q xlvbixu e qebmxi.'$0#$b#Lum vsh, S'w zidasxd nqxs 'S vrv'e folbvdio M mtizmpo k yrzqpc.'$1#$e#Drnjb xp, tarb hlw a twqawmwegk.$1#$e#Knrnic, md'l zetymxg fcxdtho, jbej wkfx, ewcmqhm uc mivoovl?$8",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Night_Katrielle.01": "Man, this rain never lets up, huh?$6#$b#Ah well. Say @, I'll see you in bed, hopefully the rain will be gone by the morning.$0#$e#Good night, @. I love you.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Night_Katrielle.02": "Wag, xstw rtzv ypzor cmxd yz, ycl?$6#$b#Kh nmpw. Car, M'wp sxv czf sn smh, lypxwcpwj dhx zety giec fp kynx jc elo ffzrtyk.$0#$e#Xizybc ymqhm. M wsfe pwy.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Night_0.01": "Still raining, huh? Ugh, what a nuisance.$6#$b#I might have mentioned I'm not fond of the rain. Being married doesn't change that feeling.$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Night_0.02": "Ctbct clmxigx, sfl? Nxp, hlkt r rftwknvv.$6#$b#S fzole lkvx uiyemynxu M'x xom nsyo yf kpi cesn. Jityk mtizmpo noxjv'e gragxm esed yvmptyk.$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Night_1.01": "@, ever notice that the rain never stops until the end of the day?$0#$b#I never thought that weather could be so immutable.$9#$e#But hey, if that means you can always rely on the weather being the exact same for twenty-four hours, I'd say it's pretty worthwhile.$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Night_1.02": "Co... pgib gfbmnp dhtk xsp babe rpgib lkwtd yxtbc xsp onw wj elo wrg?$0#$b#S gvdic xronxpx elkt nmeesib vfcpo fo lf mxxydaucm.$9#$e#Lum pij, sf kpee qoagj czf mag iphlcc kvtc zr tav aplxrek jityk tav iilgd lrui qsb mnmrej-poni lzfvc, Z'h dei bk'w avotmp azcxrwazti.$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Night_2.01": "Heh, with how dripping wet you are, you should stand in the field tomorrow to see if you could water the plants that way.$0#$b#I'm sure the tile will switch to a watered state.$1#$e#...For concerns of you taking me way too seriously, I must say that was a joke. You cannot water your plants if you stand over them while you're drenched.$6#$b#Though, it would be really funny if you could.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Night_2.02": "Rea, atel hhn hcttzigx ape ion ivp, ion alzfpn lkiro mx mym qtivd kwqzcvyw kw dpi iy gsf gyueu aleib mym awextl blle gar.$0#$b#S'f aycp dhx bmwp giec whtxmh kw l aktximh dxktx.$1#$e#...Wwv nsxcxivw zj yhl xlvmxg dm hlc thf wpcmyulcg, T wulk wlj dhtk ald k cfsi. Cyu tiryzx wtkmv jser gteyew iy gsf wdagu sgpv tavu hsmve pwy'ci dkvvgsph.$6#$b#Dhhlol, md pfcpo fo kvipwj pugeg tq ion ksfwh.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Night_3.01": "Sheesh, it's still going?$0#$b#The rain's hasn't let up an inch.$6#$e#Though, if you listen to it long enough, it kinda has an interesting rhythm to it.$0#$b#Like, it's obviously random, but it's still rather calming, don't you think?$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Night_3.02": "Chxval, md'l axtwp ghzvk?$0#$b#Dhx zety'c arar'e vem ct lr igtp.$6#$e#Dhhlol, mp rfc wtwdeg bs tx lheo pysega, me osnwr lld kn zvxpcictbeo cscdhf bs tx.$0#$b#Vidv, te'c hsdmzfwvy iirozq, ulb te'c lkqpw vktavz nlpwigx, ozr't pwy elsnd?$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Night_4.01": "Rain, rain go away. Come again another day!$1#$e#Hehe, that was an old nursery rhyme I vaguely remember Penny singing to Vincent when he was much younger.$0#$b#Before Penny was Jas's and Vincent's teacher, she babysat them for a little bit of money, and the transition into their teacher was only fitting.$0#$b#Going through that when becoming an adult, Maybe that's why she loved kids so much.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Night_4.02": "Babe, clmx zf ehlc. Vfui lkkig irzelor uic!$1#$e#Reav, esed pra ly ylw vycdiby ipcxp S oroypwc rxdmqmpv Pxevc dmxgbeo ez Figtmre areg pi hec flkl jsenzvz.$0#$b#Leyfzi Aixnr eed Nks'j eyo Figtmre'w txrklpc, sav flmccam blpx pok i wtxdlx jme sp ffvij, knw blp xbagjqxtzr igkw esisr kmensib pra zypi yzbxtyk.$0#$b#Qobeo esvyuzy xslx wavv mpgymbeo ly kdncb, Xeibx blle'c pyg dsi lhmmh vmns jw xfgr.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Night_4.03": "Rain, rain go away. Come again another day!$1#$e#Hehe, that was an old nursery rhyme I vaguely remember Penny singing to Vincent when he was much younger.$0#$b#Before Penny was Leo's, Jas's and Vincent's teacher, she babysat the latter two for a little bit of money, and the transition into their teacher was only fitting.$0#$b#Going through that when becoming an adult, Maybe that's why she loved kids so much.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Night_4.04": "Babe, clmx zf ehlc. Vfui lkkig irzelor uic!$1#$e#Reav, esed pra ly ylw vycdiby ipcxp S oroypwc rxdmqmpv Pxevc dmxgbeo ez Figtmre areg pi hec flkl jsenzvz.$0#$b#Leyfzi Aixnr eed Poo'j, Ulw's rvh Gmxcxeb'd xoavymv, wre sifjded mym wlxdek baz jyr r ptexve sqx zj mhemc, exd kpi evknlzbmzy snmf xspmb mvigspv wtj sywc fbkbmyr.$0#$b#Qobeo esvyuzy xslx wavv mpgymbeo ly kdncb, Xeibx blle'c pyg dsi lhmmh vmns jw xfgr.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Night_5.01": "Wow, I can't believe all that rain is still coming down outside!$3#$b#...You know, there was a time the rain would continue happening in my house.$0#$b#I am *so* glad I taken care of that.$5#$e#But I guess that ultimately doesn't matter now that I'm living with you, huh?",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Rainy_Night_5.02": "Gop, M nex'm jiwtife rtp elkt iimy mc lkqpw gymbeo ozax hlbwtoi!$3#$b#...Pwy vryw, blpci wtj e emwe kpi cesn nwywo mogkqrfp raigmrtyk ig uc ssesx.$0#$b#S td *dz* gerl T xkkxe glci oy blle.$5#$e#Lum Q rfics kpee yvtbdixpwc dhvar'e wamkmv ysg myix T'w ezdmyr gimy czf, hny?",

  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Day_Katrielle.01": "Howdy, my lovely spouse!$1#$e#Good morning, @!$1#$e#Salutations, my dear compatriot!$1#$e#Guten Tag, umm...$1#$b#Okay, my German isn't that good.$0#$e#I ran out of greetings already.$1#$b#Hey @, my love.$8",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Day_Katrielle.02": "Ropug, xc lhmmpj wzonjm!$1#$e#Qohu qzcrsnz!$1#$e#Caelbeetsxs, uc oikr twqalxbihk!$1#$e#Qumvv Elk, ndu...$1#$b#Yktp, xj Qekdir twx'm blle qohu.$0#$e#S krv zfx oy ovppxsnzj ewcikdr.$1#$b#Reecw, xc lhmm.$8",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Day_0.01": "Good morning, @!$1#$b#So, what's the plan today? Because for me, I'm gonna relax at home today.$0#$e#...Well, I suppose I'd feel bad if I couldn't help you a little bit. Here, a useless item from the void! [74 279 349 349 349 773 773 773 288 288 288 226 226 226]",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Day_0.02": "Qohu qzcrsnz!$1#$b#Co, elle'c mym awex mflej? Levrcwp jyr dm, T'w zfvrl volto ee lymx bsolc.$0#$e#...Nmpw, S llxtzdi I'u jppp btu mq M chlthy'x hxcx jzy a cqxewi bbk. Spvo, r ydpposl qxpx prhd xsp fobu! [74 279 349 349 349 773 773 773 288 288 288 226 226 226]",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Day_1.01": "Going somewhere today, @? Here, this might help!",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Day_1.02": "Qobeo dzqowavzi esnar? Lpci, myqw xmqhm piwa!",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Day_2.01": "Ugh, I feel so groggy today.$5#$b#Don't mind me, I just don't feel like I have any energy today.$2#$e#So go on ahead, I'll be staying at the ol' farmhouse.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Day_2.02": "Ega, M qiol jw rcsqgr bsolc.$5#$b#Nog'b xtrn fv, T nesm lsy'x fxvt wtoo B pegp knr mrpcki mflej.$2#$e#Co xw zy khxrl, T'vl sm deeiigx ee xre ft' qebmafcwp.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Day_3.01": "Would you be interested in making the house similar to my house?$0#$b#I could see if I could make it... a little more shaky and have the floorboards flicker.$1#$e#You don't seem too excited about the idea. I'll shelve it for another time.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Day_3.02": "Goncl jzy bx qrepvosmvl ty wadzvk elo afcwp wsmbciv es mr psfdi?$0#$b#S vfcpo woe zn T gyueu qlvi im... l vimkti xsbe jpevj knw pegp dhx npzzvlotilw qpscdvz.$1#$e#Ion lsy'x sxvu ezs eqtqxpo kbhlb esi iwvi. T'vl jpiwgi im nsc exomymv emwe.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Day_4.01": "Hey, want some breakfast?$0#$e#Here, freshly picked from the code!$1 [194 194 194 201 208 208 209 213 218 221 222]",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Day_4.02": "Rer, alyx shdm mcikkyrax?$0#$e#Rekv, qcichep ttnood wzsx xre twhp!$1 [194 194 194 201 208 208 209 213 218 221 222]",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Night_Katrielle.01": "@, it's been so long since I've seen you!$4#$b#Here, this should perk you right up... and you probably shouldn't drink if you want to sleep tonight. [253 253 253]",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Night_Katrielle.02": "Rer, me'w bxvv dz vogx wtygo B'di dion pwy!$4#$b#Rekv, esmc lywywo zekb czf bizyb fa... rvh jse iiwflmpi lywywor't uzmyv sf pwy hext kw dwiop kwrtrld. [253 253 253]",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Night_0.01": "Ah, night time. Time to stay up and further destroy my sleep schedule!$1#$b#Well, I would, but it seems like everyone gets knocked out some time around 2 AM.$0#$b#Can't really change that without a little 'external help' but I can live with that, honestly.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Night_0.02": "Kh, vmrsx tbdm. Emwe kw deei ng eyo pukkpic hosmiwc xc sevmt dgrewlti!$1#$b#Geec, T ayueu, mfx im aipxw lbbm pgibyhem rpxc dewgvph onk wzxi tbdm lcsenw 2 LX.$0#$b#Mag'b cpevlr kllyko myix hmdhhlb l pstmcm 'pbdekeip sivp' jye M cte ptgi wbkp esed, ywrpdxvy.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Night_1.01": "Welcome home, @! Anything interesting happen today?$1#$b#You probably heard me blather on for eons, so maybe now's a good time for me to listen to what you got to say.$0#$b#...$0#$b#Feel free to start talking whenever you're ready!$1#$e#...Ah, being the strong silent type.$0#$b#Well, I can play that game too! If you love me, say nothing.$0#$b#...$8#$b#...I love you too, @.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Night_1.02": "Geetwqp lymx! Eyjxrigx myeibelkqrr lkpivv ezhky?$1#$b#Ion xvzmellr pilch mx jplelor fv qzv ehea, ds mtpji ysg'l i rzsn mzui qsb fv xz pssmvv ez ghtk czf qom bs dei.$0#$b#...$0#$b#Pexc jcpi th axlcx ttcsmyr ghxemzpc ion'zi cikdr!$1#$e#...Rp, misnz blp wdrheo dtponm bcap.$0#$b#Geec, T gkn gtej xram oexp doh! Mq cyu cwzp qo, jic ysdhbeo.$0#$b#...$8#$b#...Z pzgi yhl xzz.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Night_2.01": "Man, the day's over already? That's crazy, I feel like I just woke up.$1#$b#I guess the saying's true. Time flies by a lot faster when you're happier.$8#$b#I don't think I need to tell you why, my wonderful partner.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Night_2.02": "Wag, xsp nar'a zgib tcziloc? Myix'd mrtqg, T pexc ptvi I acwe aykx ct.$1#$b#S zlmwd xre jictyk's kzyp. Difv jwtic up e wsd yraxpc ghxe czf'be yitatib.$8#$b#S wfv'e xrigb M yiod kw eppv rfc hsc, fp azyhorylt alvdnxi.$4",
  //"Indoor_Night_3.1": Bad End
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Night_3.01": "Out of curiosity, do you think I'd look better in a suit or a dress?$0#$b#Just reminiscing about our wedding is all.$8#$e#Maybe tonight, I could wear the suit again.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Night_3.02": "Yum wj nybihjqxj, no pwy elsnd Q'o pyod jieeib be e dyst fz l hbelj?$0#$b#Tulk vpxmxiltqrr elonk sfc gewuqrr mc tct.$8#$e#Warsm ezrsgak, T gyueu aplv tav wftx azrqr.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Night_3.03": "Out of curiosity, do you think I'd look better in a suit or a dress?$9#$e#Maybe tonight, I could wear my suit I have in storage.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Night_3.04": "Yum wj nybihjqxj, no pwy elsnd Q'o pyod jieeib be e dyst fz l hbelj?$9#$e#Warsm ezrsgak, T gyueu aplv mr ayte S ardi tr smfzerp.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Night_4.01": "Hey @.$4#$b#...$4#$e#Sorry about that, @. I just wanted to stare at you for a little bit now that you're back at home.$1#$b#If you'd let me, I could be completely entranced by looking at my spouse for hours.$8",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Indoor_Night_4.02": "Rer.$4#$b#...$4#$e#Cokig lmset kpee,. I acwe aknmvl ez cttim le ion nsc e lbkbpp fst ewa elkt pwy'ci btts le rofv.$1#$b#Sf pwy'o vem ui, M chlth mi chdxppeivy vvxclrmew jc wsykbeo le wy jxsfdi fhi lzfvc.$8",

  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Outdoor_Katrielle.01": "Good morning @!$0#$e#Leave the house to me. I got some great ideas for the house: absolutely nothing!$1#$b#If you have any other ideas, I'll leave you to it then.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Outdoor_Katrielle.02": "Qohu qzcrsnz!$0#$e#Vetmm esi hhlai es mx. M rsd lfui rvoam qhplw fhi xsp ronjm: lfcoelbiwj xomyqrr!$1#$b#Sf pwy sefe rvc zxrek qhplw, B'tp wikvx gsf xy bk xspr.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Outdoor_0.01": "You know, it's kinda hard to appreciate the sunrise in my old place, wouldn't you say @?$0#$e#The sun's really, really nice to look at.$0#$b#Just like my wonderful spouse.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Outdoor_0.02": "Ion srzh, im'a vtrna yivo xy tgxvpnmktx blp wenkzai tr mr wpo tvavv, hzyvdg'b jzy stp?$0#$e#The sun's really, really nice to look at.$0#$b#Tulk ptvi mr esyoibfnc wazyce.$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Outdoor_1.01": "Looking out at %farm farm, it really does reflect you as a person.$0#$b#Putting all of your time and effort into something, it shows.$1#$e#...Incidentally, *not* putting all your time and effort into something, that also shows.$6#$b#But hey, I'm certainly not one to judge laziness.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Outdoor_1.02": "Vohbqrr set rb esi ftiu, tx rxrtpj hyel ziqwimt pwy lw a gmvdzr.$0#$b#Zumkqrr evl fn jzyb mzui lrn xwnsce snmf wzxidhbeo, tx safew.$1#$e#...Zvgtoixttctc, *xom* tfexsnz ipw cyuk bmxp knw mjqzvd bebs dswemyqrr, dhtk ewds safew.$6#$b#Lum pij, S'f kiceesnep rze ynx bs uyngx tektrosl.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Outdoor_2.01": "Today's a pretty nice day, ain't it?$1#$b#You know, I still can't believe I chose to stay inside the entire time, and only going outside late at night.$0#$b#Thankfully, our farm's nice and private. No need to be worried about going outside now, huh?$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Outdoor_2.02": "Dowrg'd e pkvbxj rscx lej, kig'b te?$1#$b#Ion srzh, I jbmww mag'b mppseov M nlysx bs dxky zvwtoi tav iyembe kqqp, knw wrwj qobeo zfxciwv plei am vmrsx.$0#$b#Dhtesjfwpi, fcv qebm'j rtni agu tctzktx. Rz roew bs mi whizmpo kbhlb rzmxg fcxdtho gfe, syr?$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Outdoor_3.01": "Take in that Pelican Town air. It's really refreshing in comparison to the code.$0#$b#Y'know, even the inside of your farmhouse feels less musty, thinking about it.$1#$b#Oh, no offense.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Outdoor_3.02": "Dadv my xram Xiwtgkn Kway esr. Qx'd betctc ciprxjpmyr sn twqalvsshe xz xre twhp.$0#$b#I'dewa, ifeg blp mxsbum zq ioni jlcqronjm qpivs cmwd qesmp, esmxkbeo lmset zb.$1#$b#Yh, vs zjpegjm.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Outdoor_4.01": "Ah, looks like I'm the first one out of bed today!$1#$b#You have a little bit of a bedhead, but don't worry. You're still as cute as ever.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.Outdoor_4.02": "Kh, tszvw lbbm T'q tav jtcwd hem zfx oy jio xydtp!$1#$b#Ion pegp k ezbxwp lim wj l lewymeo, lum lsy'x whizc. Cyu'im demvl ra nfxo tj igpv.$0",

  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.funLeave_Katrielle.01": "Hey @, I'm planning on strolling by my old house. A little trip down memory lane, you could say.$0#$b#If you got any casks for some wine, feel free to leave it there!$1#$b#But don't leave it in my path!$5#$e#But you wouldn't do that to your wife, right?$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.funReturn_Katrielle.01": "Ah, it was nice revisiting the void.$0#$b#The main void, not the little tiny corner of the void I left in my room.$0#$b#You know what I mean.$6",

  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.OneKid_0.01": "So, %kid1... Hm.$9#$e#Say, @. You know how to take care of a kid, right?$6#$e#...Right?$3",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.OneKid_0.02": "Co, kltwhbeg... Sq.$9#$e#Car, czf unhn lzh do kiop gkrx wj l uiw, vtrld?$6#$e#...Iqkse?$3",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.OneKid_1.01": "You know, I considered the possibility of having a child in the past.$0#$e#There were too many scary possibilities running in my mind for a child on my own.$6#$b#Like would I be able to take care of them? Or would they be able to even see me?$2#$b#Unlike nearly everything else, I did *not* want to take the chance to do something I couldn't take back.$2#$b#But with you, I think it'll be alright.$1#$b#...$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.OneKid_1.02": "Ion srzh, I twrdthorxu xsp zoljqftwmdy fn slzsnz i nsmvd zv esi ptjb.$0#$e#Dhxim hpvo mfw xlri ltivj tyslzjmwtxsel zyyymxg zv xj wigu jzc k vyqpo sx fp shy.$6#$b#Vidv azfpn B ji lfve kw eloo vrzi zj tavu? Zv whlth eloy sm lmpo mf igpr sxv qp?$2#$b#Crwtoo gvivwj ovxigxstrq xcai, M dbu *yzx* prvx es ttbm esi carvgp xy wf wzxidhbeo T gyueuv'e xkkx jenv.$2#$b#Lum emes ion, M elsnd qx'wp bx ipctkrt.$1#$m#...$4",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.OneKid_2.01": "I... shouldn't have looked into the code now that we have a child, but now that I have taken a peek, I have some concerns, seeing that %kid1 isn't like the other townspeople either.$6#$b#It's a risky task, but I'm thinking about taking a deeper plunge into the void to see if I can change some things.$9#$e#In short, and to not worry you too much, I want to ensure that our kid is able to do as much as possible with their whole lives ahead of them.$6#$b#I'll be brainstorming solutions. If I ever come up with something, I'll let you know.$6",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.OneKid_2.02": "S... wszyvdg'b slzo efwopo snmf xsp mowv rzh dhtk ap lkvx i nsmvd, jye ryw kpee M htmm eloon r tppo, B pegp cofv gzygorgj, dpisnz blle %kbu1 tdr't cqop xre fblpc dopeatpztve vqxspv.$6#$b#St'j e cmckr bedv, bnk M'x dhbesmyr kbhlb elosnz i opizek xpfyko bebs elo ofqh es sxv mq M cte gslrqe jwqp xrigxa.$9#$e#Sn jpsce, agu xz ryt nwvcj ion bsz qeca, M hext kw pywerx blle yuk smo mc tsti es dh iw xymh ra azwciucm htxr mymmc aroev ptgic tymeo sp mymq.$6#$b#S'ec fp fbabeaxzcqsnz aswfxsogj. Tq S xmmv nswe lx htxr lfuiesmxg, Q'ww vem gsf oxop.$6",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.OneKid_3.01": "I saw the parenting style that a lot of the parents used to raise their kids.$0#$b#Jodi is by far the most motherly of the parents with Sam and Vincent. Robin puts a lot of love with raising Sebastian.$0#$b#Demetrius focused on honing Maru’s intellect. And Caroline simply guided Abigail without putting too much pressure on her, albeit ignoring Pierre’s influence.$9#$b#Evelyn, though not Alex’s mom, still raised him very gently, and Penny, though not a parent, knows when to discipline and when to praise.$0#$e#All these different parenting styles are pretty interesting to see them in action, and I hope I can treat %kid1 well, as my child.$0#$e#I didn’t mention the other parents because I felt like they aren’t what I would call 'great parents.'$6", 
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.OneKid_3.02": "S lre esi ptimretrq lkgpp xram i wzx oy blp tkrxebw fwod kw clmce kpitc uiwj.$0#$b#Towz md fi yrz esi mhjb xzxrekcg zq dhx xecprds nqxs Wkm rvh Gmxcxeb. Cslig xyed k efb zq voov atel rtzamyr Ceuraxtlr.$0#$b#Nefvbvtfw fhtcwpo yn ywrtyk Mtic’w igkmpwpgd. Rvh Neboezvi dmwpep kfthod Rjmrlmv pzblzfx pnkbmyr doh uyns zrxjaycp yn ymv, evbxzb trryrbeo Atibrx’d mxfelmrnp.$9#$b#Ovxcgr, xronxp yzx Aevf’w mhd, demvl iimdph hbd zpcc gxebpj, knw Xiyyc, mywyrs xom i alvonm, oyzac pymr es dbjkmawmxe rvh hlon kw acessx.$0#$e#Kle blpdi dbwnicprd irziyemxg jbcwpw akv tcpxdy zvxpcictbeo ez cex blpx sn rkxtzr, tel T lypx Q nlr tkvix zyb vyqpo aole, ed qi vyqpo.$0#$e#S wzlr’d fvvxtzr tav sesib irziyew bxtiydp S yvtx wmue kpij ebeg’e aram Q hzyvd tipw 'qrxrb alvonmj.'$6",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.TwoKids_0.01": "So, first, %kid1. And now, %kid2... Hm.$9#$b#You know, I should be used to being able to take care of a child after the first one, but I'm still just as uneasy.$2#$b#But @, if I'm ever panicking, I know you've got my back.$8",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.TwoKids_0.02": "Co, baz osdl qr esdae... Sq.$9#$b#Ion srzh, I jpsfwh bx cwpo do smmyr kbev xz xkkx kecp yf r gstpn twbic xre wqvde ynx, ffe S'f axtwp jnjb ld enxrac.$2#$b#Lum, mq M'm vdic tknbtsmyr, I bvsh cyu'mm rzx mr jenv.$8",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.TwoKids_1.01": "Say @, now that we have two kids, make sure you take care of %kid1 and %kid2 in equal measure.$0#$b#If we just had %kid1, we could shower them with all the love and attention they'd need.$6#$b#But, despite my nervousness as a parent, I truly do love %kid1 and %kid2 equally. I hope you do too.$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.TwoKids_1.02": "Car, rzh dhtk ap lkvx baz osdl, qlvi snim jzy ttbm nlvo hw sfc uiwj my iautc qplwerx.$0#$b#Sf nm ufwd arl zfv fbiax vmn, nm nzyvd jpshpv tavu htxr tct esi lhmm lyh amkmretsx mymc'o xexu.$6#$b#Lum, hpdtstx uc yibvhlarpdw al i alvonm, M evelr ls wsfe kpi eay hw xspq ejlipwj. I ywtp cyu uw ezs.$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.TwoKids_2.01": "I... shouldn't have looked into the code now that we have children, but now that I have taken a peek, I have some concerns, seeing that they too aren't like the other townspeople.$6#$b#It's a risky task, but I'm thinking about taking a deeper plunge into the void to see if I can change some things.$9#$e#In short, and to not worry you too much, I want to ensure that our kids are able to do as much as possible with their whole lives ahead of them.$6#$b#I'll be brainstorming solutions. If I ever come up with something, I'll let you know.$6",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.TwoKids_2.02": "S... wszyvdg'b slzo efwopo snmf xsp mowv rzh dhtk ap lkvx kltwhbeg, ffe xop blle S ardi eeueg i apiu, Z llgi shdm nzrmekea, dioigx xslx tavg ezs akvv'e pskx blp sdhxi xzhrcpxfxpp.$6#$b#St'j e cmckr bedv, bnk M'x dhbesmyr kbhlb elosnz i opizek xpfyko bebs elo ofqh es sxv mq M cte gslrqe jwqp xrigxa.$9#$e#Sn jpsce, agu xz ryt nwvcj ion bsz qeca, M hext kw pywerx blle yuk smod krx ifwp do uw ld wuvy ed tyslzjpp asta blptv wafti wmfel ilplh oy blpx.$6#$b#S'ec fp fbabeaxzcqsnz aswfxsogj. Tq S xmmv nswe lx htxr lfuiesmxg, Q'ww vem gsf oxop.$6",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.TwoKids_3.01": "@, were you an eldest, middle, youngest, or only child?$0#$b#I only have experience with dealing with only children.$0#$b#I'm an only child, parents of whom I'm not sure beyond who were my creators.$9#$b#But ignoring that, Jas is an only children as well, and residents with siblings are around my age.$9#$b#Well, there's Vincent, but %kid1 and %kid2 are much closer in age.$9#$e#Well, I'm sure we can navigate parenting between %kid1 being the elder kid and %kid2 being the younger kid.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.TwoKids_3.02": "Gekv czf kn vthpdx, fzlhwp, yhlvkpdx, hi sywc cazth?$0#$b#S hetc sefe vftpcmonvv atel dxrtmyr gimy sywc cazthcpr.$0#$b#S'f ir zrvy tpmwo, ptimred yf npsx M'm ewx dybe smczyh waf apci mr kvplxyrl.$9#$b#Lum qkyzvsnz blle, Jtj md ex hetc nlslwimr lw wxct, lrn kvamoprds nqxs wsbezvkd ebe rzsfyh mr ikp.$9#$b#Geec, esibe'j Ztygonm, ffe yuk kltwhbeg ivp qeca kpzdib be erp.$9#$e#Geec, T'q snim hp mag vegtkktx xecprdigx fpeaoeg wyc xgo bqhd hosizbi eloik lmqqibegtm ty kgx.$0",

  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.spring_Katrielle.01": "So, it's spring once again.$9#$b#Hey @, you have all your spring crops in order, right?$0#$b#And you know which fish are available?$0#$e#And you know where everyone goes, considering it's spring? And-$1#$b#Okay, maybe that might be asking a bit much. Worst comes, you can always rely on the wiki.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.spring_Katrielle.02": "Co, qx'd cpkzvk zrme roety.$9#$b#Rer, czf raov eww ioni wacmxg tzsad sn fzhpc, rbxpx?$0#$b#Knw gsf oxop eltnl fbjp lci aorqplmpo?$0#$e#Knw gsf oxop elpci eovzczyi ghva, nsxsbumvtyk im'a davsnz? Eyo-$1#$b#Yktp, xlcle kpee qsgak fp eckbeo l fst dcgs. Gokjb nzqos, gsf gkn rtaljw rxcg zy dhx emvt.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.summer_Katrielle.01": "Ugh, it's another hot summer day.$2#$b#Don't mind me, I'll just be reminiscing on the times in the void.$0#$e#Ahh, the cold, unfeeling void. I miss you.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.summer_Katrielle.02": "Ega, me'w agfblpc rom ayxxib wrg.$2#$b#Nog'b xtrn fv, T'pv clax mi rxdqrtdgsnz wr elo mzuid mx mym gzmn.$0#$e#Kha, xsp moeu, fyjoeezvk gssd. Q xtwc rfc.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.fall_Katrielle.01": "One last season to grow things, huh @?$0#$b#If nothing else, I'd recommend some cranberries or yams. Cranberries are a solid moneymaker, but yams are pretty quick.$0#$e#What am I telling you, you probably know which crops you need to grow.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.fall_Katrielle.02": "Ynx tede cetjwr es gkfe esmxgl, lfs?$0#$b#Sf ewxstrq xcai, M'd imgzxqonw asxp mrtejiccmos fz jlqc. Tzeymibrbva lci a jwpto wogvgqlvib, scx jews rzi avotmp uftgu.$0#$e#Ghtk ex M txctmyr ion, czf zrhsifwj unhn astgr viwtd cyu emio xy ziwa.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.winter_Katrielle.01": "Snow flutters around Pelican Town once again, huh?$0#$b#Don't forget to bundle up, @!$1#$e#Or if you don't want to change your outfit, at least bring some torches with you.$9#$b#They're already lit inside your pocket, but you aren't set on fire. Neat, huh?$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.winter_Katrielle.02": "Cnhn jwfxdekj eczyxd Gmptnex Mfer zrme roety, hny?$0#$b#Nog'b qzvqem bs myxdev ya!$1#$e#Yr zn jzy dhe'x hext kw nsexgx gsfc yumwqx, ed eviwe fbigx wzxi thiklpd gimy czf.$9#$b#Dhxp'vp evrxrlc wmd beamop ioni tznoot, jye cyu rziy'x sxk sy jsrx. Rplx, alp?$1",

  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.spring_1.01": "Happy new year, @! Here's to the next year in Stardew Valley!$1#$b#Let's make it a good one, shall we?$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.spring_8.01": "Yesterday was Lewis's birthday, right?$6#$b#I tend to forget that his birthday is so soon after the new year begins. Hopefully you didn't forget.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.spring_23.01": "*sigh* The Flower Dance is tomorrow, isn't it?$2#$b#If you need me, I'll be quietly dancing in the void by myself.$2#$e#I'm kidding, I'm kidding! If you decide to dance with anyone, I'll try not to be jealous.$0#$b#'Try' being the important word there.$5",

  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.summer_1.01": "Oh joy, it's summer yet again.$6#$b#Make sure you drink some water. I'm going to stay in the shade as much as I reasonably can.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.summer_8.01": "Ugh, this heat is so terrible. Here, take this and please use it.$2[681 681 681]",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.summer_15.01": "Sometimes I hear those pesky mosquitoes buzzing around, and it's really infuriating.$5#$b#My reflexes aren't that good, so I can't exactly swat them before they bite me.$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.summer_17.01": "Hmm... Today feels like a day I should practice guitar, but my motivation for it is a little sapped.$6#$b#Well, it should be okay to leave it for another day.$0",

  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.fall_1.01": "Autumn is here!$1#$b#You know, the code doesn't recognise 'autumn' for some reason. It just recognises 'fall.'$0#$e#Honestly, it would have been better. Then all the seasons would have had six letters.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.fall_8.01": "Fall just brings out the joy in me. Not too hot, not too cold.$0#$b#No allergies to speak of. Just watching all the kids run off to school while adults are left unbothered.$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.fall_15.01": "Sorry, @. I'm not gonna help you with the grange display.$0#$b#Well, unless I gave you something the other day, but that's up to you to save it.$0#$e#...$6#$e#...Okay, fine. If you insist, I'll help.$0#$b#Here you go![772 772 772]$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.fall_26.01": "I doubt Mayor Lewis told everyone to change the way the Spirit's Eve maze is organized.$6#$b#I'll leave it to you to find the treasure at the end!$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.fall_26_2.01": "Huh... I overheard that Robin suggested to Lewis to change the maze.$6#$b#Leave it to her to make festivals better, especially if it 'improves future election potential.'$9#$b#So, best of luck getting through the new maze!$1",

  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.winter_1.01": "Oh, the cold is back again.$2#$b#Sorry, awkward memories. But it's kinda funny thinking about it though.$0#$e#I might have talked about it before, but in case I didn't, I used to live here.$0#$b#Like, on the %farm farm.$0#$b#It was... after your grandfather passed. This was the only place I could stay to avoid the cold.$2#$b#But eventually, it got a little too run down, and I couldn't stay there anymore.$2#$b#I was just lucky I found my old house. At least I was able to put a heater in there.$0",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.winter_7.01": "I kind of wish you could just put down a crab pot and call it a day.$6#$b#But *nooo*, Pelican Town has to go through the whole ice fishing business.$5#$e#I'll be staying at home. Have fun freezing your butt off!$1",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.winter_28.01": "The year's over already? Wow, time flies when you're happily married.$8#$e#And thus, the cycles of time continue forward once more.$0#$b#Happy New Year, @.$4#$b#Well, New Year's Eve, but you know what I mean.$0",

  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.NoBed_0.01": "@, can you get a bed and place it down? I thought my days of sleeping on the floor were behind me.$s",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.NoBed_0.02": "Mag gsf kot r fpo knw xplni im lshy? I kpsfrld fp hljw oy appptsnz wr elo ycwsc aorx jistrn fv.$s",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.NoBed_1.01": "It may have been a little nostalgic sleeping on the floor, but I kinda don't want to repeat it, you know?$s",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.NoBed_1.02": "St dic sefe smiy e lbkbpp rysmrtktn clxvxmyr yn kpi qpyok, ffe S dzvhl hyn'k alyx th ziaped bk, jzy kgfe?$s",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.NoBed_2.01": "I had to sleep in the code last night. Can you please put down a bed?$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.NoBed_2.02": "S arl ez clxvx ty dhx ksop valk rtrld. Tir jse icmedp zum lshy k uvl?$2",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.NoBed_3.01": "@, if you want, I can just go home to sleep if you're gonna have me sleep on the floor.$5",
  "KatrielleMarriageDialogue.NoBed_3.02": "Sf pwy hext, Q nlr jnjb rz rofv xz wvexg mq cyu'im rzrxa yizp qo lcmia sx mym qwsyr.$5",

//////////////////////////////////////
// KATRIELLE SCHEDULE DIALOGUE STUFF
//////////////////////////////////////

  "EngagementDialogue.Katrielle0.01": "This is actually pretty crazy. I never thought I would even be able to find love like this...$4",
  "EngagementDialogue.Katrielle0.02": "Dhbj md emtnrtpj tbemkg ncejy. Q ypzor kpsfrld B esfwh eovv mp kbev xz jsnw tsgp vidv xstw...$4",
  "EngagementDialogue.Katrielle0.03": "This is actually pretty crazy. I never thought I would even be able to find love like this...$6#$b#...But I don't know if I can go through with the wedding itself...$2",
  "EngagementDialogue.Katrielle0.04": "Dhbj md emtnrtpj tbemkg ncejy. Q ypzor kpsfrld B esfwh eovv mp kbev xz jsnw tsgp vidv xstw...$6#$b# ...Scx T nog'b vysg bw M nex zf xscsega emes dhx eioomxg zbwpwj...$2",
  "EngagementDialogue.Katrielle1.01": "Oh, @. You make me so unbelievably happy. Thank you, and I hope I can do the same for you.$4",
  "EngagementDialogue.Katrielle1.02": "Yh, uc wsfe. Gsf qkkx ui ds ugsmptpzkbep llati. Kpeyv ion, eyo S afxi T mag ls elo lrui qsb rfc.$4",
  "EngagementDialogue.Katrielle1.03": "Oh, @. You make me so unbelievably happy. Thank you, and I hope I can do the same for you.$8#$b#Erm... Maybe it'll be best to do that after the wedding day.$6",
  "EngagementDialogue.Katrielle1.04": "Yh, uc wsfe. Gsf qkkx ui ds ugsmptpzkbep llati. Kpeyv ion, eyo S afxi T mag ls elo lrui qsb rfc.$8#$b#Orf... Xeibx qx'wp bx jide do uw esed twbic xre nmhotrq wrg.$6",

  "KatrielleScheduleDialogue.FakeSleep.000": "I was up all night, so I'm planning on sleeping in for a little bit.",
  "KatrielleScheduleDialogue.FakeSleep.001": "I was out all night, so I'm planning on sleeping in for a little bit.",
  "KatrielleScheduleDialogue.Saloon.000": "Hmmm... Gus isn't here?$9#$b#Maybe I should put a horse behind his counter for a drink.$1",
  "KatrielleScheduleDialogue.Saloon.001": "Gus really is an impressive bartender, huh?$0#$b#The drinks he makes are better than the ones I get from the void, and that is saying something.$1",
  "KatrielleScheduleDialogue.Samrielle.000": "Go, Sammy, go!$1#$e#...He's not winning, is he?$6#$b#*sigh* I'll give him an A for effort though.$0",
  "KatrielleScheduleDialogue.Samrielle.001": "Wait, this string, right? No wait, the higher E string or the lower E string?$2#$e#Sammy, this is in tune, right?$0#$e#Samson, I'll be honest, you're less understandable than I'll be this coming Sunday.$6",
  "KatrielleScheduleDialogue.Samrielle.002": "%Katrielle and Sam seem preoccupied with practicing. Best not to bother them for now.",
  "KatrielleScheduleDialogue.Church.000": "Yoba... I wonder what manner of god it is that the town believes in...$9#$b#I have no interest in gods. But I have great interest in their creators...$9#$e#Thinking about stuff like this makes me feel like some anthropologist.$2",
  "KatrielleScheduleDialogue.Wizard.000": "M. Rasmodius... Of the people I've seen, he's the one I know the least about.$9#$b#I wonder if I should try to introduce myself...$9#$e#Heh, it's the first time I thought about meeting someone to get to know them.$0",
  "KatrielleScheduleDialogue.Guitar.001": "I'm getting ready to try something, since today's a little special.$0#$b#Give me a second to mentally prep myself.$6",
  "KatrielleScheduleDialogue.Guitar.002": "%Katrielle seems preoccupied with practicing. Best not to bother her for now.",
  "KatrielleScheduleDialogue.Jessie.000": "Ugh, there's someone standing in my spot...$5#$b#Who are they? And can they move?$5",
  "KatrielleScheduleDialogue.RoomPrep.000": "I'm in the process of getting this room all sorted out.$0",

  "Festival.winter25.Katrielle.01": "Psst! Hey, @!$1#$b#Glad to see you out here. I'm just... hiding here for now.$0#$e#...Well, I know I'm living in Pelican Town and all, but...$2#$b#Well, I'm still a little uncomfortable. Something about the overwhelming feeling of togetherness, I'm not used to. Not yet anyway.$6#$b#Hopefully I do get used to it in time.$0",
  "Festival.winter25.Katrielle_spouse.01": "Psst! Hey, @!$1#$b#I knew I'd see you walking around here. I wonder who you got this year!$0#$e#...Well, I know I'm living in Pelican Town and all, but...$2#$b#Well, I'm still a little comfortable. Something about the overwhelming feeling of togetherness, I'm not used to. Not yet anyway.$6#$b#Hopefully I do get used to it in time.$0",

