////////////////////////////////

  "SamScheduleDialogue.Samrielle.000": "Mom seems okay. A little overworked, maybe.",
  "SamScheduleDialogue.Samrielle.001": "Vincent seems a little lonely without me around. I used to play with him a lot.",
  "SamScheduleDialogue.Samrielle.002": "Hey Kat, doublecheck your E string. It sounds a little sharp.$0#$e#No way, now my G string's all messed up. And I just replaced it!$2#$e#G major, D suspended two, C minor, F seven, back to G major...$7#$b#Kat, don't worry, I'll write down the tab for you once I get it in my head.",
  "SamScheduleDialogue.Samrielle.003": "%Katrielle and Sam seem preoccupied with practicing. Best not to bother them for now.",
  "SamScheduleDialogue.winter_17.000": "After today, I'll be able to go home and see Katrielle.$7#$b#Man, I really miss her.$2",
  "SamScheduleDialogue.RoomPrep.000": "I'll never get sick of looking around this place.$0#$b#Really feels like I stepped into another world!$1",

  "SamDialogue.samrielleDialogue1.01": "Hey @, thanks again for helping me out!$1#$b#Sometimes, getting a second opinion with music can help you push an idea to its limit!$1",
  "SamDialogue.Tue4.01": "When I was visiting, I tried fixing a bowl of cereal for my dad, but as soon as I poured milk on it, he flipped out. What was up with that?$s",
  "SamDialogue.Wed10.01": "Hey @, how's my best friend doing?$1#$b#Uhh... Second best friend. Sebastian's still first.$3",
  "SamDialogue.Thu10.01": "Y'know, Katrielle talks a lot. Like, *a lot* a lot.$0#$e#But she has a lot of really interesting ideas for songs. And I love her so much for it.$1",
  "SamDialogue.Fri10.01": "Every day living at my new place, it gets me get more attached.#$b#Although I could be biased... for a certain reason.$10#$e#So, how are you doing today?$h",
  "SamDialogue.spring_12.01": "My little brother gets so excited for festivals. I bet he's been talking about tomorrow's egg hunt the entire day.",
  "SamDialogue.spring_23.01": "Kat mentioned something about how I'm unable to dance with her at the Flower Dance.$2#$b#She said that she couldn't go for some reason, so I'll probably dance with Penny.$2",
  "SamDialogue.summer_Tue4.01": "Hi, @. Do you want to hang out or something?#$e#I'm so energized during summer I hardly have to sleep!$0#$e#Uhh, maybe I'll ask if Kat's okay with it first.$0",
  "SamDialogue.summer_Thu6.01": "Mom mentioned how she could hear my Dad pacing down the hallway at night.$s#$b#...But he won't tell us what's troubling him.",
  "SamDialogue.fall_Thu6.01": "I wonder how things are back at home...$s#$e#...I miss Mom's fish casserole, so maybe I'll pass by...$s#$e#Maybe when I do, I'll bring Kat some leftovers.",
  "SamDialogue.fall_Fri10.01": "I think I've grown to like Kat's house more than being back at home.$h#$b#Although I could be biased... for a certain reason.$10#$e#So, how are you doing today?$h",
  "SamDialogue.fall_Sat4.01": "I'm sharing a room with someone now, but I don't care.$0#$e#I'm lucky to have married someone with a sick place.",
  "SamDialogue.fall_Sun.01": "It's hard to have fun on Sunday... I know I have to get up early to visit everyone back at home.$s",
  "SamDialogue.fall_14.01": "Hi @.#$e#Hmm.. I wonder if I could grow a cactus in my room?#$e#Can I grow anything in this room?",
  "SamDialogue.winter_Mon2.01": "Before getting married, winter was awesome because I can play guitar as loud as I want.$h#$e#Everyone stays indoors because of the snow, and I'd be able to jam out.$0",
  "SamDialogue.winter_Tue2.01": "Have you seen Katrielle anywhere in the afternoon?$2#$b#She leaves super early, and I have no clue where she goes.$2",
  "SamDialogue.winter_Sun.01": "Try not to make a mess in the house or Katrielle will flip.",
  "SamDialogue.winter_15.01": "Katrielle told me to sleep in my old house.$2#$b#I wonder why...$2",
  "SamDialogue.winter_15_2.01": "Katrielle told me to sleep in my old house.$2#$b#I wonder why...$2",
  "SamDialogue.winter_16.01": "@! Have you seen Katrielle!?$8#$b#I tried going back home to talk to her, but the Night Market blocked everything.$2#$e#...I think this is the reason why she told me to sleep at my old home.",
  "SamDialogue.winter_16_2.01": "@! Have you seen Katrielle!?$8#$b#I tried going back home to talk to her, but the Night Market blocked everything.$2#$e#...I think this is the reason why she told me to sleep at my old home.",
  "SamDialogue.winter_17.01": "The Night Market ends today, right?$7#$b#It's only been three days, but it felt like an eternity since I saw Katrielle.$2",
  "SamDialogue.winter_17_2.01": "The Night Market ends today, right?$7#$b#It's only been three days, but it felt like an eternity since I saw Katrielle.$2",

  "FlowerDanceDialogue.Sam.01": "Even though I'm with Kat, I have to dance with Penny, and it's not like it's romantic or anything.$0#$b#But man, I wish I had a chance to dance with Katrielle instead...$2",

  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.Mon2.01": "Hey, how's it going?#$e#Last night Kat and I practiced guitar for 4 hours straight. My fingers hurt like crazy.$s#$e#Bye, I've got something to do...",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.Thu10.01": "Y'know, Katrielle talks a lot. Like, *a lot* a lot.$0#$e#But she has a lot of really interesting ideas for songs. And I love her so much for it.$1",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.Fri10.01": "Every day living at my new place, it gets me get more attached.#$b#Although I could be biased... for a certain reason.$10#$e#So, how are you doing today?$h",

  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.summer_Tue6.01": "Hmm, tomorrow morning should be pancake day.#$e#Hopefully mom will make some for Vince. I bet he would really like that.",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.summer_Tue10.01": "Maybe I should learn how to cook.#$b#You wouldn't mind being my taste tester, right?$h#$e#I don't wanna poison Katrielle after all.$l",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.summer_Fri4.01":"Oh man. I ate an entire large pizza at like... eleven last night.#$e#Kat just handed me a full pizza, and I was like, 'jackpot'!#$e#...Haha, nope, I feel fine.$h",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.summer_Fri6.01":"I was homesick a lot when we first moved here, but that was ages ago.#$e#Pelican Town really is the only home Vince has ever known. Seeing him fit in makes it easier for me, too.",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.summer_Fri10.01":"Ever since I wrote a song about Kat, I feel like I have a lot more confidence with...$0#$b#...With my girlfriend!$1#$e#I have confidence with her, but saying the words 'my girlfriend?' Still brand new to me.$1",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.summer_Fri10.02":"Ever since I wrote a song about Kat, I feel like I have a lot more confidence with...$0#$b#...With my wife!$1#$e#I have confidence with her, but saying the words 'my wife?' Still brand new to me.$1",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.summer_Sun2.01":"Hey, having a good summer?#$e#Stop by our place if you're looking for somewhere to cool off.",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.summer_Sun8.01":"Ever notice how there are a ton of single old dudes in Pelican Town?$s#$e#It's just kinda weird, don't you think?$s#$e#I can't help but to feel little smug though, since me and Kat got married.",

  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.fall_Mon6_1.01": "Band practice went awesome last week. Abby and Sebastian have been putting in a lot of hard work.$0#$b#Kat cheered us on, too.$1",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.fall_Mon10_1.01": "You're the best, @. I can't wait for my dad to meet you and Katrielle when he gets back.$l",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.fall_Tue6.01": "After Dad left for his tour, I made a conscious decision to give Vince the best childhood he can get.#$e#I realized, if I don't help make that happen for him, who else will?$0#$e#...I hope marrying Kat didn't stop that.$2",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.fall_Tue8.01": "Last time I visited home, I did a little cleaning up to make things easier for my mom, but she doesn't actually seem any happier.#$e#She was thankful, but... I dunno. She's always saying that's her biggest source of stress. I'm not so sure, though.",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.fall_Wed6.01": "I think I'm becoming a pizza purist. Toppings are nice, but if you get just the right blend of cheeses, that's all you really need.#$e#I don't know how, but Katrielle always seems to find amazing pizza.$0",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.fall_Wed8.01": "Man, I could really go for a slice. Maybe next time you visit me and Kat, we can get some together.$0",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.fall_Thu4.01": "Hi @.#$e#Hmm.. I wonder if I could grow a cactus in my room?#$e#Can I grow anything in this room?",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.fall_Thu6.01": "I wonder how things are back at home...$s#$e#...I miss Mom's fish casserole, so maybe I'll pass by...$s#$e#Maybe when I do, I'll bring Kat some leftovers.",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.fall_Fri6.01": "...I stayed up late playing games on the computer last night. I really wish I'd focused on writing some more lyrics.",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.fall_Sat2.01": "Hi @.#$e#Hmm.. I wonder if I could grow a cactus in my room?#$e#Can I grow anything in this room?",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.fall_Sat4.01": "I'm sharing a room with someone now, but I don't care.$0#$e#I'm lucky to have married someone with a sick place.",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.fall_Sun6.01": "It's hard to have fun on Sunday... I know I have to get up early to visit everyone back at home.$s",

  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.winter_Mon2.01": "Before getting married, winter was awesome because I can play guitar as loud as I want.$h#$e#Everyone stays indoors because of the snow, and I'd be able to jam out.$0",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.winter_Mon10.01": "Kat always sleeps like a rock. I turn my amp up to 10, and she'd still snore right through it.$0#$b#But then again, she usually gets up earlier than I do.",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.winter_Tue8.01": "Penny and I used to hang out a lot when we first moved here.#$e#We still hang out occasionally, and we've got this weird, almost... flirty? ...thing going, but we don't have a lot in common anymore.$s#$e#...Don't tell Kat that.$0",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.winter_Tue8_inlaw_Penny.01": "I'm glad things worked out for you and Penny! I always kinda wondered if she'd find anyone.$h",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.winter_Wed10.01": "Kat has those cool powers that makes food and stuff.$0#$b#But she seems shy when it comes to giving it to someone aside from me or you...$2#$e#I wonder if I should push her to give a little more, you know?$0",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.winter_Fri10.01":"@! It's so good to see you!$h#$e#Yo, pass by our place if you wanna hang with me and Kat.$1",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.winter_Sat6.01": "After we moved here, Penny and I grew up together. Now she's my little brother's teacher. How does that even happen?#$e#And I'm married now with Katrielle.$0#$b#I guess Sebastian was right about everyone taking the next steps in life.#$e#You do, too, for that matter.",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.winter_Sun4.01": "Before getting married, Vince would always run into the house with wet shoes. Hopefully he learned better now that I'm not there.",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.winter_Sun6.01": "Try not to make a mess in my old house. My Mom's pretty obsessive about keeping things clean.#$e#It was uh... actually a legit struggle sometimes...$s",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.winter_Sun10.01":"I wonder if my mom is finally a little happier now that I moved out.#$e#I wonder if she was stressed just because she's worried about me?",

  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.spring_12.01": "My little brother gets so excited for festivals. I bet he's been talking about tomorrow's egg hunt the entire day.",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.spring_23.01": "Kat mentioned something about how I'm unable to dance with her at the Flower Dance.$2#$b#She said that she couldn't go for some reason, so I'll probably dance with Penny.$2",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.spring_12_2.01": "My little brother gets so excited for festivals. I bet he's been talking about tomorrow's egg hunt the entire day.",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.spring_23_2.01": "Kat mentioned something about how I'm unable to dance with her at the Flower Dance.$2#$b#She said that she couldn't go for some reason, so I'll probably dance with Penny.$2",

  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.fall_14.01": "Hi @.#$e#Hmm.. I wonder if I could grow a cactus in my room?#$e#Can I grow anything in this room?",
  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.fall_14_2.01": "Hi @.#$e#Hmm.. I wonder if I could grow a cactus in my room?#$e#Can I grow anything in this room?",

  "SamDialogue.CanonFriendlyDialogue.winter_28_2.01": "I wonder if Vincent is staying up late tonight. I wish I could be there with him.$2",

  "AbigailScheduleDialogue.Samrielle.000": "Say, Kat, I know you want to root for Sam, but I don't think your hubby has ever beaten Sebastian.$1#$e#Maybe one day Sebastian will let him win.$0",
  "AbigailScheduleDialogue.marriage_Fri.001.01": "It's nice to see the ol' gang again. Nothing's changed.$h#$e#Well, actually, Sam and Kat are married now, come to think of it.$0#$b#Man, if Sebastian gets married too? That'd be awesome!$0#$e#Maybe one day Sebastian will find someone, but knowing him, he'll probably take his time.$0",
  "AbigailScheduleDialogue.marriage_Fri.001.02": "It's nice to see the ol' gang again. Nothing's changed.$h#$e#Well, actually, Sam and Kat are married now, come to think of it.$0#$b#And Sebastian's married too!$1#$b#Wow, everyone's getting older, huh?$0",

  "SebastianScheduleDialogue.Fri.000": "Should I let Sam win for once? ...nah.$h#$e#Sorry, Katrielle. Just because your husband got married to you doesn't mean I'm not gonna thrash him.$1",
  "SebastianScheduleDialogue.marriage_Fri.001.01": "It's nice hanging out and beating Sam once again.$1#$b#Don't worry, I'll be home later after I'm done hanging out with my old friends.$0#$e#...What? Katrielle's an old friend too.$1#$e#Between you and me, I hope Abigail finds someone too.$0#$b#After all, Sam's got Katrielle, and I got you, @.$4",
  "SebastianScheduleDialogue.marriage_Fri.001.02": "It's nice hanging out and beating Sam once again.$1#$b#Don't worry, I'll be home later after I'm done hanging out with my old friends.$0#$e#...What? Katrielle's an old friend too.$1#$e#Between you and me, I'm glad Abigail found someone too.$0#$b#All of my friends found someone, and I found someone too.$4",

  "AbigailDialogue.summer_Tue8.01": "Kat's place at the beach is really nice.$0#$b#The privacy there is really awesome.$1",
  "AbigailDialogue.summer_Tue8.02": "Kat's place at the beach is really nice.$0#$b#The privacy there is really awesome.$1#$e#I know Sam's been going there without me or Sebastian. I wonder what they're doing.$0",
  "AbigailDialogue.fall_Wed6.01": "Hey @, don't tell my mom or dad, but sometimes, me and Sebastian head over to Kat's house after two in the morning.$1#$b#Her place is really weird, but I love it there!$0",
  "AbigailDialogue.fall_Wed6.02": "Hey @, don't tell my mom or dad, but sometimes, me, Sam, and Sebastian sneak over to Kat's house after two in the morning.$1#$b#Her place is really weird, but I love it there!$0",
  "AbigailDialogue.winter_Sun8.01": "So, @. You ever wonder what Sam and Kat are up to?$0#$b#I know there's some days where Sam and Kat are in her house by themselves.$3#$b#Don't you think that there's something... suspicious?$1#$e#Kat's not the type of person to 'kiss and tell' but I bet Sam will blurt out all of the juicy details to Sebastian.$4#$b#I hope Sam and Katrielle works out.$1#$e#Sam and Katrielle...$6#$b#Sam and Katrielle...!$0#$b#Samrielle! Long live Samrielle!$1",

  "AlexDialogue.winter_Sat6.01": "This town's getting weirder and weirder with every person that moves in.$0#$b#That one chick with the purple and green hair is definitely the weirdest one yet.$9#$e#You're pretty normal though.$1",

  "CarolineDialogue.summer_Wed4.01": "I'm glad that my daughter found another girl in town to talk to.$0#$b#She never really seemed to get along with anyone else aside from those two boys.$2",
  "CarolineDialogue.winter_Sun6.01": "Abby asked me to brew some tea late last night.$2#$b#I wonder how she managed to get any sleep drinking it that late?$0",

  "ClintDialogue.Wed6.01": "I don't think that woman that moved in recently is gonna need a blacksmith.$0#$b#I was hoping the next person that was moving in was a miner or another farmer.$0",

  "ElliottDialogue.fall_Mon2.01": "That strange woman across the sea seems to walk past my humble abode more often.$0#$b#I find that to be a splendid thing. I wonder what tales she's lived through.$0",
  "ElliottDialogue.winter_Sat6.01": "I find it very odd that I've seen... Katrielle, was it?$0#$b#I find it odd that I've seen her before nearly everyone else. In a way, I'm very honored.$1",

  "EmilyDialogue.summer_Mon2.01": "Katrielle's a funny one. She comes to the saloon every so often, and talks about this 'code' that she lived in.$0#$b#Maybe it's a different type of spirit that are around us?$0", 
  "EmilyDialogue.fall_Thu6.01": "Hey @, do you mind if I ask you about Katrielle?$3#$b#I could have sworn that I saw her... flicker or something?$3#$e#Maybe I'm just seeing things.$0",

  "GeorgeDialogue.fall_Thu6.01": "That girl that moved in, she rubs me the wrong way.$0#$e#Maybe I'm just old-fashioned, but something just doesn't sit right with the way she looks.$0",

  "JodiDialogue.Wed10.01": "Sam's been sneaking off early in the morning.$3#$b#...But he's getting to be that age, huh? He grew up so fast.$2",
  "JodiDialogue.Wed10.02": "I remember when Sam was sneaking out of his room before he got married.$0#$b#He really thought I didn't notice anything, including whatever that thing that Katrielle put in his room.$4#$e#Even when you're married, moms know a lot more than they let on.$1",
  "JodiDialogue.summer_Mon6.01": "Katrielle and Sam have been dating, and I'm really happy for them.$0#$b#Almost reminds me how me and my husband were when we were younger.$1",
  "JodiDialogue.summer_Mon6.02": "Katrielle and Sam are married now, and I'm really happy for them.$0#$e#But I'm a little scared for them.$2#$b#I hope they don't make the same mistakes me and my husband made when we were younger.$2",
  "JodiDialogue.summer_Mon6_2.01": "Katrielle and Sam have been dating, and I'm really happy for them.$0#$b#Almost reminds me how me and Kent were when we were younger.$1",
  "JodiDialogue.summer_Mon6_2.02": "Katrielle and Sam are married now, and I'm really happy for them.$0#$e#But I'm a little scared for them.$2#$b#I hope they don't make the same mistakes me and Kent made when we were younger.$2",
  "JodiDialogue.fall_Mon6.01": "Sam always takes the time to visit home every week.$0#$b#It makes it feel like nothing's changed for that one day.$0",
  "JodiDialogue.winter_Tue2.01": "Now that Sam is married, I can really give Vincent my undivided attention.$0#$b#Good thing too, because Vincent is way more energetic than Sam ever was!$1",

  "KentDialogue.summer_Mon6.01": "Sam and that Katrielle girl's getting close, huh?$0#$b#I wonder how he'll be when he's married.$0#$e#If I was younger, it'd be a lot easier to be excited about that. Now...$2#$b#...Never mind. Ignore me, @.$0",
  "KentDialogue.summer_Mon6.02": "In a sense, I feel like being at home with Vincent but without Sam brings me back several years, when Sam was a kid.$0#$b#It's nostalgic, but a little empty.$0",
  "KentDialogue.summer_Thu8.01": "I don't know that Katrielle girl too well.$0#$b#But I can see that Sam's happy. Can't complain if that's the case.$1",
  "KentDialogue.fall_Thu2.01": "Hey. You run around the town, right?$0#$b#If you see my older son, tell him to visit home sometime.$0",
  "KentDialogue.fall_Thu8.01": "Hey, @. You're close with Sam, right?$0#$b#If you see him, tell him to visit home sometime.$0#$e#...I want to tell him that I'm proud of him, and...$0#$b#On second thought, maybe I'll go find him myself.$1",

  "PierreDialogue.Wed2.01": "I haven't seen Katrielle come to my shop much. But I hear she's with Abigail on occasion.$2#$b#Maybe she could buy a thing or two if she ever visits her.$0",
  "PierreDialogue.winter_Sun6.01": "@, my daughter and that Katrielle girl are good friends, right?$0#$b#I don't know much about her, but I hope she's a good influence on Abigail.$2",

  "SebastianDialogue.Tue2.01": "Katrielle and I seem to understand each other.$0#$b#Sitting at home on our computers all our lives will do that to you.$0",
  "SebastianDialogue.Tue2.02": "Katrielle and I seem to understand each other.$0#$b#Sitting at home on our computers all our lives will do that to you.$0#$e#And, I guess we both get along with Sam too.",
  "SebastianDialogue.summer_Mon8.01": "Abigail and Katrielle have gotten close very quickly.$0#$b#They might almost be as close as me and Sam.$1",
  "SebastianDialogue.summer_Mon8.02": "Abigail and Katrielle have gotten close very quickly.$0#$b#But, I know Katrielle and Sam are closer than our old trio.$0#$e#...Well, I'm happy for him, if a little jealous.$1",
  "SebastianDialogue.winter_Sun8.01": "Abigail is so convinced that Katrielle and Sam are doing something whenever the two of them are alone.$0#$b#Sam told me they're just practicing the guitar or talking. But he isn't a good liar.$1#$e#But knowing Sam and how dense he can be sometimes, I don't think they're doing anything unsavory.$0#$b#Well, whether Katrielle and Sam are just talking or doing anything more, I'm glad they're doing well.$1",

  "VincentDialogue.katrielle2HeartDialogue.01": "I wonder who that weird girl was, and why she was looking into my brothers room.$3",
  "VincentDialogue.Thu10.01": "Is Sam gonna marry the weird girl? I don't want him to leave.$2#$b#But he's happy. Should I be happy or sad?$3",
  "VincentDialogue.Thu10.02": "I know my brother is married with the weird lady, but I miss him.$2#$b#But he's happy. Should I be happy or sad?$3",
  "VincentDialogue.summer_Tue6.01": "My brother's girlfriend is really weird.$3#$b#But you're really weird too, and I like you!$0",
  "VincentDialogue.summer_Tue6.02": "My brother's wife is really weird.$3#$b#But you're really weird too, and I like you!$0",
  "VincentDialogue.fall_Sat2.01": "My brother said we could visit his girlfriend's house, but she scares me.$2",
  "VincentDialogue.fall_Sat2.02": "My brother said I could visit him in his new house, but his wife scares me.$2",
  "VincentDialogue.winter_Wed6.01": "My older brother said he has to come home when the market is here.$0#$b#I wonder if he's gonna get me something!$1",
  
//////////////////////////////////////
// KATRIELLE EVENT DIALOGUE
//////////////////////////////////////

  "Event.0Heart.Elliott1.01": "Hmm? Oh, hello farmer.$1#$b#It's rather late, so if you'll excuse me. Let me get out of your way.$0",
  "Event.0Heart.Elliott1.02": "...I'm sorry, I just don't see it.$2#$b#Regardless, it's rather late, so I'll be off to my cabin.$0#$b#Good night, Willy.$0",
  "Event.0Heart.Willy1.01": "Elliott, I knew ye be coming back here!$u",
  "Event.0Heart.Willy1.02": "...$2",
  "Event.0Heart.Willy2.01": "Ah, ahoy there, @! I thought you were me matey!$0#$b#Say, have you caught any nighttime fish?$0#$b#Hehehe, hopefully I'll get a chance to buy anythin' ya caught! But not today, me shop's closed now.$1",
  "Event.0Heart.Willy2.02": "Ah, ahoy there, @! You scared me for a moment!$0#$b#Say, have you caught any nighttime fish?$0#$b#Hehehe, hopefully I'll get a chance to buy anythin' ya caught! But not today, me shop's closed now.$1",
  "Event.0Heart.Willy3.01": "Say, by chance have you seen a lassie... walk on the water?$2#$b#I know it sounds odd and all, but I swear, I saw 'er with me own two eyes!$0#$b#I tried showing Elliott, but it'd be too dark for him to see.$0#$b#I blame all the writin' the lad's been doin'.",
  "Event.0Heart.Willy3.02": "Say, by chance have you seen a lassie... walk into this here rock?$2#$b#I know it sounds odd and all, but I swear, I saw 'er with me own two eyes!$0#$b#I tried showing Elliott, but it'd be too dark for him to see.$0#$b#I blame all the writin' the lad's been doin'.$0#$b#C'mere, Look at it. Doesn't this rock seem outta place?$2",
  "Event.0Heart.Willy4.01": "Well, it could have been nothin'. I *am* getting quite old, and I can only see as far as my line goes in the water.$h",
  "Event.0Heart.Willy4.02": "Well, it could have been nothin'. I *am* getting quite old, and I can only see the shapes of the fish in the water.$h",
  "Event.0Heart.Willy5.01": "If you don't mind doing an old sea dog a favor, could you check out the pier on the other side?$0#$b#Maybe there's something over there worth looking at, though perhaps you should check in the mornin'.#$b#Also, thanks for fixing that there bridge. It's been a real hassle trying to get the wood to fix 'er up.$1#$b#G'night, @. I'll see ya in the mornin'.",
  "Event.0Heart.Willy5.02": "If you don't mind doing an old sea dog a favor, could you check out the pier on the other side?$0#$b#Maybe there's something over there that we can't see from here, though perhaps you should check in the mornin'.#$b#Also, thanks for fixing that there bridge. It's been a real hassle trying to get the wood to fix 'er up.$1#$b#Hmm... I wonder what be there...$0",
  "Event.0Heart.Willy5.03": "If you don't mind doing an old sea dog a favor, could you check out the pier on the other side?$0#$b#Maybe there's something over there that we can't see from here, though perhaps you should check in the mornin'.#$b#Ye might want to fix that there bridge. It's been a real hassle trying to get the wood to fix 'er up.$1#$b#Hmm... I wonder what be there...$0",
  "Event.0Heart.Narration1.01": "...Is there something on the water?",
  "Event.0Heart.Narration1.02": "...Is there something in this rock?",

  "Event.2Heart.Katrielle1.01": "Oh, hey @! I wasn't expecting to see you there.$1",
  "Event.2Heart.Katrielle2.01": "Though, I guess it's expected to see you this early, huh? Farmers usually are early birds, after all.",
  "Event.2Heart.Katrielle3.01": "I don't usually leave this early to go to town.$6#$b#But only a couple of people are milling about at this time. It's a good opportunity to walk around without running into anyone.$0#$b#Though truth be told, I'm actually more of a night owl.$1#$b#But ever since I met you, this is one of the only times I feel comfortable to go out.$6",
  "Event.2Heart.Katrielle4.01": "I don't really know how to feel now. But I don't think things are changing-$2",
  "Event.2Heart.Katrielle5.01": "Woah... That's Sam's guitar playing. He never plays it this early.$0",
  "Event.2Heart.Katrielle6.01": "What a treat! He sounds awesome!$1#$b#...$8",
  "Event.2Heart.Katrielle7.01": "Hm? What happened?",
  "Event.2Heart.Jodi1.01": "Sam, stop practicing your guitar! You already woke up your brother, and you're gonna wake up all of the neighbors next!$3",
  "Event.2Heart.Sam1.01": "Alright, mom.$2",
  "Event.2Heart.Vincent1.01": "Who are you, miss? And why are you standing outside of our house?$3",
  "Event.2Heart.Katrielle8.01": "Ahhh!!!",
  "Event.2Heart.End.Emily.01": "Hi @!$0#$b#I'm a little tired since one of the neighbors was practicing their guitar, but I'm still ready to tackle the day.$1#$e#Hmm... I think I saw someone earlier this morning.$3#$b#But I was still groggy, so I went straight back to bed.$1",
  "Event.2Heart.End.Emily.02": "Hi @!$0#$b#I'm a little tired since one of the neighbors was practicing their guitar, but I'm still ready to tackle the day.$1#$e#Hmm... I think I saw someone earlier this morning.$3#$b#But after seeing her jump like twelve feet in the air, I thought I was still sleeping, so I went straight back to bed.$1",

  "Event.Samrielle.2Heart.Sam1.01": "Oh, farmer. How's it going?$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.2Heart.Sam2.01": "Say, @. You've enjoyed the music Sebastian and I played when we were practicing, right?$2#$b#While I'm still working on that, I also wanted to write another song.$0#$b#It's not so much for the band to play on a stage or something like that. It's more about experimenting with what sounds good.$0#$b#I've been having a hard time making any progress though.$2#$b#It came to mind this morning, but my mom asked me to stop playing and I couldn't remember it.$5",
  "Event.Samrielle.2Heart.Sam3.01": "Anyway, come to think of it, might as well ask you.$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.2Heart.Fork.01": "Say the first thing off the top of your head.#Fighting through the mines and slaying monsters.#A mysterious girl walking on water.#Flying through the sky, riding on a cloud.#A farmer singlehandedly saving the entire economy.",
    //Fork1
  "Event.Samrielle.2Heart.Sam4.01": "Hmm... Interesting.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.2Heart.Fork1.Sam1.01": "Well, unfortunately, it's a little too familiar. I was trying to think of something out of the box, you know?$2#$b#I'll figure something out, @. Thanks anyway for the help!$1",
    //Fork2
  //"Event.Samrielle.2Heart.Sam4.01": "Hmm... Interesting.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.2Heart.Fork2.Sam1.01": "Hmmm... Interesting!$1#$b#Yeah, yeah. Actually, that's sounds amazing!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.2Heart.Fork2.Sam2.01": "Okay, I got a couple of new ideas to test out.$1#$b#I'm gonna start practicing now! Hey @, I'll talk to you later, alright?$1",

  "Event.4Heart.Katrielle1.01": "Hmm... When are they coming?$6",
  "Event.4Heart.Katrielle2.01": "Oh, g'afternoon, @! Don't mind me, I'm just waiting for Abigail and Sebastian.$0#$b#I heard they were going to be exploring the caves today, and I'm sure something interesting is gonna happen!$1",
  "Event.4Heart.Katrielle3.01": "Though, I can't find a good hiding spot that gives me a chance to see everything that's happening...$6",
  "Event.4Heart.QuickQuestion1.Question.01": "...",
  "Event.4Heart.QuickQuestion1.Answer1.01": "Why do you want to avoid running into people?",
  "Event.4Heart.QuickQuestion1.Answer1.02": "Well, I never talked to anyone else, aside from you.$6#$b#You're the first person I can talk to, and the only person I feel comfortable talking to.#0#$b#I hope I'm doing a good job with the whole 'talking' thing. But I guess you can be the judge of that.$0#$b#*sigh*...$2",
  "Event.4Heart.QuickQuestion1.Answer2.01": "Do you always stalk everyone in town?",
  "Event.4Heart.QuickQuestion1.Answer2.02": "It's not stalking!$5#$b#It's like watching reality television. Before, they wouldn't even be able to interact with me.$5#$b#I was invisible to them, to everyone. At most, I could maybe give or take something from them, but that's about it.$2#$b#And then, somehow you came along and did something to ruin it!$5",
  "Event.4Heart.QuickQuestion1.Answer2.03": "I'm sorry, I didn't mean to get so angry.$2#$b#Even if it was a rude thing to ask.$6",
  "Event.4Heart.QuickQuestion1.Answer3.01": "What do you think is gonna happen between them?",
  "Event.4Heart.QuickQuestion1.Answer3.02": "Well, I'd call myself a 'Sebigail' shipper, so I was hoping I'd see some romantic sparks fly!$1#$b#Oh gosh, maybe Abigail trips and Sebastian heroically catches her before she falls!$8#$b#Or maybe it's the other way around. Abigail can be a pretty tough girl, after all!$8#$b#I'm so excited to see what happens.$1",
  "Event.4Heart.QuickQuestion2.01": "$q 999941 null#...#$r 999941 0 event_4_heart1#Why do you like watching people so much?#$r 999941 0 event_4_heart2#Do you want to be friends with them?",
  "Event.4Heart.Abigail1.01": "@?$0",
  "Event.4Heart.Abigail2.01": "Who are you talking to?$6",
  "Event.4Heart.Katrielle4.01": "I... uh... I'm sorry!$17",
  "Event.4Heart.Abigail3.01": "What was that all about?$6",
  "Event.4Heart.Fork.01": "Who was that girl?#Katrielle's a friend.#Katrielle's an omnipotent being.",
  //Fork1
  "Event.4Heart.Fork1.Sebastian1.01": "Your friend can stand on water?$0#$b#...That's strange.$0",
  "Event.4Heart.Fork1.Abigail1.01": "But that's so cool! Do you think Kat can teach me how to do that too?$1#$b#And did she teleport? Is she a wizard?$1",
  "Event.4Heart.Sebastian1.01": "'Kat?' You're going to call someone you haven't officially met by a nickname?",
  "Event.4Heart.Abigail4.01": "Absolutely.$0",
  "Event.4Heart.Sebastian2.01": "So Abigail, what exactly did you want to show me?$0",
  "Event.4Heart.Abigail5.01": "You'll see. It's a little creature wearing a brown cloak.$0",
  "Event.4Heart.Abigail5.02": "You'll see. It's a little creature wearing a brown cloak.$0#$b#I'll show you! The mines awaits! Feel free to come with, if you'd like, @. The more the merrier, after all.$1#$b#Too bad Sam wasn't able to come, though...$2",
  "Event.4Heart.Fork1.Sebastian2.01": "Hmm? @, you know what we're talking about?$0",
  "Event.4Heart.Abigail6.01": "@! Come on, show us! The mines awaits! The more the merrier, after all.$1#$b#Too bad Sam wasn't able to come, though...$2",
  "Event.4Heart.Sebastian3.01": "He mentioned something about practicing. Not much we can do there. Anyway...$0#$b#I have a pocket knife just in case it gets dangerous.$1#$b#Plus, we got you coming along with us, right @?$0",
  "Event.4Heart.Sebastian3.02": "He mentioned something about practicing. Not much we can do there. Anyway...$0#$b#I have a pocket knife just in case it gets dangerous.$1#$b#So @, you coming?$0",
  "Event.4Heart.Sebastian3.03": "He mentioned something about practicing. Not much we can do there. Anyway...$0#$b#I have a pocket knife just in case it gets dangerous.$1#$b#@, you coming?$0",
  "Event.4Heart.Fork1.Abigail2.01": "What, really? *sigh*$2#$b#All right, Sebastian, let's go!$1",
  "Event.4Heart.Fork1.Abigail2.02": "Okay, suit yourself.$0#$b#All right, Sebastian, let's go!$1",
  //Fork2
  "Event.4Heart.Fork2.Sebastian1.01": "I don't think standing on water and teleporting constitutes being all powerful.$0#$b#Though I'll admit, it was impressive.$0",
  "Event.4Heart.Fork2.Abigail1.01": "Hahaha! Don't take @ so seriously, Sebastian!$1#$b#Kat seems really cool though. Hopefully she'll teach me how to do those things!$0",
  //"Event.4Heart.Sebastian1.01": "'Kat?' You're going to call someone you haven't officially met by a nickname?",
  //"Event.4Heart.Abigail4.01": "Absolutely.$0",
  //"Event.4Heart.Sebastian2.01": "So Abigail, what exactly did you want to show me?$0",
  //"Event.4Heart.Abigail5.01": "You'll see. It's a little creature wearing a brown cloak.$0",
  //"Event.4Heart.Abigail5.02": "You'll see. It's a little creature wearing a brown cloak.$0#$b#I'll show you! The mines awaits! Feel free to come with, if you'd like, @. The more the merrier, after all.$1#$b#Too bad Sam wasn't able to come, though...$2",
  "Event.4Heart.Fork2.Sebastian2.01": "Hmm? @, you know what Abigail is talking about?$0",
  //"Event.4Heart.Abigail6.01": "@! Come on, show us! The mines awaits! The more the merrier, after all.$1#$b#Too bad Sam wasn't able to come, though...$2",
  //"Event.4Heart.Sebastian3.02": "He mentioned something about practicing. Not much we can do there. Anyway...$0#$b#I have a pocket knife just in case it gets dangerous.$1#$b#So @, you coming?$0",
  //"Event.4Heart.Sebastian3.03": "He mentioned something about practicing. Not much we can do there. Anyway...$0#$b#I have a pocket knife just in case it gets dangerous.$1#$b#@, you coming?$0",
  "Event.4Heart.Fork2.Abigail2.01": "Alright! Sebastian, @, let's go!$1",
  //SVE
  "Event.SVE.4Heart.Katrielle1.01": "Oh, g'afternoon, @! Gimme a second. You might wanna back up a little bit though.$0",
  "Event.SVE.4Heart.Katrielle2.01": "There we go! Anyway, don't mind me, I'm just waiting for Abigail and Sebastian.$0#$b#I heard they were going to be exploring the caves today, and I'm sure something interesting is gonna happen!$1",
  "Event.SVE.4Heart.Katrielle3.01": "Though, there's a lot of good hiding spots, but none that gives me a chance to see everything that's happening...$6",
  "Event.SVE.4Heart.Abigail1.01": "Who are you talking to?$6#$b#...And was she standing on water?$6",

  "Event.Samrielle.4Heart.Abigail1.01": "Man, we weren't able to find anything at all...$2#$b#But it was still fun, right Sebastian?$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.4Heart.Sebastian1.01": "I guess so, but my work messaged me before we could go any deeper into the mines.$0#$b#I gotta take care of a small bug that popped up.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.4Heart.Abigail2.01": "Oh, hey Sam!$1#$b#You finally finished practicing?$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.4Heart.Sam1.01": "Yeah, but I'm still having some trouble getting the right sound. I've been stuck on this for a while.$2#$b#Anyway, how was the mines?$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.4Heart.Abigail3.01": "It went alright, me and Sebastian got back safe and sound. But all we found were rocks.$3#$b#But we got a little help from @. @ mentioned seeing a little creature named Dwarf.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.4Heart.Abigail3.02": "It went alright, me and Sebastian got back safe and sound. But all we found were rocks.$3",
  "Event.Samrielle.4Heart.Sebastian2.01": "Yeah, and we also met @'s friend, Katrielle.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.4Heart.Abigail4.01": "That's right! Sam, did you know Kat can stand on water?$1#$b#She's so cool! I hope I get to meet her again!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.4Heart.Sebastian3.01": "She teleported away from us. That Katrielle sure is a mysterious one.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.4Heart.Sam2.01": "Mysterious girl on the water...$8#$b#...Katrielle.$8",
  "Event.Samrielle.4Heart.Abigail5.01": "Sam, are you okay? You were shaking just a second ago.$6",
  "Event.Samrielle.4Heart.Sam3.01": "Yeah, I'm alright.$0#$b#Hey, can you lemme know if you're planning on seeing her again?$0#$b#She sounds super cool and well... I guess I'd like to meet her.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.4Heart.Sam4.01": "I am *not*.$5#$b#It's just that @ told me something about 'a mysterious girl on the water' and...$5#$b#Okay, maybe just a little bit.$10#$b#But just to meet her and get some inspiration for my music, got it?$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.4Heart.Abigail6.01": "Ohh, so are you interested in her, Sam?$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.4Heart.Sebastian4.01": "Hmm... she seemed really anxious though. I'll be sure to ask her if she'll be comfortable with that.$0#$b#I'll be rooting for you, Sam.$7",
  
  "Event.6Heart.Haley1.01": "Ooh, the lake looks really nice this morning!$0",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley2.01": "Ooh, hope that one comes out good!$1",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley3.01": "A frog? Usually they don't come out in this weather or this early in the morning. This is perfect!$0",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley4.01": "Hold... still...$7",
  "Event.6Heart.Katrielle1.01": "So, the flower pot brings me here. That's good to-$6",
  "Event.6Heart.Katrielle1.02": "So, the location that the flower pot brings me to is always the same. That's good to-$6",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley5.01": "No! My shot!$2#$b#Hey! You ruined my picture!$5",
  "Event.6Heart.Katrielle2.01": "(She shouldn't be here yet...)$3#$b#I'm very sorry!$3",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley6.Spring.01": "Pff. Figures a fashion disaster like you would mess up my photo.$3#$b#Did you really tuck your shirt into your capri pants?$3#$b#Doesn't suit you at all, girl.$0",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley6.Summer.01": "Pff. Figures a fashion disaster like you would mess up my photo.$3#$b#An off-shoulder shirt and an exposed tank?$3#$b#Doesn't suit you at all, girl.$0",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley6.Fall.01": "Pff. Figures a fashion disaster like you would mess up my photo.$3#$b#Are you really wearing a turtleneck sweater with those pants?$3#$b#Doesn't suit you at all, girl.$0",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley6.WinterOutdoors.01": "Pff. Figures a fashion disaster like you would mess up my photo.$3#$b#I know it's cold, but that jacket and that hat?$3#$b#Doesn't suit you at all, girl.$0",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley6.WinterIndoors.01": "Pff. Figures a fashion disaster like you would mess up my photo.$3#$b#I know it's cold, but that jacket, and without a cute hat?$3#$b#Doesn't suit you at all, girl.$0",
  "Event.6Heart.Katrielle3.01": "...$2",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley7.01": "And news flash, your hairstyle is incredibly tacky.$0#$b#Did your mom dye your hair for you, too?$1",
  "Event.6Heart.Katrielle4.01": "...$6#$b#...At least I know how to dye my own hair without anyone's help.$6",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley8.01": "What!?$5",
  "Event.6Heart.Katrielle5.01": "You heard me.$5#$b#I don't need to have a sister to do every little thing for me.$5#$b#'Oh, Emily, I'm too lazy and spoiled to make clothes I like, can you make them for me?'$3#$b#Or better yet, why don't you ask *your* mom? Oh wait, your parents ditched you in Pelican Town.$5#$b#While they're having the time of their lives, here you are, barely knowing how to take care of yourself.$5",
  "Event.6Heart.Katrielle6.01": "Phew... Hey, @. Did you see me talk to someone?$0#$b#And I did it without impulsively teleporting out of there!$1#$b#I think I'm getting the hang of this whole communicating thing.$0",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley9.01": "I...!?$5#$b#Stay away from me, you freak.$2",
  "Event.6Heart.QuickQuestion.01": "$q 999942 null#...#$r 999942 -25 event_6_heart1#Telling her off was awesome!#$r 999942 -50 event_6_heart2#You went way too far!#$r 999942 0 event_6_heart3#You should have been more careful, Katrielle.#$r 999942 50 event_6_heart4#Insulting people like that isn't okay.",
  "Event.6Heart.Katrielle7.01": "Well, testing out the flower pot worked, regardless. I'll leave it out tomorrow for you to use.$0#$b#I'm gonna head home now. I'll see you around, @!$1",
  "Event.6Heart.Katrielle7.02": "Well, further testing out the flower pot worked, regardless. I already have the flower pot out for you to use.$0#$b#I'm gonna head home now. I'll see you around, @!$1",
  "Event.6Heart.Katrielle8.01": "Hey @...$6#$b#I feel like indulging in risky behaviors today.$8#$b#@...$4",
  "Event.6Heart.Katrielle9.01": "Do you mind walking me home today?$1#$b#I miss walking around whenever I want, and you can let me know if there's anyone ahead.$0#$b#I'll warp back home if there is, okay @?$0",
  "Event.6Heart.Katrielle10.01": "Do you mind walking me home today?$1#$b#I miss walking around whenever I want, and you can let me know if there's anyone ahead.$0#$b#I'll warp back home if there is, okay @?$0",
  "Event.6Heart.Katrielle11.01": "@... It's not that I don't believe you, but I feel like a couple of people might have seen me.$6#$b#It was probably just a glitch, and it's probably nothing. Anyway, I'll be good from here, @!$1",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley10.01": "@. I saw you talking with her.$7#$b#Who was that girl anyway? Not that you have to say anything about it. I can tell you two are close.$0#$b#Don't get too frisky there, @!$1",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley10.02": "@. I saw you talking with her.$7#$b#You two dorks are perfect for each other.$3#$b#Sorry, not sorry.$3",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley10.03": "@. I saw you talking with her.$7#$b#You're not cheating me, are you?$1#$b#I got my eyes on you, sweetheart.$14",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley11.01": "Hey, do you mind apologizing to her for me?$0#$b#I had a chance to develop the photo, and it actually looks really good.$0#$b#The frog was mid-jump and the composition of the shot worked perfectly!$1#$b#Emily told me that thanking that girl was the 'nice' thing to do when I talked about what happened.$3#$b#So tell her thanks as well.$3",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley11.02": "Look, you tell that creep to never talk to me like that ever again.$5#$b#...Hmph.$5#$b#She's lucky the picture actually came out okay.$3",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley11.03": "So, do you mind apologizing to her for me?$0#$b#I had a chance to develop the photo, and it actually looks really good.$0#$b#The frog was mid-jump and the composition of the shot worked perfectly!$1#$b#I'll be sure to sure to show you all the photos I got when I go back home.$0#$b#Anyway, Emily told me that thanking that girl was the 'nice' thing to do when I talked about what happened.$3#$b#So tell her thanks as well.$3",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley12.01": "Oh, and tell her not to say rude things like that.$7#$b#I'm fine, by the way. The picture's worth more than some hurt feelings.$1#$b#@, I'll be seeing you around.$0",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley12.02": "See you whenever I see you, whatever your name is.$0",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley12.03": "Oh, and tell her not to say rude things like that.$7#$b#I'm fine, by the way. The picture's worth more than some hurt feelings.$1#$b#I gotta develop the rest of the photos, and my old darkroom is calling my name, so @, I'll be seeing you later, okay?$0#$b#Plus, I got a little something extra to show you later.$4#$b#Ta-ta for now, @!$1",
  "Event.6Heart.Haley12.02": "See you whenever I see you, whatever your name is.$0",
  "Event.6Heart.Sam1.01": "...@?$0#$b#...$7#$b#...I'll see you around!$1",
  "Event.6Heart.End.Jas.01": "...$3#$b#The blond lady doesn't have anything to complain about.$3#$b#I can't see my parents either.$3",

  "Event.Samrielle.6Heart.Katrielle1.01": "Ah!$3#$b#Oh, @. It's you.$6#$b#Sorry, I'm still a little jumpy after running into Haley.$0#$b#Do you need anything?$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.6Heart.Katrielle2.01": "Oh, you mean the thing I was testing? The flower pot?$0#$b#Yeah, I'll be leaving it there for tomorrow. I just wanted to relax a bit.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.6Heart.Katrielle2.02": "Oh, you mean the thing I was testing? The flower pot?$0#$b#I actually already set it up!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.6Heart.Katrielle3.01": "Well, good guess on where the flower pot will be set up.$0#$b#Feel free to use it when I'm done!$1#$b#Anyway, did you need-$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.6Heart.Katrielle3.02": "Treat it like how you'd treat any of the other items here.$0#$b#Make sure to not step on the wrong one!$1#$b#Anyway, did you need-$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.6Heart.Sam1.01": "@? Hey, where'd you go? I wanted to talk to you about something.$7#$b#...Huh!? I'm standing on water...?$8",
  "Event.Samrielle.6Heart.Katrielle4.01": "Was that just Sam's voice?$3#$b#I think he followed you, @!$5#$b#Never mind... he's not coming in, right?$3",
  "Event.Samrielle.6Heart.Sam2.01": "Woah.$8#$b#What... is this place?$8",
  "Event.Samrielle.6Heart.Katrielle5.01": "Forget it, @, please please *please* get him out of here.$3#$b#I'm gonna go and-$3",
  "Event.Samrielle.6Heart.Sam3.01": "A hidden wall? That's so cool!$1#$b#...$7#$b#...@? Is this Katrielle's house?$7",
  "Event.Samrielle.6Heart.Sam4.01": "It's a really weird place, but it's kinda nice, don'tcha think, @?$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.6Heart.Sam5.01": "A Mender Zuzu Stratomagic guitar, with a full royal blue finish?$8#$b#And the strings look a little worn. Someone's definitely been playing this for a while...$1#$b#But, I had a guitar like this before getting my new one from Joja-Mart...$7",
  "Event.Samrielle.6Heart.Fork.01": "Why would she have this guitar?#Katrielle stole it from you.#It was a coincidence.#Katrielle probably saw the guitar and liked it.#It was the last one on sale.",
  //Fork1
  "Event.Samrielle.6Heart.Fork1.Sam1.01": "Oh, really? I guess it must have been by chance then!$1#$b#...@, I'm sorry I've been so pushy with meeting her.$2#$b#I can't get her out of my mind, ever since you told me about her.$4#$b#I was finally able to figure out the tune I was going for, but for some reason, that image of a girl walking on water comes racing back into my head.$4#$b#And now that I've walked on water to get here, and being in her house, my imagination is going nuts-$10",
  "Event.Samrielle.6Heart.Fork1.Sam2.01": "Uhh... I think we should leave. I don't think it's good for us to be here when she's not home.$0#$b#But she *does* exist. I just need to meet her.$3#$b#@, will you help me?$0",
  //Fork2
  "Event.Samrielle.6Heart.Fork2.Sam1.01": "Oh, really?$2#$b#Uhh... I think we should leave. I don't think it's good for us to be here when she's not home.$2#$b#...Sorry @, for bothering you so much about a stalker.$2",

  "Event.NewDay.01": "Go home and sleep for the day?#Yes#No",

  "Event.8HeartA.Katrielle1.01": "Psst! Come here!",
  "Event.8HeartA.Katrielle2.01": "Hey, @. Sorry to bother you right now, I was just watching Sam, Abigail, and Sebastian play pool.$6#$b#But it's a good thing I caught you right now. I wanted to talk to you about something.$0#$b#Follow me.$6",
  "Event.8HeartA.Katrielle3.01": "I'm at a crossroads, @. My mind and my heart are completely torn.$2#$b#I'm flip-flopping back and forth, but who am I kidding? People can see me.$2#$b#I just didn't want to believe it. But I'm here for everyone to see. And I can't just use the force of will to deny that.$6",
  "Event.8HeartA.Katrielle3.02": "I'm at a crossroads, @. My mind and my heart are completely torn.$2#$b#I spoke with Sebastian when I warped to his house after Sam barged into my house.$6#$b#And he said that he's supportive of us getting together.$8#$b#But, he said I need to 'introduce myself' to him, to Sam.$6",
  "Event.8HeartA.Katrielle4.01": "I've been deliberating for a while now, after all the time we've been getting closer.$6",
  "Event.8HeartA.Katrielle4.02": "And before that, I would need to introduce myself to *everyone*.$6#$b#I've been deliberating it regardless, after all the time we've been getting closer.$6",
  "Event.8HeartA.Katrielle5.01": "I've made my decision.$6#$b#@, I think I'm ready to reveal my existence to Pelican Town.$6",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork.01": "What do you think?#These people aren't worth it.#That's a great idea!",
  //Fork1 (No 4-Heart)
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1.Katrielle1.01": "You're right.$0#$b#...Though I'm still scared out of my mind.$6#$b#@, you better be willing to help me through all of this.$5#$b#But, I don't think I'm particularly ready to-$6",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1.Katrielle2.01": "Where are you going?$20#$b#If you bring anyone in here, I'll leave.$19",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1A.Sebastian1.01": "What's up?",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1.Abigail1.01": "@? Is there something you want to talk about?$0",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1A.Sam1.01": "Hold on, lemme finish my shot...$0",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1A.Abigail2.01": "Heya, @! You wanted to show us something?",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1A.Katrielle3.01": "(@, I told you I wasn't ready!)$17",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1A.Sebastian2.01": "I'm pretty sure I saw someone over there.$0",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1A.Abigail3.01": "Who was that girl? And how did she do that?$6#$b#Did she teleport or something? Because that'd be pretty cool!$1",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1A.Sebastian3.01": "Katrielle, huh? She seems like a shy one.$0#$b#So, what about this girl? Is she moving to Pelican Town too?$0#$b#Seems like it was just a couple of days ago since you moved in, @.$0",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1A.Abigail4.01": "Say, I don't think Mayor Lewis knows yet. Come to think of it, he's in the saloon too, right Sebastian?$0",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1A.Sebastian4.01": "Yeah, he's here.$0",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1A.Abigail5.01": "Great! Might as well let him know that someone new's moving in.$1#$b#Let's go!$0",
  "Event.8HeartA.End.01": "You watch as a small crowd congregates in the center of the saloon.",
  //Fork2 (Normal 4-Heart)
  //"Event.8HeartA.Fork1.Katrielle1.01": "You're right.$0#$b#...Though I'm still scared out of my mind.$6#$b#@, you better be willing to help me through all of this.$5#$b#But, I don't think I'm particularly ready to-$6",
  //"Event.8HeartA.Fork1.Katrielle2.01": "Where are you going?$20#$b#If you bring anyone in here, I'll leave.$19",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.Katrielle3.01": "Okay, okay, I won't leave.$6#$b#But I am still angry at you.$5#$b#...Just kidding. But I'm only willing to talk to Sebastian and Abigail. Do you mind getting them?$0",
  //"Event.8HeartA.Fork1.Abigail1.01": "@? Is there something you want to talk about?$0",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.Abigail2.01": "Hey, you're Kat, right?$0#$b#It's a pleasure to finally meet you!$1",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.Sebastian1.01": "Still shy as ever, huh? You look like you're ready to leave like last time.$0#$b#Katrielle, are you planning to move to Pelican Town?$0",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.Sebastian1.02": "Still shy as ever, huh? You look like you're ready to leave like last time.$0#$b#Yet, you seemed comfortable talking to me about-$1",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.Katrielle4.01": "...Yes.$6#$b#Yes, I am. I haven't mentioned my arrival to anyone else yet, and I asked @ for help.$0",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.Abigail3.01": "Ooh, I see. Well, we can let Mayor Lewis know, so he can do the same stuff he did for @.$0#$b#Plus, he'll probably spread the word about the new girl in town, right? @, Sebastian?$0",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.Sebastian2.01": "Right.$0",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.Abigail4.01": "He should be in the saloon. Let's tell him now!$1",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.Abigail5.01": "Oh, and Kat?$0#$b#Welcome to Pelican Town! Hopefully you can teach me how to teleport too!$1",
  //Fork2 (Samrielle 4-Heart)
  //"Event.8HeartA.Fork1.Katrielle1.01": "You're right.$0#$b#...Though I'm still scared out of my mind.$6#$b#@, you better be willing to help me through all of this.$5#$b#But, I      //don't think I'm particularly ready to-$6",
  //"Event.8HeartA.Fork1.Katrielle2.01": "Where are you going?$20#$b#If you bring anyone in here, I'll leave.$19",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.Katrielle3.02": "Okay, okay, I won't leave.$6#$b#But I am still angry at you.$5#$b#...Just kidding. But I'm only willing to talk to Sebastian and Abigail.$0#$b#...And definitely not Sam!$3#$b#Do you mind getting them two?$0",
  //"Event.8HeartA.Fork1.Abigail1.01": "@? Is there something you want to talk about?$0",
  //"Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.Abigail2.01": "Hey, you're Kat, right?$0#$b#It's a pleasure to finally meet you!$1",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.Sebastian1.02": "Still shy as ever, huh? You look like you're ready to leave like last time.$0#$b#Yet, you seemed comfortable talking to me about-$1",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.KatrielleExtra1.01": "Shh! Don't say anything, please!$3",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.SebastianExtra1.01": "Katrielle, have you decided to move to Pelican Town?",
  //"Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.Katrielle4.01": "...Yes.$6#$b#Yes, I am. I haven't mentioned my arrival to anyone else yet, and I asked @ for help.$0",
  //"Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.Abigail3.01": "Ooh, I see. Well, we can let Mayor Lewis know, so he can do the same stuff he did for @.$0#$b#Plus, he'll probably spread the word about the new girl in town, right? @, Sebastian?$0",
  //"Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.Sebastian2.01": "Right.$0",
  //"Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.Abigail4.01": "He should be in the saloon. Let's tell him now!$1",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.SebastianExtra2.01": "By the way, @, Katrielle.$0",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.SebastianExtra3.01": "Sam's been practicing a special song for a little while now.$1#$b#Hopefully he doesn't get too deep into it and forget to actually meet you too.$1#$b#But just in case, Katrielle, you should pass by his house after the welcoming party.$0",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork1B.AbigailExtra1.01": "I've never seen him so motivated to write a song before.$0#$b#At least until you put a pool table in front of him, then all bets are off!$1#$b#Anyway, welcome to Pelican Town, Katrielle!$1",
  //"Event.8HeartA.End.01": "You watch as a small crowd congregates in the center of the saloon.",
  //Fork2
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork2.Katrielle1.01": "...!$3#$b#...Why would-$2#$b#...I don't understand, it felt like the right thing to do.$2#$b#People can see me, @! I can't deny that!$5#$b#...$2#$b#You really think living with these people isn't worth my time, effort, and care? After all this?$2#$b#Was I wrong to want to be a part of them the entire time!?$2",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork2.Katrielle1.02": "...!$3#$b#...Why would-$2#$b#...I don't understand, it felt like the right thing to do.$2#$b#People can see me, @! I can't deny that!$5#$b#...$2#$b#You really think living with these people isn't worth my time, effort, and care? After all this?$2#$b#Was I wrong to want to be a part of them the entire time!?$2",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork2.Katrielle2.01": "Fine, I'll listen to you.$16#$b#You're still my friend, so I'm okay with talking to you. But I'll stick with watching everyone else from afar from now on.$16#$b#I feel like an idiot for even caring for all of these stupid-$16",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork2.Katrielle3.01": "*sniff*",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork2.Katrielle4.01": "But it's for the best.$16#$b#...$21",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork2.Katrielle5.01": "I'm sorry for crying so much and wasting your time.$16#$b#...I want to be alone. Let me end this...$16",
  "Event.8HeartA.Fork2.Katrielle6.01": "...now.",

  "Event.8HeartB.Lewis1.01": "Gus, may I stand on the counter?$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Gus1.01": "I know you have an announcement to make, but I'd prefer if you didn't stand on-$2",
  "Event.8HeartB.Lewis2.01": "Good evening everyone! I hope you're enjoying your time here, but @ has informed me that someone will be moving in a couple of...$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Lewis3.01": "...Soon.$0#$b#So, let's do our best to give Katrielle a warm Pelican Town welcome!$1",
  //2-Heart
  "Event.8HeartB.Emily1.01": "Ooh, if that is who I think is, I remember her!$1#$b#She was outside listening to the guitar playing from next door!$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Sam1.01": "...She enjoys listening to my music?$4#$b#I'd love to meet a fan!$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Robin1.01": "If Katrielle need a place to stay, I'll be more than happy to introduce myself to her.$0#$b#I'll get started on building them a home to live in.$0",
  //No 4-Heart
  "Event.8HeartB.Demetrius1.01": "I concur. I hope someone wouldn't be moving into town without a place to live!$1#$b#I do hope she has a field of study relevant to my research. Any additional assistance would be appreciated.$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Robin2.01": "Honey, you don't need to worry so much about your research!$1",
  //4-Heart
  "Event.8HeartB.Pierre1.01": "Wait, Katrielle? I could have sworn I heard that name before.$4",
  "Event.8HeartB.Robin2.02": "Come to think of it, me too! I may have heard Sebby mention meeting someone named Katrielle.$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Sam2.01": "*snickers* Sebby...",
  "Event.8HeartB.Sebastian1.01": "I see him laughing over there...$5",
  "Event.8HeartB.Abigail1.01": "It's just a nickname. People call me Abby all the time.$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Abigail2.01": "But we met her before exploring the caves, right?$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Abigail2.02": "But we met her before looking for that creature @ mentioned, right?$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Sebastian2.01": "Yeah. We were looking for that cloaked creature you mentioned.$0#$b#(Not to mention, we met Katrielle earlier today, but we'll keep that to ourselves.)$7",
  "Event.8HeartB.Sebastian2.02": "Yeah. @ mentioned his name was Dwarf? Too bad we never found him.$0#$b#(Not to mention, we met Katrielle earlier today, but we'll keep that to ourselves.)$7",
  "Event.8HeartB.Abigail3.01": "Of course!$0",
  //No 6-Heart

  //6-Heart
  "Event.8HeartB.Elliott1.01": "Well, I'm rather excited to meet her soon.$0#$b#For some reason, I imagine her as a woman with teal and magenta hair.$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Leah1.01": "Interesting. I would have imagined her more as a brunette. What was her attire like?$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Leah1.02": "Interesting. I would have imagined her more as a brunette.$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Leah1.Spring.01": "And a white blouse with red cuffs, correct?$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Leah1.Summer.01": "And that yellow off-shoulder shirt, correct?$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Leah1.Fall.01": "And a dusky blue turtleneck sweater, correct?$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Leah1.WinterOutdoors.01": "And a greyish blue coat, correct?$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Leah1.WinterIndoors.01": "And a greyish blue coat, correct?$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Willy1.Spring.01": "The lass had a white shirt, which stuck out wit' her walking on the water and all.$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Willy1.Summer.01": "The lass had a yellow shirt, and I thought she'd fall in the ocean!$0#$b#But no, she be walking on the water and all.$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Willy1.Fall.01": "The lass had a sweater on, and it looked mighty warm, walking on the water and all.$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Willy1.WinterOutdoors.01": "The lass had a nice coat on, and it looked mighty warm, walking on the water and all.$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Willy1.WinterIndoors.01": "The lass had a nice coat on, and it looked mighty warm, walking on the water and all.$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Elliott2.01": "Ah, I see someone else aside from Willy has seen the 'Maiden of Gem Sea.'$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Elliott2.02": "Yes! Have you too seen 'The Maiden of Gem Sea?'$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Emily2.Spring.01": "By chance, does she also have a white blouse with red cuffs, and the supernatural ability to walk on water?$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Emily2.Summer.01": "By chance, does she also have a asymmetrical yellow shirt, and the supernatural ability to walk on water?$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Emily2.Fall.01": "By chance, does she also have a cotton turtleneck, and the supernatural ability to walk on water?$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Emily2.WinterOutdoors.01": "By chance, does she also have a warm wool coat, and the supernatural ability to walk on water?$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Emily2.WinterIndoors.01": "By chance, does she also have a warm wool coat, and the supernatural ability to walk on water?$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Emily2.02": "Ooh, is that a new character in your book?$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Emily2.03": "Ooh, is that a new character in your book?$0#$b#Then again, your book wasn't a non-fiction novel, was it?$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Emily2.04": "Interesting... I have seen a mystical woman who looks like that, and she was able to walk on water.$0#$b#Maybe that's her special ability!$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Elliott3.01": "Luckily, no. I have an inherent fear of scrutiny of my unfinished work.$2#$b#I've been seeing that woman across the tide pools on the beach's edge.$0#$b#Like a sweet mistress crossing the waters, gracing the beach with her enigmatic presence.$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Elliott3.02": "You remembered! I'm glad my book has had a tremendous impact on someone.$1#$b#But no, I've been seeing that woman across the tide pools on the beach's edge.$0#$b#Like a sweet mistress crossing the waters, gracing the beach with her enigmatic presence.$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Elliott3.03": "Perhaps. I have been seeing that woman across the tide pool's edge.$0#$b#And you're correct. Like a sweet mistress of the waters, gracing the land with her peculiar presence.$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Marnie1.01": "Walking on the water? That feels a little unbelievable.$2",
  "Event.8HeartB.Marnie1.02": "That's very funny, I remember a girl with that exact description, but I never met her!$3#$b#Though, walking on water is something I wasn't expecting.$0#$b#My niece mentioned seeing a strange woman having an argument with someone.$2",
  "Event.8HeartB.Emily3.01": "Oh, so maybe that's who my sister fought with.$3#$b#Well, I'm sure I can still can convince Haley to forgive her for whatever they fought about.$3",
  "Event.8HeartB.Emily3.02": "Oh, so maybe that's who my sister fought with.$3#$b#Boy, was she mad! But I'm glad Haley forgave her for whatever they fought about.$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Leah2.01": "But it does give me a couple of good ideas for my next painting!$1#$b#But, maybe I should officially meet her first.$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Leah2.02": "Emily, your sister is pretty lucky though. I'm stuck in a similar situation that Marnie is in.$0#$b#I can only vaguely remember how she looked like, but I don't remember much of anything else.$2",
  "Event.8HeartB.Leah2.03": "Emily, you and your sister are pretty lucky though. I'm stuck in a similar situation that Marnie is in.$0#$b#I can only vaguely remember how she looked like, but I don't remember much of anything else.$2",
  "Event.8HeartB.Marnie2.01": "I think Willy's just seeing things on the water. Maybe it was just a large fish?$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Marnie2.02": "I think everyone's just seeing things on the water. Maybe it was just a large fish?$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Marnie2.03": "Strange, I wasn't expecting you, me or Jas to all have seen her, yet not see her. I didn't believe she even existed.$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Willy2.01": "Trust me, me matey Elliott and I swear we saw 'er! Sure as my line in the water!$1",
  //End
  "Event.8HeartB.Lewis4.01": "Well, seems like everyone's excited to meet her.$1#$b#(Hopefully this announcement will bode well for my position as mayor...)$0#$b#At the very least, I'm excited to meet her as well!$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Lewis4.02": "Well, seems like some of us have met her already!$1#$b#Let's hope the rest of us will too welcome her with open arms.$0#$b#At the very least, I'm excited to meet her as well!$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Lewis4.03": "Goodness, it seems like several of you have met her already!$1#$b#I suppose the few of you that haven't, will do so in due time.$0#$b#At the very least, I'm excited to meet her as well!$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Lewis4.04": "My, my, maybe it wasn't necessary to make an announcement after all!$1#$b#It seems like everyone's already heard of her.$0",
  "Event.8HeartB.Sam3.01": "...$2",
  "Event.8HeartB.Lewis5.01": "At the very least, I'm excited to meet her as well!$1",
  "Event.8HeartB.Lewis6.01": "@, leave the welcoming party preparations to myself and Gus.$0#$b#Make sure to let Katrielle know all of the details.$0#$b#We'll be ready to welcome her anytime between 9 AM to 5 PM in town, but we'll postpone if it's raining.$1#$b#Sounds good?$0",

  //Non-Best
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle2.01": "Should I still keep my eyes closed?$11#$b#Oh, I can open them?$11#$b#...Okay!$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Narration2.01": "... Welcome Katrielle!",
  "Event.8HeartC.Lewis2.01": "Welcome to Pelican Town, Katrielle!$1#$b#We're happy to have you here as our new resident.$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle3.01": "(Right, @.)$6",
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle5.01": "Umm... hi everyone!$0#$b#Thank you for the warm welcome!$1",
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle5.2": "Hi everyone! Thank you for the warm welcome!$0#$b#I appreciate all of you coming out to greet me!$1",
  "Event.8HeartC.Abigail1.01": "Kat! It's a pleasure to finally see you out in the open!$1#$b#Hopefully this isn't too overwhelming for you.$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle6.01": "It is, but I'll be fine.$1#$b#(By the way, thank you for your help in the Saloon, Abigail.)$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Robin1.01": "Of course! If you're in need of getting a house built, please let me know.$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Robin1.02": "Say, if you're in need of getting a house built, please let me know.$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle7.01": "Oh, there's no need. I already have my things arranged.$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Robin2.01": "If that's the case, alright then.$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Vincent1.01": "Oh, I remember you! I saw you outside my house that one time!$1#$b#I'm Vincent, by the way!$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle8.01": "Ah- yeah!$3#$b#Nice to meet you too, Vincent!$11",
  "Event.8HeartC.Pierre1.01": "Well, if you need any shopping done, feel free to pass by my store, right over there.$0#$b#We sell some groceries if you're ever hungry.$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle9.01": "Oh, umm... I'll be sure to.$0#$b#(Even though I get all of my food from the code...)$6",
  "Event.8HeartC.Leah1.01": "Hey, have I seen you before? I could have sworn I seen you somewhere...$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle10.01": "I'm not sure, to be honest.$6#$b#But it's a pleasure to meet you, Leah!$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Leah2.01": "Likewise!$1#$b#(...Did I say my name?)$3",
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle11.01": "Umm... Thank you everyone!$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle11.02": "Well, thank you everyone!$1",
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle11.03": "Wow, thank you so much everyone! Hope to speak to you all soon!$1",
  "Event.8HeartC.Narration3.01": "It was a little awkward, but Katrielle has officially introduced herself to Pelican Town!",
  "Event.8HeartC.Narration3.02": "It took a little bit, but Katrielle has officially introduced herself to Pelican Town!",
  "Event.8HeartC.Narration3.03": "It was really nice seeing everyone come out, and now Katrielle has officially introduced herself to Pelican Town!",
  //Best
  "Event.8HeartC.Gus1.01": "Lewis, we got everything prepared for Katrielle's party.$0#$b#I'm surprised with how many people were willing to help us set up.$0#$b#Leah, Elliott, Abigail. Marnie was even able to rope in Shane to help!$1",
  "Event.8HeartC.Lewis1.01": "That's great! It really feels like there's a big festival today.$1#$b#Everyone, let's get ready. @ is bringing Katrielle now.$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Narration1.01": "You slowly bring Katrielle to the center of town...",
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle1.01": "Should I still keep my eyes closed?... I feel really nervous though.$11",
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle2.02": "Oh, I can open them?$11#$b#...Okay!$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Narration2.02": "...Surprise! Welcome Katrielle!",
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle3.02": "Is everyone in Pelican Town here?!$3",
  "Event.8HeartC.Lewis2.02": "Seems like it!$1",
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle4.01": "@, I...$13",
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle5.03": "Umm... Hi everyone! Thank you for the warm welcome!$13#$b#I...$2",
  "Event.8HeartC.Abigail1.02": "Kat, is everything okay?$2#$b#Hopefully this isn't too overwhelming for you, but we're all happy to have you come out!$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Sebastian1.01": "...I suppose it really is overwhelming. Nearly everyone is here.$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Elliott1.01": "Don't worry, Miss Katrielle. I moved in a little while ago, and @ moved in just this year.$0#$b#Trust me, you'll fit right in.$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Elliott1.02": "Don't worry, Miss Katrielle. I moved in a good while ago, and @ moved in quite recently as well.$0#$b#Trust me, you'll fit right in.$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Gus2.01": "That's right! Being able to see everyone's faces day after day is the best!$1#$b#Getting to know everyone is just the next step.$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Robin1.03": "We're all here to help each other out, and take care of each other.$0#$b#For example, if you need a place to live, I'll be more than happy to build you a home.$1",
  "Event.8HeartC.Vincent1.02": "Oh, oh! And Miss Penny can teach you all sorts of things!$1",
  "Event.8HeartC.Penny1.01": "Katrielle, was it? While I don't think there's a lot I can teach you, I can help you find any books for you to read.$0#$b#I'm quite familiar with the museum's library.$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Pierre1.02": "Oh, and also, if you need any shopping done, feel free to pass by my store, right over there.$0#$b#We sell some groceries if you're ever hungry.$0",
  "Event.8HeartC.Abigail2.01": "Ugh.$3#$b#Kat, if nothing else, I'll be here to be your friend.$0#$b#We all are! We're all here for you, and we're happy to have you here, Kat.$1",
  "Event.8HeartC.Lewis3.01": "Well, I *would* say welcome to Pelican Town, Katrielle...$0#$b#But it seems like you're already a member of our quaint community.$1",
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle9.02": "$q 999943 null#...#$r 999943 0 event_8b_heart2#Katrielle, are you okay?#$r 999943 0 event_8b_heart1#(Tap her shoulder)",
  "Event.8HeartC.Jas1.01": "...Is she okay?",
  "Event.8HeartC.Evelyn1.01": "Poor girl...",
  "Event.8HeartC.Haley1.01": "...",
  "Event.8HeartC.Caroline1.01": "Oh dear...",
  "Event.8HeartC.Willy1.01": "Aye, poor lass...",
  "Event.8HeartC.Abigail3.01": "...Katrielle?$2",
  "Event.8HeartC.Katrielle11.04": "...Thank you, everyone. Thank you for giving me the best welcome a person could ever ask for.$12",
  "Event.8HeartC.Narration3.04": "Everyone celebrated Katrielle's welcoming party, and now Katrielle is officially a part of Pelican Town!",
  "Event.8HeartC.Narration4.01": "After the festivities were over, everyone went home.",
  "Event.8HeartC.Narration4.02": "But he didn't show up...",

///

  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle1.01": "*sigh*...",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle2.01": "(I can feel my heart fluttering out of my chest...)$6#$b#(But everyone told me to come here to meet him...)$0#$b#Okay, here we go.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam1.01": "Oh man... I think she's here!$8#$b#Come on, Sam. She's just the person that inspired my latest song, in spite of the fact you never met her.$5#$b#It'll be fine! It'll be just fine.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle3.01": "Umm... hey.$8#$b#Hey Sam.$4",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle4.01": "(I've never been this close to him before...!)$3",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam2.01": "Mom? Vince?$7",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam3.01": "Huh. Must have been the wind or something.$0#$b#...$7",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle5.01": "...Sam?$6#$b#...You don't see me, do you?$2",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam4.01": "I heard everyone outside, and Katrielle's supposed to introduce herself sometime today, but she still hasn't showed up.$7#$b#Maybe she doesn't want to see me, after all...$2",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle6.01": "No! No no no! I've been wanting to meet you for so long, Sam!$3#$b#I think you're really cool, and creative, and funny, and you have such a kind heart...$3#$b#And I really, *really* love your music! It makes me so happy that you wrote a song about me, for me!$8#$b#I'm not familiar with the feeling, but I think I'm really in love with-$4",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam5.01": "But still, why did my door open?$0#$b#Maybe there's a draft or something. I'll look around the house later.$0#$b#Sebastian's mom might be able to find where it's coming from. She knows stuff about houses.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle7.01": "...$6#$b#...What am I doing? You still can't hear me.$2#$b#Can't see me, can't hear me, just like how everything was before @ came here...$2#$b#But now, why you, out of everyone? Why is it *only* you that can't see me?!$2#$b#I'm right here, Sam! Right in front of you! Please, just say anything to me!$7",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam6.01": "Hmm... I shouldn't give up hope just yet. But I still need a little bit more time to practice.$0#$b#Gotta make her song perfect, that's all!$3#$b#I'm sure meeting her will be worthwhile.$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle8.01": "How can you still have any hope?$2#$b#As far as I'm concerned, I'm just a ghost to you.$2",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle9.01": "...I give up. I guess there's just some things that were never meant to be.$2",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam7.01": "Man, what I wouldn't do to finally see her.$4",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle10.01": "I'm sorry for being selfish, Sam. But I want to leave here today with no regrets.$2",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle11.01": "Goodbye.$13",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam8.01": "Wait!",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam9.01": "...Katrielle?$8",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle12.01": "Sam. You can...$8",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle13.01": "...$4",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam10.01": "...Hey. I wrote you a song and...$4",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam11.01": "Wait a second. You were invisible?$2",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle14.01": "That's how it was for a while.$6#$b#And then, I don't know what happened, but @ showed up and that wasn't the case anymore.$9#$b#But even then, everyone else could see me, except for you.$2",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam12.01": "Yeah, and then you kissed me, and suddenly, you were there.$4",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle15.01": "Right! Umm... was that bad?$3",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam13.01": "Well, I mean, I guess it's okay with me?$10#$b#I mean, we... you know.$4#$b#We kissed again.$4",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle16.01": "...!?$3#$b#(Wait, I think I figured out why Sam can see me now, come to think of it!)$9#$b#(I think it's because I-)$9",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam14.01": "Say, Katrielle. You play the guitar too, right?$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle17.01": "Oh!$3#$b#Umm, yeah, but I'm still kinda new to it.$6#$b#I've been practicing though.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam15.01": "Yeah! Glad to hear you're giving a good shot. And I was thinking.$3#$b#I was working on a special song. Once I got the melody, I couldn't get it out of my head.$0#$b#That was the song I was gonna show you.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam16.01": "But I got a better idea.$1#$b#We'll need to practice, and we'll play the song together!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle18.01": "Okay, I'd love to!$1#$b#But if there's anything I don't know, you don't mind teaching me, right?$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam17.01": "Of course. I wasn't able to teach Sebastian, but since you probably got the basics down, this should be a piece of cake!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam18.01": "I know you're busy and have some stuff to do today, but one last thing before you go.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle19.01": "Yeah?$8",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Sam19.01": "This might be a little fast, but...$0#$b#Do you want to go out with me, Katrielle?$4",
  "Event.Samrielle.8Heart.Katrielle20.01": "...$4",

  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.Sam1.01": "Hi @.#$b#I wanted to talk to you in private...$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.Sam2.01": "It's kinda cold out here though... let's sneak into my room.$3",
  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.Sam3.01": "So... @.$10#$b#I know I've been talking about nothing but the band and Kat for a while now... But I don't want you to think that's all I'm interested in.#$b#Um... Er... What I mean is...$8#$b#Well, I'm really happy that we've grown so close... Heh.$10#$b#You helped me with so much, you know? And you've been the best friend that anyone could ever ask for!$1#$b#...Well, aside from Sebastian, but you know.$3",
  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.Sam4.01": "It's been great being with Kat and all. And I have you to thank for it, for everything.$l",
  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.Jodi1.01": "Sam? I'm coming in!$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.Sam5.01": "Quick! Hide in the bed!$8",
  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.Jodi2.01": "What's wrong, Honey? Were you doing something... bad?#$b#I thought I heard some weird sounds coming from your room...$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.Sam6.01": "No Mom! I was just... doing push-ups! I wanna beat Dad at arm-wrestling some day! ...heh.$8",
  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.Jodi3.01": "Oh! *giggle*... That explains why you're all red and sweaty.$h#$b#Okay, well good luck. I'll see you and Katrielle in the morning.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.Sam7.01": "Goodnight, Mom.$10",
  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.Sam8.01": "Whew... That was close.$h",
  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.Sam9.01": "Wait a minute, did she say 'Katrielle?'$8#$b#...My mom probably thinks it's Kat in my bed instead of you...$2",
  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.Sam10.01": "...@, I think you might need to leave. I don't want my mom to think that I'm cheating on Katrielle, you know?$2",
  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.Fork.01": "#Get out of the bed.#Stay put.",
  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.Sam11.01": "...Umm, @?$2#$b#Are you gonna get out?$2",
  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.Sam12.01": "I guess you can stay there, @. But I'm not helping you if my mom walks in.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.Sam13.01": "Thanks, @. Umm...$0#$b#You could climb back out of my window. Sorry about that.$1#$b#I'll see you around!$3",
  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.Sam13.02": "I'll be at Katrielle's. See you, I guess?$2",
  "Event.Samrielle.Sam10Heart.End.Sam.01": "I don't think my mom suspected a thing.$1",

  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartA.Sam1.01": "*Hum hum hum*...",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartA.Sam2.01": "Hey @!$3#$b#...$7",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartA.Sam3.01": "You know what? I'll tell you, friend to friend.$0#$b#After all, you've done a lot for me, you know?$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartA.Sam4.01": "Check this out!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartA.Sam5.01": "Yup, I'm planning on proposing to Katrielle.$4#$b#I usually save my money working at Joja for a big purchase like a new skateboard or stuff for the band.$0#$b#But even though this is the most expensive thing I ever bought, this was totally worth it!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartA.Sam6.01": "I know me and Katrielle only knew each other for a little while.$0#$b#But trust me, we've been spending a lot of time working on that song to be perfect.$0#$b#Most of the time, I sneak out of my house around 2AM to go to her place to practice.$3#$b#And because her house is weird, no one hears a thing!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartA.Sam7.01": "Getting to know her more and more, and spending time with her, it's been awesome.$4#$b#@, I don't think I can thank you enough for bringing us together.$4#$b#But, I'll try anyway. So, thanks!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartA.Sam8.01": "Katrielle mentioned that if she would want a wedding, she'd want it as close to home as possible.$7#$b#I don't know how to make sense of that, but I'll see what I can do.$1#$b#And you'll be the first to know!$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartA.Sam9.01": "I'll see you around, @!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartA.Narration1.01": "Picking up the Mermaid Pendant, Sam cheerily walked back home...",

  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sam1.01": "Kat, are you ready?$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle1.01": "I think so, Sammy.$0#$b#The first runthrough...$6",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle2.01": "...",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sam2.01": "Umm... what's going on with my guitar?$7",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sam2.02": "Umm... Katrielle?$7",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle3.01": "Hmm... I'm just thinking that there's something that's going to happen.$6",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle3.02": "Sorry!$3#$b#I'm just thinking that there's something that's going to happen.$6",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sam3.01": "Oh, hey!",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle4.01": "There they are.$0#$b#Hey, @!$1#$b#You tend to show up to things when they happen, huh?$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sam4.01": "You know, it's great that you're here.$0#$b#We practiced each part of the song, and today's the day we were gonna be putting it all together!$0#$b#Or at least try, I don't know what's going on. I can't hear my guitar.$2",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sam4.02": "You know, it's great that you're here.$0#$b#We practiced each part of the song, and today's the day we were gonna be putting it all together!$0#$b#And since you helped us out with the song, it's only fair you get to hear it live, at...$1#$b#I still have no clue where this place is. Then again, if I can get my tunes out without anyone complaining, then it's all good with me!$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle5.01": "Umm, I should tell you about this place, @. Since we're good friends and all.$0#$b#This is the void.$0#$b#Well, since me and Sammy started practicing, I decided to clean it up.$1#$b#I managed to mask all of the weird glitching here, so you just see it as the nighttime sky.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sam5.01": "Well Katrielle, is the void messing up our instruments?$2",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sam5.02": "I kinda wish that Sebastian and Abigail were here though...$2",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle6.01": "...I'm afraid not. The music mod is missing.$6#$b#@, I think you should double check if you got the music stuff in the 'Mods' folder.$6#$b#Though as of 1.6, I don't think that should be an issue at this point...$9",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle6.02": "That can be arranged. Give me a second!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sam6.01": "Umm... I have no idea what you're talking about.$2",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sam6.02": "Y'know, @. She never told me how to do that.$0#$b#Maybe the rumors about Stardew Valley being magical are true.$0#$b#Personally though, I prefer the magic of the music.$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle7.01": "They're coming.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Abigail1.01": "Hey guys! I got here as fast as I could!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sebastian1.01": "Abigail nearly snapped my arm dragging me here.$2#$b#But if it's for the new couple, I'll make the time.$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle8.01": "And that should be everyone!$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sam7.01": "Well, Katrielle, you ready?$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle9.01": "Absolutely! Let's do it!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sebastian2.01": "Good job!",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sam8.01": "Thank you, thank you!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Abigail2.01": "That was amazing, you two!$1#$b#Kat, you should really consider joining the band!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle10.01": "You think so?$8#$b#...But no, I think I'll pass. I'm still terrified of being on a stage.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sebastian3.01": "That's a shame. But understandable.$0#$b#Still, that song was really good.$1#$b#Nothing like what Sam showed me when he was still writing it.$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle11.01": "Don't worry about it, Sammy.$1#$b#But in that case, give me a second.$6#$b#Sorry about this, @.$6",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle11.02": "Hey, everyone... I hope you enjoyed the song.$0#$b#...But sorry about this.$6",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sam9.01": "Umm... Kat? What are you doing?!$8",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle12.01": "I wanted to do something.$6#$b#More accurately, I wanted to ask something, but I just want it between the two of us.$8",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle13.01": "Sam...$4",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle14.01": "Will you marry me?$4",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sam10.01": "Wait a second. I was gonna-$4",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sam11.01": "Hahahahahahaha!",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle15.01": "Oh man, I can't believe this!$1#$b#...$4",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Sam12.01": "Heheheh...",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Katrielle16.01": "Ahahahahaha...",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartB.Narration1.01": "The void was filled with laughter, followed by a sweet silence...",

  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Narration1.01": "You hear confused chatter from people gathered in Katrielle's house...",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Lewis1.01": "Oh! So this is where the ceremony will be held...?$5#$b#...Hmm, okay.$0#$b#I have everything here. Let us begin.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Lewis2.01": "When Katrielle first arrived in Pelican Town, no one knew if she'd fit in with our community...#$b#But from this day forward, Katrielle is going to be as much a part of this town as any of us!$h#$b#It is my great honor on this day ",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Lewis2.02": " of ",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Lewis2.03": ", to unite Katrielle and Sam in the bonds of marriage.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Lewis3.01": "Well, let's get right to it!$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Lewis4.01": "Katrielle... Sam...$0#$b#As the mayor of Pelican Town, and regional bearer of the matrimonial seal, I now pronounce you wife and husband!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Lewis5.01": "You may kiss.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Narration2.01": "Katrielle: Wait, I broke something!",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Narration3.01": "Sam: Umm... what happened?",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Narration4.01": "Katrielle: Everything broke... there's supposed to be confetti, I don't know where we are, even our portraits and sprites aren't working!",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Narration5.01": "Katrielle: I spent so much time planning it out to make sure the void could support everything. All the decorations, somehow convincing everyone to come here for a seemingly impromptu wedding, everything has just gone to waste...",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Narration6.01": "Sam: I don't really understand, Kat. But... we *are* married, right? That's all I care about with you. It's okay if everything didn't go to plan, right?",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Narration7.01": "Katrielle: ...Right.",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Narration8.01": "Katrielle: Sammy, you're right! We are still married. And we have to finish it like we're supposed to.",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Narration9.01": "Sam: Sure, whatever we need to do, I'll do it!",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Narration10.01": "Katrielle: No, no need. Allow me. *ahem*",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Narration11.01": "Katrielle: Life is going to be different from now on...",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartC.Narration12.01": "Katrielle: ...but the future looks bright!",

  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Sam1.01": "You got this!",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Katrielle1.01": "Ouch, you're on your last life...",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Abigail1.01": "Hey, farmer",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Sam2.01": "Hi!",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Abigail2.01": "Uhhh... Sorry, @. I'm kinda locked in at the moment...$9#$b#But glad you came!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Sam3.01": "Yeah, we’ll be with you in a sec.$0#$b#Abigail’s in a deep run. She might even get past where I died!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Sebastian1.01": "Hey Sam, I'm still setting up the table. I'll let you know when I'm done.$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Sam4.01": "Alrighty!",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Katrielle2.01": "Well, while the others are busy...$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Katrielle3.01": "Hey, @.$0#$b#I don't think I ever can say it enough, but thanks a lot, @.$8#$b#Before you got here, I was all cooped up in my nice little corner in the void.$13#$b#To think from that point, I'd end up here, married to the love of my life, and friends with some of the people I watched from afar...$8#$b#And even welcomed into a town where people have never seen me before...$8#$b#...Heh, I don't wanna get too sappy during a hangout, so just... thanks, @!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Question.01": "...#I'm happy you became friends with everyone.#I'm happy you got married with Sam.#I'm happy to be friends with you.#I'm happy you moved in to Pelican Town.",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Katrielle4.01": "Aww, thanks, @-$8",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Abigail3.01": "NOOOO!",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Abigail4.01": "*sigh*... That was the furthest I ever got...$2#$b#How the heck is Lewis at the top of the leaderboard?! He barely knows how to use a phone!$5",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Abigail5.01": "Hey Kat, you know a lot. Do you know if he cheated or something?$3",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Katrielle5.01": "...!$3#$b#O-oh... Umm... hmm...$9",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Katrielle6.01": "No idea!$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Sam5.01": "Heh.$3",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Abigail6.01": "Ugh. Well, I’d want to keep going, but I think I’ll lose my mind.$3",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Abigail7.01": "I wonder if you’re good at this game, @. I know the rest of us aren’t great at it.$0#$b#(Especially Seb...)$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Sebastian2.01": "I heard that.$5",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Sebastian3.01": "Also, I’m better than you.$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Abigail8.01": "Ha! Whatever. You've never even seen Slomp's Stomp before.$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Abigail9.01": "So @, do you wanna have a try?$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Sebastian4.01": "Hey Sam, the game’s ready.$7",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Sam6.01": "I’m gonna win this one for sure!$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Sebastian5.01": "In your dreams.$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Katrielle7.01": "Gosh, I love him even if he sucks at pool.$1",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Abigail10.01": "You and Sam really are such a perfect match. I’m still so happy for you two.$1#$b#Anyway, let’s hop to it!$0",
  "Event.Samrielle.10HeartD.Message.01": "The night continues on with fun, laughter... and maybe a bit of struggle.",

  "Event.DatingStart.Katrielle1.01": "Hey, @!$1#$b#Just wanted to teleport to your farm to ask you about something kinda important.$0",
  "Event.DatingStart.Katrielle2.01": "So, here's the thing. We're pretty close enough.$0#$b#We're even dating now, and don't get me wrong. It's really, really great.$8",
  "Event.DatingStart.Katrielle3.01": "However, I feel like we're on the cusp of getting married soon.$6#$b#And well, I *just* moved into Pelican Town, as a resident.$6#$b#And I finally have the ability to walk around freely, among the people I watched over the years.$6#$b#I can talk to them, hang out with them, and have meaningful relationships with them, just like how you would.$0",
  "Event.DatingStart.Katrielle4.01": "One of the things I found in the code is the ability to turn our relationship back down in the form of 'hearts.'$6#$b#This isn't a break-up or anything. Far from it, we will still be dating.$4#$b#But I'd like to live out a life with them, just for a little while.$0#$b#But in the end, I'll leave the decision to you.$0",
  "Event.DatingStart.Katrielle5.01": "$q 999944 null#So, how many hearts do you want to leave me with?#$r 999944 0 event_9_heart1#Zero hearts.#$r 999944 500 event_9_heart2#Two hearts.#$r 999944 1000 event_9_heart3#Four hearts.#$r 999944 1500 event_9_heart4#Six hearts.#$r 999944 2250 event_9_heart5#Leave it alone.",
  "Event.DatingStart.Katrielle5.02": "$q 999944 null#So, how many hearts do you want to leave me with?#$r 999944 0 event_9_heart1#Zero hearts.#$r 999944 500 event_9_heart2#Two hearts.#$r 999944 1000 event_9_heart3#Four hearts.#$r 999944 1500 event_9_heart4#Six hearts.#$r 999944 2500 event_9_heart5#Leave it alone.",
  "Event.DatingStart.Katrielle6.01": "And it's done.$0#$b#I'll see you around, @.$8",
  
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Clint1.01": "Hey. Need any geodes to be cracked open?$0",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Clint2.01": "Give me a second, I need to get my hammer.$0",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Clint3.01": "Urm... What was that?$4",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Clint4.01": "Hello? Is anyone there?$4",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Clint5.01": "Anyone here?$4#$b#...$0",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Clint6.01": "What was that?$4",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Fork.01": "...Was it a ghost?#Katrielle, stop it!#I didn't see anything.#Katrielle is playing a prank on you.",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Fork1.Clint1.01": "What the-$4",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Fork1.Katrielle1.01": "Hey @!$1",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Fork1.Clint2.01": "What are you doing?! You gave me a heart attack!$3",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Fork1.Katrielle2.01": "I was bored, and I wanted to do something funny.$0",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Fork1.Katrielle3.01": "...But judging by @'s expression, I went a little too far, didn't I?$6#$b#...I'm sorry, Clint.$2",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Fork1.Clint3.01": "*sigh* It's fine... Katrielle, right?$2#$b#Today's a slow day anyway, so I don't mind the prank too much.$0#$b#Thanks for making things a little bit more interesting today.$1#$b#...But please don't do that again.$2",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Fork1.End.Katrielle.01": "Well, it was fun pranking Clint, huh?$1#$e#You know, truth be told, I did want to do it because I thought it'd be funny.$0#$b#But I could tell from your expression that wasn't a good thing for me to do.$2#$b#Don't worry, I'll save the pranks for you next time, @.$8",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Fork2.Clint1.01": "I... okay, if you say so, @.$2#$b#But I could have sworn-",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Fork2.Katrielle1.01": "Boo!",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Fork2.Clint2.01": "Augh!",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Fork2.Katrielle2.01": "Hehehe...$1#$b#Hey @! That was perfect!$0",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Fork2.Clint3.01": "What the-$4#$b#Grrr... Both of you, get out!$3",
  "Event.Dating.2Heart.Fork2.End.Katrielle.01": "Well, it was fun pranking Clint, huh?$1#$e#You know, truth be told, I wanted to do it because he annoyed me.$5#$b#Don't worry, next time I'll save the pranks for you, @.$1",

  "Event.Dating.4Heart.Abigail1.01": "We've been trying to tell you this whole time! How haven't you met her yet?$3",
  "Event.Dating.4Heart.Sam1.01": "What do you expect from me?! I haven't even seen her yet!$2",
  "Event.Dating.4Heart.Sebastian1.01": "It's already been a while since she moved in.$0#$b#She's been walking around, including right in front of your house.$0",
  "Event.Dating.4Heart.Sebastian2.01": "(...Why is he the only one that can't see her...? Something to do with ghosts?)$0#$b#(...Nah.)$1",
  "Event.Dating.4Heart.Abigail2.01": "*sigh* Look, let me just-$5",
  "Event.Dating.4Heart.Abigail3.01": "Sorry about this, Kat. I just need to prove a point.$3",
  "Event.Dating.4Heart.Katrielle1.01": "Agh!$3",
  "Event.Dating.4Heart.Sam2.01": "...Am I supposed to be looking at something?$2",
  "Event.Dating.4Heart.Abigail4.01": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAGH!",
  "Event.Dating.4Heart.Sebastian3.01": "Sam...",
  "Event.Dating.4Heart.Katrielle2.01": "...Is the coast clear?$6",
  "Event.Dating.4Heart.Katrielle3.01": "I think I overreacted a bit. I'm sorry.$2#$b#I... I wanted to let you know, I don't have any feelings towards Sam anymore, I think.$6#$b#I was just so shocked, and... I guess I didn't know what to do in the moment.$2#$b#I promise you that you don't have anything to worry about, @.$0#$b#After all, he still can't see me for whatever reason. And I don't feel like finding out why anymore.$13#$b#And I have you, @.$8#$b#I hope you aren't mad at me.$0",
  "Event.Dating.4Heart.Fork.01": "...Right?#I'm not mad at you.#Are you cheating on me?#I trust you. I don't have any reason to be worried.#Everyone has a past.",
  "Event.Dating.4Heart.Katrielle4.01": "...Right!$0#$b#Thanks for understanding, @!$1#$b#...Oh, you can't see anything?$0#$b#...I might have broke something when I was running that fast and jumping into the water.$2#$b#Umm... Let me take care of that...$6#$b#...And, boop!$1",
  "Event.Dating.4Heart.Katrielle4.02": "!?$3#$b#...Oh, okay.$2#$b#...I'm sorry that I liked the guy before I met you.$2#$b#And I'm sorry that I never had any closure to that, only made more complicated by the fact that he literally can't see me.$5#$b#And I'm sorry that, with that lack of closure, I decided to go along with you in a relationship.$5#$b#I'll try to walk on eggshells better, just for you.$5#$b#...You're such an insecure jerk, @.$5",
  "Event.Dating.4Heart.Katrielle5.01": "I haven't cheated on you, @.$2#$b#I wouldn't ever do that to you. Even if you are being an absolute tool about it.$2#$b#I just thought you trusted me to do the right thing.$2#$b#...I just want to forget about today, I still can't believe-$2#$b#Whatever, I just want to get out of here.$5",
  
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Katrielle1.01": "She should be coming out soon...$0",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Leah1.01": "Oh, you two scared me!$6#$b#But hey, @! And you're... Katrielle, right?$0#$b#I've been meaning to meet you for a while now.$0",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Katrielle2.01": "Yeah, same here! I knew you were coming out around now, so I wanted to stop by and say hi!$1",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Leah2.01": "Yeah... Hm.$3#$b#Well @, you're here to chat too, right? I guess I can take a break from working on my sculptures.$0",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Katrielle3.01": "Yeah! You're an artist, right? I love the sculptures you've made, they look really cool!$1",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Leah3.01": "Did... Did I ever show you my sculptures?$2",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Katrielle4.01": "I'm pretty sure I've seen them around.$6#$b#Right, @?$0",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork.01": "...#I showed her the sculpture you made, Leah.#(Stay silent.)",
  //Fork1
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork1.Leah1.01": "Oh! I see. I'm glad to see I have another fan!$1#$b#...Though @, I felt like it was a personal gift, you know?$2",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork1.Katrielle1.01": "(...@?)$6#$b#(...I'm saying too much, aren't I? Okay.)$2",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork1.Katrielle2.01": "*ahem* I-it was really nice though!$0#$b#I hope I get to see more of your art soon!$1",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork1.Leah2.01": "Mhmm!$1#$b#Maybe one day in the future, I'll show you my portfolio.$0",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork1.Katrielle3.01": "Awesome! I look forward to it!$1",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork1.Leah3.01": "Hey, @, mind if I ask you something really quickly?$0#$b#It's a little personal.$3",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork1.Katrielle4.01": "Oh right, sorry!$3",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork1.Leah4.01": "I'm... a little worried about her. There's something about her that I can't trust.$2#$b#She seems like she knows too much, you know?$3#$b#But, you're dating her, and you seem like a good judge of who someone is.$0#$b#Do you mind sticking around while we hang out?$0",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork1.Narration1.01": "Keeping an eye out for Katrielle, the three of you chatted near the lake, and the hangout passed without incident...",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork1.End.Katrielle.01": "Thanks for covering my back, @.$0#$b#It's kinda hard to small talk with people when I know so much about them.$6#$b#I didn't even realize what I was saying was weird!$3#$b#I learned a lot though.$0",
  //Fork2
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork2.Katrielle1.01": "Well, yeah, I remember @ showing me your sculpture, and I vaguely remember you and @ talking about it.$0#$b#Something about revealing the essence of the wood, right?$1",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork2.Leah1.01": "What!?$6#$b#I... I'm sorry, were you eavesdropping on us?$5",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork2.Katrielle2.01": "No, no! I was...$3#$b#I was...$2",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork2.Leah2.01": "What, do you have nothing to say?$5#$b#Ugh. Y'know, this stuff is exactly what I was telling @ when-$5",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork2.Leah3.01": "@. Thanks for trying to introduce us.$3#$b#But, Katrielle is reminding me too much of *him*.$2^But, Katrielle is reminding me too much of *her*.$5",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork2.Leah4.01": "I'm gonna stay at home today. Katrielle, please leave me alone.$2",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork2.Katrielle3.01": "I said too much, didn't I?$2#$b#I... I'll do something to apologize.$2",
  "Event.Dating.6Heart.Fork2.Katrielle4.01": "This is so frustrating, meeting people is so hard when I know so much about them.$2#$b#Man... I-$2",

  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Robin1.01": "Hi there, @, Katrielle! Good to see you both.$4",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Katrielle1.01": "Hi!",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Katrielle2.01": "Hey @, I’m gonna go chat with Sebastian for a bit. I’ll say hi to him for you!$1",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Robin2.01": "I’ll lead you down there. I know Sebby's not too keen on having visitors barging into his room.$0",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Demetrius1.01": "Excuse me, @. May I ask you a few questions?$0",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Demetrius2.01": "My questions are in regards to Katrielle.$0#$b#Normally, I would refrain from expressing too much intrigue towards things other than my research.$3#$b#However, I feel that she may provide some key insights towards transporting matter between locations, seemingly remotely and...$0#$b#Is she in possession of a teleportation device of some kind?$0#$b#To my understanding, she is capable of performing instantaneous reduction and reconstruction of her physical being, without suffering from any notable side-effects.$3#$b#Further, as I observed, the flash of light that is emitted from performing teleportation may be a consequence of the amount of energy required to-$3",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Demetrius3.01": "Oh, my apologies, I might have been going on for a bit too long.$2",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Fork.01": "In short, how does Katrielle manage to accomplish her teleportation?#She glitches through space.#Why don’t you ask her yourself?#Her molecules are very wiggly.#She moves to places by thinking really hard about it.",
  //Fork1
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Fork1.Demetrius1.01": "Ah, remarkable if that is to be the case! Though, I must say, that does deviate from my running hypothesis.$0#$b#And further, I have a hard time believing the validity of your claim.$0",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Fork1.Demetrius2.01": "I will need to consult with some of the peer-reviewed studies on the topic of quantum transportation, and I may ask you some further questions about her afterwards.$0",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Fork1.Demetrius3.01": "Regardless, I’m sure it must be convenient for you to be in a romantic relationship with a person who has Katrielle’s capabilities.$0#$b#I’m sure it must be one of the reasons why you wished to court her.$0",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Fork1.Robin1.01": "Honey, I don’t think convenience is the only thing out of a relationship.$5#$b#Besides, it’s romance after all. I don’t think you should ever question why people get together in the first place.$4",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Fork1.Demetrius4.01": "Hm? I disagree. I think understanding the reasons for being involved with someone is very important.$3#$b#I make sure to always question why I am still with you, dear.$0",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Fork1.Demetrius5.01": "Your aptitude for being a carpenter allows for a very steady income in a place like Pelican Town, and we have been able to raise our daughter to be very bright.$0#$b#Wouldn’t you say those reasons are valid for our relationship?$1",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Fork1.Robin2.01": "...$6#$b#Right...$6",
  //Fork2
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Fork2.Demetrius1.01": "I haven’t had an opportunity to speak to her as of yet.$0#$b#Well... Hmmm...$3",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Fork2.Demetrius2.01": "Do you think you can ask for her to come here?$3#$b#I would prefer to talk to her in the comfort of my living room rather than that musty basement.$0",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Fork2.Demetrius3.01": "Robin, can you ask Katrielle to come here?$0",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Fork2.Robin1.01": "She’s a little busy chatting with Sebastian.$0",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Fork2.Demetrius4.01": "Mmm, I understand.$5",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Fork2.Demetrius5.01": "Perhaps I’ll ask her later.$0",
  //Forks converge here
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Katrielle3.01": "Alright, see you later Sebastian!$1",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Katrielle4.01": "Hey, @. So I wanted to ask Sebastian about something with his old computer, and I wanna test it out.$0#$b#Wanna tag along?$1",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Demetrius4.01": "Excuse me, Katrielle-$6",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Message1.01": "Katrielle: ...alright, and let me switch over to this viewport. Yeah, we were just there, right?",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Message2.01": "Katrielle: So, Sebastian showed me how to access the console for his computer. Before, I would kinda just know how to do things like reaching into the code myself and messing around by trial and error, but now? It's all laid out so cleanly here! Apparently, we can alter everything we can see on our screen. Like for example, we can move Demetrius over there!",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Message3.01": "Katrielle: We can also throw items through here! Let’s see, I have a Holly here, I can just-",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Message4.01": "Katrielle: And there it is, isn’t that cool? Too bad I can’t get it back, but it’s crazy that I can do that. You should try something too!",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.Message5.01": "Katrielle: Wait, don’t touch the Skip button, that’ll-",
  "Event.Dating.8Heart.End.Demetrius.01": "Hey, @. I woke up on the floor of my lab.$2#$b#There was a sample of Holly next to me, and I promptly disposed of it.$2#$e#I could have sworn you visited, but I believe I have just imagined it.$5#$b#Goes to show the importance of personal protective equipment!$1",
  
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle1.01": "@! Don't freak out!$17",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle2.01": "@, I wanted to show this to you for a while now.$6#$b#This is the void.$0#$b#...Well, I cleaned it up a little bit, so it looks more like the night sky to you.$1#$b#But trust me, it's the void.$0",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle3.01": "This is a special place to me. I've refrained from showing you this place for, frankly, too many reasons.$6",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle4.01": "But, you've done so much for me, you know that?$6",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle4.02": "But, you've done so much for me, you know that?$4",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle5.01": "Thanks to you, you shown me that it's better if I just stay hidden away from everyone.$0#$b#I mean, who cares if they can see me now? They don't need to actually talk to me, right?$13 And you don't really have to either, you know?$13#$b#...$2",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle5.02": "Without exaggeration, you've changed my life completely.$4#$b#Thanks to you, I've became friends with everyone, or at least most of everyone.$8#$b#You showed me a life beyond the abyss, beyond the code I've been stuck in for so, *so* very long.$4#$b#You've visited me and talked to me, even when I'm so far out of the way or out at odd hours.$8#$b#You've given me gifts no one in their right mind would gladly accept.$1#$b#You've sat through every single event, and you've accepted me without any unfair judgment.$8#$b#You even endured every single inane rambling piece of dialogue I could have ever thrown at you!$3#$b#You're just so...$13",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle5.03": "Without exaggeration, you've changed my life completely.$4#$b#Thanks to you, I've became friends with everyone, or at least some of everyone.$8#$b#You showed me a life beyond the abyss, beyond the code I've been stuck in for so, *so* very long.$4#$b#You've visited me and talked to me, even when I'm so far out of the way or out at odd hours.$8#$b#You've given me gifts no one in their right mind would gladly accept.$1#$b#You even endured every single inane rambling piece of dialogue I could have ever thrown at you!$3#$b#Why would you want to put up with something like that?$13#$b#You're...$13",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle5.04": "I mean, thanks to you, I'll be revealing myself to everyone in town, and I'm, for a lack of better terms, terrified.$3#$b#But I can hold my head up, with your hand in mine, and march to the beginning of a new chapter.$1#$b#...If you're okay with me holding your hand, of course.$8",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle5.05": "Well, I suppose you could have done more...$2#$b#But it's okay. I don't expect you to fix every single problem that I have.$0#$b#There are some personal demons I have that I will need to contend with one day, but that doesn't have to be today.$0",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle6.01": "Agh!",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle7.01": "Why do you even care, @? Am I that special to you?$13",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle8.01": "The time getting to know you has been so terrifying.$3#$b#My life has been turned completely upside down because of you!$5#$b#And right here, right now is the scariest moment of them all.$3#$b#More than the first time being noticed.$3#$b#More than fighting with Haley.$3#$b#And even more than meeting the town for the first time.$3#$b#It's because...$8",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle8.02": "The time getting to know you has been so terrifying.$3#$b#My life has been turned completely upside down because of you!$5#$b#And right here, right now is the scariest moment of them all.$3#$b#More than the first time being noticed.$3#$b#And even more than meeting the town for the first time.$3#$b#It's because...$8",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle9.01": "It's because of you!$4#$b#I love you, @!$4#$b#I love you so much, and I don't know how else to express it.$4#$b#I'm so happy to have you here, to be with you as your partner!$8#$b#And I *never* want that to change, ever.$4#$b#I want you more than anything else in the void and beyond!$4",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle9.02": "It's because of you.$4#$b#I think I love you, @.$8#$b#I feel so happy that you're here with me, and I wouldn't want that to change.$4",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle10.01": "Close your eyes. I want to show you something.$0",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle10.02": "Hehe... @, you're very warm. But I don't mind.$8#$b#...Hey @? Close your eyes. I want to show you something.$4",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle10.03": "...Hey @? Close your eyes. I want to show you something.$4",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle10.04": "Close your eyes. I want to show you something.$8",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle11.01": "Hold me, @.$4",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle11.02": "@... Isn't the void nice?$6#$b#Nothing to hurt you at all...$13#$b#Nothing...$2",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle11.03": "You know, there's nothing else here but the void.$0#$b#No one can see us, and we're all alone.$8#$b#@... Kiss me.$4",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle11.04": "Kiss me, @.$4",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle12.01": "O-oh, it's getting cold. Maybe you should leave.$2#$b#I'll see you later, @.$0#$b#Oh, and I...$8#$b#I love...$8#$b#On second thought, never mind. It was nice having you over.$13",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle12.02": "Stay with me, just for tonight...$4",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle12.03": "I love you, @. Thank you for being here.$4#$b#You can stay if you'd like...$8",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle12.04": "You're too warm... We can stop hugging now.$8#$b#Oh, and @?$0#$b#I love you, by the way.$4",
  "Event.10Heart.Narration1.01": "You stayed with Katrielle for a little while before leaving...",
  "Event.10Heart.Narration1.02": "You stayed with Katrielle for a long, *long* while...",
  "Event.10Heart.Narration1.03": "You stayed with Katrielle for a long while...",
  "Event.10Heart.Katrielle13.01": "Thanks for stopping by.$4#$b#I'll see you around.$4",
  
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle1.01": "...almost...$6",
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle2.01": "...is all...$6",
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle3.01": "...should be fine but...$6",
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle4.01": "Everything... set up and ready to...$6",
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle5.01": "Just time to wait... @...$6",
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle6.01": "The two switches is in place and will never...$6",
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle7.01": "Well, here goes nothing.$0",
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle8.01": "Hey!",
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle9.01": "C'mere, the nighttime view is nice, and I wanna spend some time with you.$1",
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle10.01": "Thanks for stopping by, @.$0",
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle11.01": "It's been a little while since I've last watched the ocean over the midnight horizon.$0#$b#It's really nice.$8",
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle12.01": "It's nice to see it with you, @.$4#$b#I still have a lot to say, but...$6",
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle13.01": "Let's just enjoy our time together.$0",
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle14.01": "...$8",
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle15.01": "...This cutscene, it's supposed to be the finale.$6#$b#Sure, there's other cutscenes, but this is what's meant to be our last hangout.$6",
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle16.01": "Heh, I love you, @.$4#$b#I'm happy you're still here with me.$4",
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle17.01": "All things have to come to an end, but I don't want it to.$2#$b#But, I'll leave it to you when we head back home.$0",
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle18.01": "So, I have a little secret. I made this cutscene endless.$0#$b#We can stay here and relax as long as you like.$1",
  "Event.14Heart.Katrielle19.01": "Well, actually, I'm not sure if our time's endless or if the world will end.$0#$b#I guess we'll find out soon!$1#$b#...But here, let me do this first.$0",

  "Event.BadEnd.Narration1.01": "(It doesn't seem like Katrielle is here...)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration1.02": "(It doesn't seem like Katrielle is here. Not that it matters, since you have a feeling she would be glitching out today...)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration2.01": "(Maybe it might be worth coming back here another day...?)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration3.01": "(It still doesn't seem like Katrielle is here. Maybe if you come back, you'll be able to talk to her...)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration3.02": "(It still doesn't seem like Katrielle is here. Maybe if you come back, you'll be able to talk to her. Even if she was here, you wouldn't be able to understand her...)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration4.01": "(You know that Katrielle is here, but you don't see her anywhere... Is it still worth coming here?)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration4.02": "(You know that Katrielle is here, but you don't see her anywhere... Is it still worth coming here? Maybe on a day where she wouldn't be glitching out...)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration5.01": "(Despite coming here four times now, Katrielle isn't here... Where has she gone?)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Question1.01": "...#Katrielle, where are you!?#Katrielle, I'm sorry for saying that Pelican Town wasn't worth it.#You deserve to be alone if this is how you're treating me.#(Stay silent.)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration6.01": "(You hear nothing but the silence of the void...)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration6.02": "(You hear nothing but the static of the void...)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration7.01": "This isn't worth it anymore. Katrielle isn't worth it, there isn't any reason to bother coming here.",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration7.02": "Dhbj mdy'd pfzxs md tegqzci. Drbvtppve zar'e gokkp te, tavzi twx'm irj voalfv ez lomymv nswigx lpci.",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration8.01": "You decide that it's time to leave. No one's here, and no one is ever going to be here.",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration8.02": "Ion lintho myix tx's kqqp xy evizp. Xo fvi'd rekv, lyh nh wrp mc xmmv rssnz bs mi hxim.",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration9.01": "Why did you come back here? The void has always been this empty. And besides, Katrielle doesn't want to be friends with anyone.",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration9.02": "Ghr lmo cyu twqp fkcd picp? Tav zzth htj ewheis smiy xril mqaec. Tel mpwsdxj, Vlxbixcti ososg'b hlrd mf fp jbixelw hmdh rvczyi.",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration10.01": "And that includes you. You already realized that Katrielle just wants to be left alone. She doesn't need you to always come over anymore.",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration10.02": "Knw blle snvcchpd ion. Czf klkvihj voaezhio xram Seecmolev nfdx wtebw es bx tiqe klhem. Dlo wfmwy'x nxvl jzy th iphlcc vfui zzor rvcxzvo.",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration11.01": "It's time to go home. Everyone else in Pelican Town are probably missing you.",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration11.02": "St'j xtxi th os sswe. Mzpccynx mpdp sn Gmptnex Mfer lvo iiwflmpi fzawtyk yhl.",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration12.01": "You have your life, and Katrielle isn't a part of it.",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration12.02": "Ion pegp ioni ptqi, tel Vlxbixcti twx'm i alvd hw me.",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration13.01": "Go home...",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration13.02": "Qo ywqp...",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration14.01": "(The room is still empty.)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration15.01": "(The cookies and the coffee doesn't seem to have been touched.)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration16.01": "(The bed doesn't seem any different from the other times you were here, and the decorations on the walls appear the same as they have always been.)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration17.01": "(Is Katrielle really gone? After she said she would still be your friend...?)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration18.01": "(After coming here on seven different days, you refuse to believe it...)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration19.01": "(You look at Katrielle's computer. The computer has been shut off. You never remember seeing it be turned off.)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration20.01": "(Katrielle's guitar... When does she play her guitar? It's still a nice guitar, even though you're sure you've seen it before.)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration21.01": "(This is where Katrielle would have been glitching on the 21st of each season, right? Where in the world is she...?)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration22.01": "(Where in the void is she...?)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration23.01": "(Her diary entries don't seem to have changed at all. You were hoping to see something about what happened at the saloon or about yourself.)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration24.01": "(There is nothing noteable inside the trash bin.)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration25.01": "(You never noticed how still the air is inside Katrielle's house.)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration26.01": "(Does Katrielle even like these? You aren't sure.)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration27.01": "(Maybe you shouldn't have said what you said to Katrielle, but it was just one time. Did she really take it that badly?)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration28.01": "(Katrielle should try getting more furniture...)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration29.01": "(Last you remember, she had a wiki page open for a game, detailing everything. If only you could use a wiki page to see Katrielle now...)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration30.01": "(Something is telling you that you won't ever hear her play the guitar...)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration31.01": "(...Are you starting to walk around in circles? How do you get out of here?)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration32.01": "(Reading through the pages of her diary gave you some insight of who Katrielle is as a person and what she would want.)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration33.01": "(Did she want this? To be left alone like this? You can still be her friend, right...?)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration34.01": "(At least this trash can isn't in the way of her house.)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration35.01": "(...Why are you looking into Katrielle's house again? She still isn't here.)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration36.01": "(There's nothing on this table, no matter how many times you look...)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration37.01": "(You already searched every nook and cranny of her bed...)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration38.01": "(She's not gonna come waltzing in. There's no way she'd walk outside after what happened in the saloon.)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration39.01": "(Should you turn on Katrielle's computer? You don't think you'd find anything useful.)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration40.01": "(...Wait, is she here? Is she avoiding you!?)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration41.01": "(If only Katrielle would just appear in front of you, right now...)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration42.01": "(Maybe there's a way to see her...)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration43.01": "(Think, how can you get out of here?)",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration44.01": "...",
  "Event.BadEnd.Question2.01": "...#Katrielle, I know you can hear me.#You need to let me out of here.#I'm worried about you, and I just want to talk.#Please, Katrielle.#...",
  "Event.BadEnd.Narration45.01": "(You need to find a way out of here.)",
  //If visiting on a day when she's controlling the cutscene and glitching out
  "Event.BadEnd.Katrielle1.01": "...!?$10#$b#...Kpij jyugu sfe...$7#$b#S'f asccc...$7",
  "Event.BadEnd.End.Narration.01": "(...Katrielle has been hiding from you, but you figured it out. You don't think she'll be hiding next time you come here...)",

  "Event.BadEndFinale.Question1.01": "$q 999841 null#...#$r 999841 0 event_bad1_heart1#Katrielle, I'm so glad I found you.#$r 999841 0 event_bad1_heart2#Why are you avoiding me?#$r 999841 0 event_bad1_heart3#Why are you avoiding me too?#$r 999841 0 event_bad1_heart4#You hurt me, Katrielle.",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Katrielle1.01": "@, you're my friend.$13#$b#My wonderful friend that I trust and care for...$2#$b#My wonderful friend that I almost threw into an permanent loop...$2",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Katrielle1.02": "@, I care about you a lot...$13#$b#And I trust you...$13#$b#That's why I almost threw you into a permanent loop...$2#$b#But...$2#$b#@, I'm breaking up with you. I don't think I can be your girlfriend.$2#$b#I believe you can find someone that can love you, and won't hurt you.$13#$b#And I don't want to be with someone to tell me things that hurt me...$2#$b#I'm sorry.$2",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Katrielle1.03": "@, I care about you a lot...$13#$b#And I trust you...$13#$b#That's why I almost threw you into a permanent loop...$2#$b#But...$2#$b#@, I'm breaking up with you. I don't think I can be your wife.$2#$b#You need someone who doesn't do this to you. You need someone that doesn't hurt you like this.$2#$b##...And I need that too, no matter how much I love you, @.$2#$b#I'm sorry, @. That decision is final.$2",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Katrielle1.04": "@, you're my friend.$13#$b#My wonderful friend that I trust and care for...$2#$b#My wonderful friend that I ran away from time and time again...$2",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Katrielle1.05": "@, I care about you a lot...$13#$b#And I trust you...$13#$b#That's why I ran away from time and time again...$2#$b#But...$2#$b#@, I'm breaking up with you. I don't think I can be your girlfriend.$2#$b#I believe you can find someone that can love you, and won't hurt you.$13#$b#And I don't want to be with someone to tell me things that hurt me...$2#$b#I'm sorry.$2",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Katrielle1.06": "@, I care about you a lot...$13#$b#And I trust you...$13#$b#That's why I ran away from time and time again...$2#$b#But...$2#$b#@, I'm breaking up with you. I don't think I can be your wife.$2#$b#You need someone who doesn't do this to you. You need someone that doesn't hurt you like this.$2#$b##...And I need that too, no matter how much I love you, @.$2#$b#I'm sorry, @. That decision is final.$2",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Question2.01": "$q 999842 null#...#$r 999842 50 event_bad2_heart1#You *are* still my friend.#$r 999842 0 event_bad2_heart2#I was hoping for something more, actually...#$r 999842 0 event_bad2_heart3#Then why? Why hide from your 'friend' like that?#$r 999842 -250 event_bad2_heart4#Do you really think we're still friends after this?",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Question2.02": "$q 999842 null#...#$r 999842 50 event_bad2_heart1#We can still be friends, right?#$r 999842 0 event_bad2_heart5#Is there really nothing I can do to be with you?#$r 999842 0 event_bad2_heart3#Then why? Why hide from me like that?#$r 999842 -250 event_bad2_heart4#Do you really think we're still 'anything' after this?",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Question2.03": "$q 999842 null#...#$r 999842 50 event_bad2_heart6#We can still be friends, right?#$r 999842 0 event_bad2_heart5#Is there really nothing I can do to be with you?#$r 999842 0 event_bad2_heart3#Then why? Why hide from me like that?#$r 999842 -250 event_bad2_heart4#Do you really think we're still 'anything' after this?",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Katrielle2.01": "*sob*...",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Katrielle3.01": "...$7#$b#...So, what now?$7",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Question3.01": "$q 999843 null#...So, now what?#$r 999843 50 event_bad3_heart1#I'll visit you as normal, and we'll just be good friends.#$r 999843 25 event_bad3_heart2#We can pretend this never happened.#$r 999843 0 event_bad3_heart3#I don't know. I have to think about things.#$r 999843 -500 event_bad3_heart4#Don't be surprised if I stop talking to you.",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Question3.02": "$q 999843 null#...So, now what?#$r 999843 50 event_bad3_heart5#I'll visit you as normal, and we'll just be friends.#$r 999843 25 event_bad3_heart5#We can pretend this never happened.#$r 999843 0 event_bad3_heart3#I don't know. I have to think about things.#$r 999843 -500 event_bad3_heart4#Don't be surprised if I stop talking to you.",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Katrielle4.01": "...I won't touch the code like this anymore.$2#$b#I'm sorry that I tried to throw you in that eternal loop.$2#$b#I think that was my way trying to keep you out, but the more I think about it, it just feels... sickening.$2#$b#Sickening that I did that to someone I cared about.$2#$b#This is why you didn't want me to get close to everyone in Pelican Town, wasn't it?$13#$b#This ability over others isn't a good thing.$13#$b#You shown me that, @.$13#$b#That's as far as I believe what you wanted me to do.$2",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Katrielle4.02": "...I won't touch the code like this anymore.$2#$b#I'm sorry that I tried to trick you into thinking I wasn't here.$2#$b#I think that was my way trying to keep you out, but the more I think about it, it just feels... sickening.$2#$b#Sickening that I did that to someone I cared about.$2#$b#This is why you didn't want me to get close to everyone in Pelican Town, wasn't it?$13#$b#This ability over others isn't a good thing.$13#$b#You shown me that, @.$13#$b#That's as far as I believe what you wanted me to do.$2",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Katrielle5.01": "Regardless what you want to do with me, if you ever chat with me again, I'll try to treat it like nothing ever happened.$2#$b#*Try* being the operative word.$13#$b#I'm never walking out there ever again.$2",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Katrielle6.01": "You should get going, @.$2",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Katrielle7.01": "...Take care, @.$13",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Narration1.01": "(You leave Katrielle's house. Things will be different from now on...)",
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Narration1.02": "(You leave Katrielle's house. With Katrielle breaking up with you, things will be different from now on...)",
  //If attempting to trigger the cutscene on a glitch day
  "Event.BadEndFinale.Extra.Narration1.01": "(...No one's here. Today's the 21st of the season, so Katrielle wouldn't be able to speak clearly. Maybe it would be worthwhile to come back here tomorrow...)",

  "Event.Divorce1.Katrielle1.01": "@.$2",
  "Event.Divorce1.Katrielle2.01": "...Really?$2#$b#Well, I can't say that I'm surprised.$2#$b#I know the power, @. I know how it feels to try and do things to see what happens.$2#$b#But still, I never thought I'd be on the receiving end.$2#$b#*sigh*...You're such a disappointment, @.$2",
  "Event.Divorce1.Katrielle3.01": "Well, goodbye, @. Hope to never see you again.$2",
  "Event.Divorce1.Narration1.01": "Katrielle disappeared before your very eyes...",

  "Wedding.Utility.cs.5367.01": "When @ first arrived in Pelican Town, no one knew if they'd fit in with our community...#$b#But from this day forward, @ is going to be as much a part of this town as any of us!$h#$b#It is my great honor on this day {0} of {1}, to unite @ and...?#$b#Umm... I'm sorry, but what is your name again?$s",
  "Wedding.Utility.cs.5367.02": "When @ first arrived in Pelican Town, no one knew if they'd fit in with our community...#$b#But from this day forward, @ is going to be as much a part of this town as any of us!$h#$b#It is my great honor on this day {0} of {1}, to unite @ and...?#$b#@, where is your spouse?$s",
  "Wedding.Utility.cs.5367.03": "When Katrielle and @ first arrived in Pelican Town, no one knew if they'd fit in with our community...#$b#But from this day forward, Katrielle and @ are going to be as much a part of this town as any of us!$h#$b#It is my great honor on this day {0} of {1}, to unite @ and Katrielle in the bonds of marriage.",
  "Wedding.Utility.cs.5369.01": "When @ first arrived in Pelican Town, no one knew if they'd fit in with our community...#$b#But from this day forward, @ is going to be as much a part of this town as any of us!$h#$b#It is my great honor on this day {0} of {1}, to unite @ and...?#$b#Umm... I'm sorry, but what is your name again?$s",
  "Wedding.Utility.cs.5369.02": "When @ first arrived in Pelican Town, no one knew if they'd fit in with our community...#$b#But from this day forward, @ is going to be as much a part of this town as any of us!$h#$b#It is my great honor on this day {0} of {1}, to unite @ and...?#$b#@, where is your spouse?$s",
  "Wedding.Utility.cs.5369.03": "When Katrielle and @ first arrived in Pelican Town, no one knew if they'd fit in with our community...#$b#But from this day forward, Katrielle and @ are going to be as much a part of this town as any of us!$h#$b#It is my great honor on this day {0} of {1}, to unite @ and Katrielle in the bonds of marriage.",
  "Wedding.Utility.cs.5370.01": "Katrielle? Okay! Well, let's get right to it!",
  "Wedding.Utility.cs.5370.02": "I guess we can get right to it...?$5",
  "Wedding.Utility.cs.5371.01": "@... Katrielle... #$b# As the mayor of Pelican Town, and regional bearer of the matrimonial seal, I now pronounce you husband and wife!$h",
  "Wedding.Utility.cs.5371.02": "@... $s#$b# As the mayor of... Pelican Town, and regional bearer of the matrimonial... seal, I now pronounce you married...?$s",
  "Wedding.Utility.cs.5373.01": "@... $s#$b# As the mayor of... Pelican Town, and regional bearer of the matrimonial... seal, I now pronounce you married...?$s",
  "Wedding.Utility.cs.5375.01": "@... $s#$b# As the mayor of... Pelican Town, and regional bearer of the matrimonial... seal, I now pronounce you married...?$s",
  "Wedding.Utility.cs.5377.01": "@... Katrielle... #$b# As the mayor of Pelican Town, and regional bearer of the matrimonial seal, I now pronounce you wife and..., well, wife!$h",
  "Wedding.Utility.cs.5377.02": "@... $s#$b# As the mayor of... Pelican Town, and regional bearer of the matrimonial... seal, I now pronounce you married...?$s",
  "Wedding.Utility.cs.5379.01": "You may kiss.",
  "Wedding.Utility.cs.5379.02": "You may... kiss? $5",
  "Wedding.Utility.cs.5381.01": "Well, that was very embarrassing...",
  "Wedding.Utility.cs.5383.01": "...But nonetheless, the future looks bright!",
  "Wedding.Game1.cs.2782.01": "I suppose everyone can see me now, huh?$0#$b#I'll let it slide, since we *do* have a shared life to look forward to!$1",
  "Wedding.Game1.cs.2782.02": "S llxtzdi eovzczyi cte wpp we ewa, leh?$0#$b#S'ec ppe st jtmop, sbeki hi *wf* slzo t allcin ezni es lhfs qzvgaku xz!$1",
  "Wedding.Game1.cs.2782.03": "I told you, I wasn't going to go to the wedding.$6#$b#But we *are* married now, so at least we have a shared life to look forward to!$1",
  "Wedding.Game1.cs.2782.04": "S mfth jse, Z aldr't xwmyr do xw ez dhx eioomxg.$6#$b#Lum ei *ebe* ueccmod ewa, wy tk pplwd pv llgi a jpecph lbwm ez vohb jzcakrw bs!$1",
  "Wedding.Game1.cs.2782.05": "The wedding was wonderful... wasn't it, dear?$h#$e#Well, we can't forget about the farm... time to get to work.",
  "Wedding.Game1.cs.2782.06": "Dhx eioomxg niw hsxdxinyw... prar'e st, lilc?$h#$e#Geec, hp mag'b qzvqem ifzfx tav jlcq... bmxp do xmx es whis.",
  
  "Perfection.SummitEvent_Intro_Spouse.01": "Hey, @.",
  "Perfection.SummitEvent_Intro_Spouse.02": "Rer.",
  "Perfection.SummitEvent_Intro2_Spouse.01": "It's so beautiful up here...",
  "Perfection.SummitEvent_Intro2_Spouse.02": "St'j wz foankqjfw ep ymvp...",
  "Perfection.SummitEvent_Intro2_Spouse_Gruff.01": "Great view, huh?",
  "Perfection.SummitEvent_Intro2_Spouse_Gruff.02": "Qrxrb gtig, ycl?",
  "Perfection.SummitEvent_Dialogue1_Spouse.01": "I was just thinking about the last %year years...\"/pause 1000/speak spouse \"We've been through a lot together, haven't we?$h",
  "Perfection.SummitEvent_Dialogue1_Spouse.02": "S pra ufwd myqrvtrq tswye ser kqqp xygxkpic...\"/pause 1000/speak spouse \"Ge'mm mpix myzsfrl a cwx esqemymv, lkvxe'x hi?$h",
  "Perfection.SummitEvent_Dialogue2_Spouse.01": "...But look how far we've come.",
  "Perfection.SummitEvent_Dialogue2_Spouse.02": "...Scx wsyk ywa qeb pv'zp gymx.",
  "Perfection.SummitEvent_Dialogue3_Katrielle.01": "Without you here, who know what in the world would have happened to me.$0#$b#There's someone that never left my side, and there's someone I can rely on.$0\"/pause 500/speak Katrielle \"That person's you, @.$8#$b#It's just you.",
  "Perfection.SummitEvent_Dialogue3_Katrielle.02": "Gimywye cyu ymvp, ghh srzh ghtk my xre nwvwo goncl slzo arxtpyin mf qp.$0#$b#Dhxim'd wymxfvi elkt emzpc veyk qj wsdx, eyo dhxim'd wymxfvi T mag ziwj yn.$0\"/pause 500/speak Katrielle \"Dhtk tpcwyn'j czf.$8#$b#St'j nfdx yhl.",
  "Perfection.SummitEvent_Dialogue3_Katrielle.03": "Without you here, who know what in the world would have happened to me.$0#$b#I never would have met anyone, and they're all so wonderful. I'm really overjoyed to be a part of Pelican Town.$1#$b#And even more, I really do feel like I'm a part of Stardew Valley now.$8\"/pause 500/emote Katrielle 40/speak Katrielle \"But, there's someone that never left my side since the beginning, and there's someone I can truly rely on.$0\"/pause 500/speak Katrielle \"That person's you, @.$8#$b#It's just you.$4#$b#...I love you, @.$0",
  "Perfection.SummitEvent_Dialogue3_Katrielle.04": "Gimywye cyu ymvp, ghh srzh ghtk my xre nwvwo goncl slzo arxtpyin mf qp.$0#$b#S gvdic ayueu llgi mxk eyjsxe, iro xrer'zi lpv lf azyhorylt. T'w kvipwj yvxirsjph th ji l zakk sq Tolbtir Esgn.$1#$b#Knw mzpy wokv, T voaecg oz pexc ptvi I'd e aebt fn Deebdxn Zlwpoy ewa.$8\"/pause 500/emote Katrielle 40/speak Katrielle \"Lum, xspvo'l asxpsxe kpee rovxi ppqx mr amop cigtm esi bxxqrytrq, rvh elorx'a dzqoogv M nex micpj volr wr.$0\"/pause 500/speak Katrielle \"Dhtk tpcwyn'j czf.$8#$b#St'j nfdx yhl.$4#$b#...Z pzgi yhl.$0",

