/////////////////////////////////////

  "Event.Mod.Start.Katrielle1.01": "Hey, @, @!$3#$b#Now that I have settled in to being a resident of Pelican Town, I noticed that there's someone I have never met before!$3",
  "Event.Mod.Start.Katrielle2.01": "Well... I tried to look into the code, and I couldn't find anything. They don't exist as far as the code is concerned.$2#$b#But maybe they're someone like me. Then again, I have no issue of seeing information about my own existence.$9#$b#I thought maybe if I kept digging through the code, I'd find something, but I have a better idea.$0#$b#@, do you think you could introduce me to them?$0",
  "Event.Mod.Start.Katrielle3.01": "You will? Great!$1#$b#*sigh* This is the first time meeting someone that I have zero knowledge about.$2#$b#Even with you, I could tell that you're very different from everyone else. But this time, I have *nothing* to go off on.$2#$b#And I'm getting that same feeling I got back at the saloon.$2#$b#But if you're there, I'm sure everything will be alright.$1",
  "Event.Mod.Start.Narration1.01": "If you want to introduce Katrielle to someone, you'll have to get to know them yourself...",

  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.SydneyLex1.01": "Hey, @.$0#$b#I'm taking a break from surveying the ocean.$0#$b#So far, the marine fish population has been holding steady, which is a good sign for Gem Sea.$0",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Question1.01": "...?#Follow me, I want to introduce you to someone.#There is someone that wants to meet you. I think you two will get along.#One of my friends asked for me to introduce you to her.",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Question1.02": "...?#Follow me, I want to introduce you to someone.#There is someone that wants to meet you. I think you two will get along.#My girlfriend asked for me to introduce you to her.",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Question1.03": "...?#Follow me, I want to introduce you to someone.#There is someone that wants to meet you. I think you two will get along.#My wife asked for me to introduce you to her.",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.SydneyLex2.01": "Oh, okay.$0#$b#If you're friends with her, then sure!$1#$b#But where does she live? I don't recall anyone else living around here.$0",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.SydneyLex2.02": "Oh, okay.$0#$b#If she's your girlfriend, then sure!$1#$b#But where does she live? I don't recall anyone else living around here.$0",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.SydneyLex2.03": "Oh, okay.$0#$b#If she's your wife, then sure!$1#$b#So, where will we be meeting her?$0",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.SydneyLex3.01": "Were you always next to us, miss...$2",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Katrielle1.01": "Umm, yeah!$3#$b#Umm... My name is Katrielle, and you're Sydney, right?$0#$b#@ mentioned seeing you from time to time on their way to my house.$1",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.SydneyLex4.01": "Oh... you should have said something sooner.$2#$b#But, it's a pleasure to meet you Katrielle.$0",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Katrielle2.01": "Umm... yeah, likewise!$1#$b#So, uhh... hey, I overheard you were wondering where I live.$0",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Katrielle2.02": "Umm... yeah, likewise!$1#$b#So, uhh... I was going to pass by my old place, so we can hang out there to chat..$0",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Katrielle3.01": "And it's here! It's right this way!$1",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.SydneyLex5.01": "...This way? There's nothing there-$6",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.SydneyLex5.02": "...This way? Are we taking the boat there or-$6",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Katrielle4.01": "See? My home's just a little further out into the water.$0#$b#C'mon, I haven't had the chance to have house guests that weren't Abigail, @, and Sebastian.$0",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Fork.01": "...#Katrielle, we can hangout somewhere else for today.#Sydney, are you coming?#Katrielle, Sydney isn't feeling well.",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Fork.02": "...#Yeah, hurry up, Sydney.#Katrielle, let Sydney take her time.#Sydney, I can help you if it's too difficult.",
  //Fork 1A
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Fork1.Katrielle1.01": "...Did I say something wrong?$2",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Fork1.SydneyLex1.01": "No, not at all...$2#$b#But do you think we could raincheck for today? I'm sorry, it's nothing to do with you, Katrielle.$6",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Fork1.SydneyLex2.01": "We can talk another day, both of you. Okay?$0#$b#I'll see you two around.$2",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.End.Katrielle.01": "...I hope I didn't say anything bad.$2#$b#Judging by your expression, today ended as well as it could have. So, I think I'll just have to take it in stride.$0#$e#Phew, talking to someone new is so stressful.$1",
  //Fork 1B
//"Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Fork1.Katrielle1.01": "...Did I say something wrong?$2",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Fork1.SydneyLex1.02": "No, no, don't worry.$2#$b#I've done it once, and I can do it again.$6#$b#And there's no emergencies or anything, so it should be fine.",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Fork1.Katrielle2.01": "Here's the entrance to my house.$1#$b#@, Sydney, I'll see you inside.$0",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Fork1.SydneyLex2.02": "This... what is this?$15",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Fork1.SydneyLex3.01": "I'm on water, but this feels like solid ground.$15",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Fork1.Question1.01": "Who, or what is Katrielle?#You'll get used to it.#She's a 'glitch', but I don't think that means anything to you.#Let Katrielle explain it herself.#She's my friend, that's all you need to know.",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Fork1.Question1.02": "Who, or what is Katrielle?#You'll get used to it.#She's a 'glitch', but I don't think that means anything to you.#Let Katrielle explain it herself.#She's my girlfriend, that's all you need to know.",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Fork1.Question1.03": "Who, or what is Katrielle?#You'll get used to it.#She's a 'glitch', but I don't think that means anything to you.#Let Katrielle explain it herself.#She's my wife, that's all you need to know.",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Fork1.SydneyLex4.01": "...If you say so.$16#$b#As odd as this is, she seems alright.$0#$b#But I'm still not a fan of getting into her house.$2#$b#I think it's rude to keep her waiting. @?",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Fork1.End.SydneyLex.01": "Katrielle has been the most confusing person I've ever met.$0#$b#I can tell if she's nervous meeting me though.$0#$b#But after making me walk to her house, and seeing what's on the inside? *That's* nerve-wracking.$2#$e#She's okay though. Far too obsessive with other people, but okay.$0#$e#...@, I'm sorry. I'm not particularly interested in getting to know her further.$2#$b#Thanks for introducing us though.$0",
  //Fork 2
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.Fork2.SydneyLex1.01": "...I'm sorry, I'm gonna go back home. I'll talk to both of you another time.$5",
  "Event.Mod.SydneyLex.End.Katrielle.01": "...I hope I didn't say anything bad.$2#$b#Judging by your expression, today ended as well as it could have. So, I think I'll just have to take it in stride.$0#$e#Phew, talking to someone new is so stressful.$1",

}